<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अंहु
अंहु + .{@-हु@} <i>n.</i>
—1 Anxiety, distress; sin, crime (?).
—2 Pudendum Muliebre (?). [cf. L. <i>angustus, anxius</i>, Goth. <i>aggvus</i>].
