अग्निगर्भा
अग्निः + -गर्भ + .({@-र्भा@})
—1 N. of the Śamī plant as containing fire (the story of how Agni was
 discovered to exist in the interior of the Śamī plant is told in chap. 35
 of अनुशासनपर्व in Mb.).
—2 N. of the earth (अग्नेः सकाशात् गर्भो यस्यां सा; when the Ganges
 threw the semen of Śiva out on the Meru mountain, whatever on earth &c.
 was irradiated by its lustre, became gold and the earth was thence called वसुमती)
—3 N. of the plant महाज्योतिष्मती लता (अग्निरिव गर्भो मध्यभागो
 यस्याः सा) [Mar. मालकांगोणी]
