अग्निलोकः|अग्निलोक
अग्निः + -लोकः the world of Agni, which is situated below the summit of
 Meru; in the Purāṇas it is said to be in the अन्तरिक्ष, while in
 the Kāśī Khaṇḍa it is said to be to the south of इन्द्रपुरी; एतस्या
 दक्षिणे भागे येयं पूर्दृश्यते शुभा । इमामर्चिष्मतीं पश्य वीतिहोत्रपुरीं शुभाम् ॥
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0017-1" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

