अग्निहोत्रन्यायः|अग्निहोत्रन्याय
अग्निः + -होत्रम् + .({@-त्र@}) + ˚न्यायः The rule according to which the नित्यकर्मन्s
 (which are to be performed यावज्जीवम्) are performed at their stipulated
 or scheduled time only, during oneʼs life time. This is discussed and
 established by जैमिनि and शबर at Ms. 6. 2. 23-26 in connection
 with अग्निहोत्र and other कर्मन्s.
