अग्नायी
अग्नायी P. IV. 1. 37
—1 the wife of Agni and Goddess of Fire, Svāhā. She is said to be the daughter of
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0018-2" target="_blank">Page0018-2</a>]
 Dakṣa; she longed to be the wife of Agni, and Skanda was pleased to give
 her a place with Agni at every sacrificial act (हव्यं कव्यं च यत्किंचिद्
 द्विजानामथ संस्कृतम् । होष्यन्त्यग्नौ सदा देवि स्वाहेत्युक्त्वा समुद्घृतम्
 ॥ अद्य प्रभृति दास्यन्ति सुवृत्ताः सत्पथे स्थिताः । एवमग्निस्त्वया सार्धं
 सदा वत्स्यति शोभने).
—2 The Tretā age.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0018-1" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

