अचित्त
अचित्त <i>a.</i>
—1 Inconceivable.
—2 [नास्ति चित्तं यस्य] Destitute of intellect, senseless, stupid.
—3 Unnoticed, unexpected, not thought of.
—4 Without consciousness, inanimate, non-sentient. P. IV. 2. 47.
