अतिग्रहः|अतिग्रह
अतिग्रह + .{@-हः, -ग्राहः@}
—1 Object of an apprehensive organ, such as स्पर्श ‘touch’ the object
 of त्वच्, रस of जिह्वा &c. The <i>Grahas</i> are eight
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0041-1" target="_blank">Page0041-1</a>]
 in number; प्राण, वाच्, जिह्वा, चक्षुस्, श्रोत्र, मनस्, हस्तौ & त्वच्;
 the corresponding atigrāhas being अपान, नामन्, रस, रूप, शब्द,
 काम, कर्मन् & स्पर्श. अथ हैनं जारत्कारव आर्तभागः पप्रच्छ
 याज्ञवल्क्येति होवाच कति ग्रहाः कत्यतिग्रहा इति । अष्टौ ग्रहा अष्टावतिग्रहा
 इति Bṛ. Up. 3. 2. 1.
—2 Right knowledge, correct apprehension.
—3 Act of overtaking, surpassing &c.
—4 One who siezes or takes to a very great extent.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0040-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

