अद्रव|अद्रवः
अद्रव <i>a.</i> [न˚ त˚] Not liquid, not of the nature of a liquid.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0057-1" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अद्रवः|अद्रव
अद्रव + .{@-वः@} Not a liquid.
