अधीर|अधीरः
अधीर <i>a.</i>
—1 Not bold, timid.
—2 Confused, lacking self-command, excited, excitable.
—3 Fitful, capricious.
—4 Unsteady, not fixed, tremulous, rolling; ˚विप्रेक्षितमायताक्ष्याः
 Ku. 1. 46; ˚लोचनः Śi. 1. 53; ˚तडिन्नयना 6. 25.
—5 Querulous, foolish, weak-minded.
