अनर्ह
अनर्ह <i>a.</i>
—1 Not deserving, not fit, not worthy of (with gen. or in comp.); अनर्हा
 गृहवासस्य Pt. 4; तान् हव्यकव्ययोर्विप्राननर्हान् मनुरब्रवीत् Ms. 3. 150.
—2 Inadequate, unsuitable.
—3 Undeserving of reward or punishment.
