<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुदात्तेत्
अनुदात्त + -इत् a verbal root having for its अनुबन्ध the grave accent
 (denoting that it takes the Ātm. terminations only).
