अनुदात्ततर
अनुदात्त + -तर <i>a.</i> more than अनुदात्त; still lower or graver accent,
 <i>i. e.</i> that which immediately precedes a syllable having the उदात्त
 or स्वरित accent and is thus more depressed than the ordinary अनुदात्त accent.
