अनुपत्
अनुपत् €1 P.
—1 To fly to or towards.
—2 To fly or run after, follow (fig. also); pursue, chase; मुहुरनुपतति
 स्यन्दने दत्तदृष्टिः Ś. 1. 7; कथमनुपतत एव मे प्रयत्नप्रेक्षणीयः
 संवृत्तः Ś. 1; न यत्र प्रत्याशामनुपतति नो वा रहयति (चेतः)
 Māl. 9. 8 does not run after (cherish), hope or leave it; यस्यैवं
 भवन्तः कुटुम्बवृत्तिमनुपतिताः Mv. 1; अनुपतति रजनीं पूर्वसन्ध्या Śi. 11. 40.
—3 To fall upon, attack; प्राग्वीराननुपत्य Māl. 8. 9.
.━<i>Caus.</i>
—1 To fly to.
—2 To throw another down along with oneself.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0097-1" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुपतनम्
अनुपतनम्, -पातः
—1 Falling upon, alighting upon in succession.
—2 Following, going after, pursuit; उपवनपवनानुपातदक्षैः Śi. 7. 27.
—3 Going or proceeding in order or as a consequence.
—4 [अनुरूपः त्रैराशिकेन पातः] Proportion.
—5 Rule of three.
—6 A degree of latitude, opposite to one given.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0097-1" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

