अनुपलब्धि|अनुपलब्धिः
अनुपलब्धि <i>f.</i> Non-recognition, non-perception (प्रत्यक्षाद्यभाव);
 नास्ति घटोऽनुपलब्धेः (the knowledge of घटाभाव is possible because
 the प्रतियोगी or counter-entity is not found with the non-entity or
 अभाव, that is, there being no उपलब्धि or knowledge of the घट);
