अनुव्याख्यानम्
अनुव्याख्यानम् [अनुरूपं व्याख्यानम्] That which comments on and
 explains Mantras, Sūtras &c.
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0109-2" target="_blank">Page0109-2</a>]
 (मन्त्रविवरणम्); especially, that portion of a Brāhmaṇa which
 explains difficult Sūtras, texts &c. occurring in another place (मन्त्रादीनामनुरूपार्थप्रकाशकं व्याख्यानम्).
