अन्तरि|अंतरि
अन्तरि €2 P. (अन्तर् + इ)
—1 To go between, to stand in oneʼs way, intervene to separate; रात्रेरेनं
 तदन्तरियात् Ait. Br.
—2 To exclude from, to pass over, omit.
—3 To disappear, see अन्तरित below.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0124-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तरयति
अन्तरि + .({@-अयति@}) To come or step between, interpose; दर्दुरक उपसृत्य
 अन्तरयति Mk. 2 (it may also mean, ‘separates the two’).
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0124-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तरयः|अन्तरय|अंतरयः
अन्तरयः, -रायः
—1 An impediment, obstacle, hindrance, what stands in the
 way; स चेत् त्वमन्तरायो भवसि च्युतो विधिः R. 3. 45, 14. 65; वह्वन्तराययुक्तस्य
 धर्मस्य त्वरिता गतिः Pt. 3. 101; अस्य ते बाणपथवर्तिनः कृष्णसारस्य
 अन्तरायौ तपास्विनौ संवृत्तौ Ś. 1.
 v. l. standing in the way.
—2 (In Vedānta) Hindrance to the concentration of mind which is said
 to be of four kinds, लय, विक्षेप, कषाय and रसास्वाद.
—3 An intervention, a covering, screen; दाहप्रेम्ह्णा सरसबिसिनीपत्रमात्रान्तरायः Māl. 3. 12.
—4 (With the Jainas) Interference or obstruction offered to those who
 are engaged in seeking deliverance, and consequent prevention of their
 accomplishment of it; one of the 8 classes of <i>karman</i>.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0124-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

