अन्नप्राशः|अन्नप्राश
अन्नम् + -प्राशः, -प्राशनम् the ceremony of giving a new-born child food
 to eat for the first time, one of the 16 <i>Saṃskāras</i> performed between
 the 5th and 8th month (usually in the sixth, Ms. 2. 34) with preliminary
 oblations to fire (Mar. उष्टावण); षष्टेऽन्नप्राशनं मासि Ms. 2. 34;
 Y. 1. 12.
