अन्यथावादिन्
अन्यथा + -वादिन् <i>a.</i> speaking differently or falsely; speaking
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0132-1" target="_blank">Page0132-1</a>]
 falsely or inconsistently; (in law) a prevaricator, prevaricating witness.
