अन्यथासिद्ध
अन्यथा + -सिद्ध <i>a.</i> proved or demonstrated wrongly; (in Nyāya) said
 of a cause (कारण) which is not the true one, but only refers to accidental
 and remote circumstances (as the ass employed to fetch clay &c. in the
 case of a घट or jar) which do not invariably contribute to the result,
 see कारण; this अन्यथा˚ is said to be of 3 kinds in Tarka K.,
 but 5 are mentioned in Bhāṣā P. 19-22.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0132-1" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्यथासिद्धम्
अन्यथा + -सिद्धम्, -सिद्धिः <i>f.</i> wrong demonstration; one in which arguments
 not being true causes are advanced; an unessential cause, an accidental
 or concomitant circumstance. Bhāṣā P. 16.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0132-1" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

