अन्योन्याभावः|अन्योन्याभाव
अन्योन्य + -अभावः mutual non-existence or negation; one of the two main
 kinds of अभाव; it is reciprocal negation of identity, essence, or
 respective peculiarity, and is equivalent to difference (भेद); तादात्म्यसंबन्धावच्छिन्नप्रतियोगिकोऽन्योन्याभावः,
 as घटः पटो न भवति; it exists between two notions which have
 no property in common.
