अन्वित|अन्वितः
अन्वित <i>p. p.</i>
—1 Followed or attended by, in company with, joined by; अमात्यपुत्रैः
 सवयोभिरन्वितः
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0135-2" target="_blank">Page0135-2</a>]
