<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपक्रम्
अपक्रम् €1 P.
—1 To go away, run away, fly, escape, flee away, leave, retreat, retire
 (from); नगरादपक्रान्तः Mu. 1; राक्षसोऽपक्रामन्नुपेक्षितः 3 while escaping.
—2 To glide away, pass away (as time).
—3 To measure off by step or by pacing.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0137-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपक्रमः|अपक्रम
अपक्रमः
—1 Going away, flight, escape, retreat.
—2 The place or limit to which one may retreat; विक्षिपत्येष विक्षेपं
 चन्द्रादीनामपक्रमात् Sūrya S.
—3 Gliding or passing away (of time). ━<i>a.</i> [अपगतः क्रमो यस्मात्]
—1 Without order.
—2 Irregular, in wrong order.
