अपक्ष
अपक्ष <i>a.</i>
—1 Without wings or the power of flight. अपक्षो हि कथं पक्षी कर्म
 किंचित्समाचरेत् Rām. 4. 59. 23.
—2 Not belonging to the same side or party.
—3 Having no adherents or friends.
—4 Opposed to, adverse.
