अपगत|अपगतः
अपगत <i>q. v.</i>
—1 Gone away, departed, passed away, gone off; being remote; oft. as first
 member of comp. in the sense of ‘free from’, ‘devoid of’; ˚अन्यव्यापाराः
 K. 43 having no other duties; ˚मत्सर 45, 47, 157, 164, 207, 211;
 ˚निमेषेण चक्षुषा 154 devoid of twinkling or winking; ˚मले मनसि 102.
—2 Dead, deceased.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0138-1" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपगमः|अपगम
अपगमः, -मनम्
—1 Going away or off, departure, separation; समागमाः सापगमाः H. 4. 65.
—2 Falling off, going away, removal, disappearance; निमित्तमुद्दिश्य
 हि यः प्रकुप्यति ध्रुवं स तस्यापगमे प्रसीदति ॥ Pt. 1. 283; त्वत्संरोधापगमविशदैश्चन्द्रपादैः
 Me. 72; पुराणपत्रापगमादनन्तरम् R. 3. 7; lapse, passing away;
 कतिपयदिवसापगमे K. 66, 193.
—3 Death, decease.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0138-1" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

