अपचि
अपचि €3 P.
—1 To honour, respect.
—2 To invite respectfully.
—3 (€5 U.) To gather, collect. ━<i>pass.</i>
—1 To be reduced in strength or bulk, sink, waste away; अपचितमपि
 गात्रं व्यायतत्वादलक्ष्यम् Ś. 2. 4 reduced in bulk, emaciated, lean;
 to wane, decline, diminish, grow less; राजहंस तव सैव शुभ्रता चीयते
 न च न चापचीयते K. P. 10.
—2 To fall away from, be deprived of, lose (with abl.); प्रकृतिः सूयते
 तद्वदानन्त्यान्नापचीयते Mb.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0139-1" target="_blank">PDF</a>
