<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपदार्थः|अपदार्थ
अपदार्थः
—1 Nothing, non-entity.
—2 Not the meaning of words actually used in a sentence; अपदार्थोऽपि
 वाक्यार्थः समुल्लसति K. P. 2.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0141-1" target="_blank">PDF</a>
