अपरम्
अपर + .{@-रम्@} <i>adv.</i> Again, moreover, in future, for the future; अपरं
 च moreover; अपरेण behind, west of, to the west of (with gen.
 or acc.). [cf. Goth. <i>afar</i>; Germ. <i>aber</i>, as in aberglauben].
