अपस्मरणम्
अपस्मरणम् Reminding (?); सकृद्वचनेन ज्ञातस्य पुनर्वचनेन
 प्रयोजनमस्तीति । उच्यते । भवति उपस्मरणमपि प्रयोजनमित्युक्तम् ।
 ŚB. on MS. 5. 1. 1. (If the word is अप्रस्मरण it would mean ‘absence of forgetting’
 प्र + स्मृ is used by Śabara
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0151-2" target="_blank">Page0151-2</a>]
 in the sense ‘to forget’. It is, therefore, likely that the reading here
 is अप्रस्मरण instead of अपस्मरण which does not appear in
 शबरʼs भाष्य elsewhere.)
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0151-1" target="_blank">PDF</a>
