अपहर्तृ|अपहर्त्तृ
अपहर्तृ <i>a.</i>
—1 One that takes or carries away, steals, removes, destroys &c.
—2 Removing, expiating; स्तेयदोषापहर्तॄणां व्रतनाम् Ms. 11. 161.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0152-1" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपहारः|अपहार
अपहारः
—1 Taking or carrying away, stealing, plundering, removing, killing, destroying;
 कर्णनासापहारेण भगिनी मे विरूपिता Rām. by the cutting of ears
 and nose; निद्रापहार, विष˚.
—2 Concealing, dissembling; कथमात्मापहारं करोमि Ś. 1 how shall
 I dissemble myself, conceal my real name and character; see अपहारक below.
—3 Spending or using anotherʼs property.
—4 Loss, damage.
—5 Bringing in, obtaining; समित्कुशकुसुमापहारसंमार्जनलब्धविश्रमाः
 (वानप्रस्थाः) Mb. 12. 192. 1.
