अपाङ्क्त|अपांक्त
अपाङ्क्त, -पाङ्क्तेय, -पाङ्क्त्य <i>a.</i>
 ‘Not in the same row or line’; especially
 one who is not allowed by his caste-men to sit in the same row with them
 at meals; degraded, excommunicated, excluded from or inadmissible into
 society, an outcast; ˚उपहत defiled by the presence of excommunicated
 or impious persons. एतान्विगर्हिताचारानपाङ्क्तेयान्द्विजाधमान् (विवर्जयेत्) Ms. 3. 167.
