अपी
अपी [अपि-इ] €2 P. (Mostly Vedic)
—1 To go in or near, enter into or upon, approach.
—2 To have a share in, partake of, suffer; जरामृत्युं पुनरेवापियन्ति
 Muṇḍ. 1. 2. 7.
—3 To join, flow, flow into, dissolve, be resolved into; स्वमपीतो भवति
 तस्मादेनं स्वपितीत्याचक्षते Ch. Up.
—4 To die.
—5 To pour out (as a river).
