अपूर्वम्
अपूर्व + .{@-र्वम्@}
—1 The remote consequence of an act (as the acquisition of heaven which
 is the result of good deeds), (Mīmāṃsā).
—2 Virtue and vice (पापपुण्यम्) as the eventual cause of future happiness or misery.
