अपेहि
अपेहि (Imper. 2nd sing.) Used as the first member of some compounds
 (belonging to the class मयूरव्यंसकादि P. II. 1. 72); ˚कटा^1,
 ˚द्वितीया, ˚प्रघसा^2, ˚वाणिजा, ˚स्वागता where it has the sense of ‘excluding’,
 ‘expelling’, ‘refusing admission to’; <i>e. g.</i> ˚वाणिजा a ceremony
 where merchants are excluded; so ˚द्वितीया &c.
.━{@Comp.@}: अपेहिवाता
