अप्रतिसंख्य <i>a.</i> Unobserved, unnoticed; ˚ख्य(ख्या)निरोधः
 unobserved nullity, annihilation of an object;
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0162-1" target="_blank">Page0162-1</a>]
 one of the three topics included by the Buddhas under the category of
 निरूप, the other two being प्रतिसंख्यानिरोध wilful destruction,
 as of a jar by a mallet, and आकाश the ethereal element.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0161-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रतिहत
अप्रतिहत <i>a.</i>
—1 Not obstructed or impeded, irresistible; ˚हतान् पुत्रान् K. 62; अस्मद्गृहे
 ˚गतिः Pt. 1 free to move; तोयस्येवाप्रतिहतरयः U. 3. 36; जृम्भतामप्रतिहतप्रसरमार्यस्य
 क्रोधज्योतिः Ve. 1.
—2 Unimpaired, unmarred, unrepulsed, unaffected, at home in every respect;
 सा बुद्धिरप्रतिहता Bh. 2. 40; Pt. 5. 26; so ˚चित्त, ˚मनस्.
—3 Not disappointed.
—4 A kind of deity; अपराजित-अप्रतिहत-जयन्त-वैजयन्त-कोष्ठकान् …
 पुरमध्ये कारयेत् Kau. A. 2. 4.
.━{@Comp.@}: अप्रतिहतनेत्र
