अप्रयुक्त
अप्रयुक्त <i>a.</i>
—1 Not used or employed, not applied.
—2 Wrongly used, as a word.
—3 (In Rhet.) Rare, unusual (as a word when used in a particular sense
 or gender though that sense or gender be sanctioned by lexicographers);
 अप्रयुक्तं तथाम्नातमपि कविभिर्नादृतम्; तथा मन्ये दैवतोऽस्य पिशाचो
 राक्षसोऽथवा । where the mas. gender of दैवत, though sanctioned
 (by Amara), is not used by poets and is, therefore, अप्रयुक्त. सन्त्यप्रयुक्ताः Mbh.
