अप्राप्तप्रापक
अप्राप्त + -प्रापक <i>a.</i> —1 conveying (the sense of) what is not otherwise
 specified, such as the use of the Potential mood in स्वर्गकामो यजेत.
—2 not yet tamed (as a young calf)
