अप्राप्तवयस्
अप्राप्त + -व्यवहार, -वयस् <i>a.</i> (in law) under age, not old enough to
 engage in public business on his own responsibility, a minor (a boy before
 he reaches his 16th year); अप्राप्तव्यवहारोऽसौ यावत् षोडशवार्षिकः Dakṣa.
