 forehead (as in caressing, kissing &c. as a token of affection).
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0170-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिघ्राणम्
अभिघ्राणम् Smelling at or touching the forehead with the nose.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0170-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिचक्ष्
अभिचक्ष् €2 Ā.
—1 To look at, view, perceive, see; अभि यो विश्वा भुवनानि चष्टे (सूर्यः) Rv. 7. 61. 1.
—2 To call to or address.
—3 To address sharply, to assail with sharp words. यो मा पाकेन मनसा
 चरन्तमभिचष्टे अनृतेभिर्वचोभिः Rv. 7. 104. 8.
—4 To name, call.
—5 To look graciously upon; कदा चिकित्वो अभिचक्षसे नो Rv. 5. 3. 9.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0170-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिचक्षणम्
अभिचक्षणम् Ved. Means of defence; (magical) remedy; Av. 6. 127. 2.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0170-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

