अभिचर्
अभिचर् €1 P.
—1 To act wrongly towards any one, offend, trespass; तत्र विराधदनुकबन्धप्रभृतयः
 केऽप्यभिचरन्तीति
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0171-1" target="_blank">Page0171-1</a>]
 श्रुतम् Mv. 2.
—2 To be faithless (as wife or husband) पतिं या नाभिचरति मनोवाग्देहसंयता
 Ms. 5. 165, 9. 102.
—3 To charm, conjure, exorcise (by spell or incantations), employ spells
 for magical purposes &c. Rv. 10. 34. 14; वृष्टयायुःपुष्टिकामो वा तथैवाभिचरन्नपि
 Y. 1. 295, 3. 288.
—4 to possess, occupy.
