अभिज्ञा
अभिज्ञ + .{@-ज्ञा@}
—1 Recognition.
—2 Remembrance, recollection; अभिज्ञावचने लृट् P. III. 2. 112.
—3 A supernatural faculty or power of which five kinds are usually mentioned:−
 (1) taking any form at will; (2) hearing to any distance; (3) seeing to
 any distance; (4) penetrating menʼs thoughts; (5) knowing their state
 and antecedents. Monier Williams. cf. नामस्मृत्योरभिज्ञा स्यात् Nm.
