——(<i>a</i>) Said, declared, spoken, mentioned; मयाभिहितम्, तेनाभिहितम् &c.
——(<i>b</i>) Predicated, asserted; अनभिहिते कर्मणि द्वितीया P. II. 3. 1-2.
——(<i>c</i>) Spoken to, addressed, called, named.
——(<i>d</i>) Whispered, prompted to say; determined.
—2 Fastened, placed upon.
