अभिपित्वम्
अभिपित्वम् <i>n.</i>^1 or <i>s.</i> Ved. [पा भावे कित्वन्]
—1 Come, approaching (अभिप्राप्त).
—2 Visiting, putting up (for the night at an inn &c.); the time of coming.
—3 Approaching time.
—4 Close or departure of day, evening.
—5 Dawn sacrifice.
[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260429. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/187.
