अभिभाविन्
अभिभाविन्, -भाव(वु)क <i>a.</i>
—1 Overpowering, defeating, conquering; शोकाभिभाविना भयेनाभिभूता
 K. 170 fear which conquered grief.
—2 Surpassing, excelling; सर्वतेजोऽभिभाविना R. 1. 14; Ki. 11. 6.
—3 Disrespecting, humiliating.
—4 Attacking.
