अभिमन्
अभिमन् €4 Ā. (P. epic.)
—1 To wish or desire, long for, covet, like; न त्वेवं ज्यायसीं वृत्तिमभिमन्येत
 कर्हिचित् Ms. 10. 95; see अभिमत below.
—2 To assent to, approve of, allow, admit; give a grant (to any one, dat.).
—3 To think, fancy, imagine, consider, believe, regard; तामार्यामसावन्यथाऽभ्यमन्यत
 Dk. 164; Bk. 5. 71; U. 5.
—4 To injure, threaten (Ved.)
—5 (€8 Ā.) To think of self.
