अभिया
अभिया €2 P.
—1 To go up to, approach, go or repair to; अभिययौ स हिमाचलमुच्छ्रितम्
 Ki. 5. 1; R. 9. 27.
—2 To come or draw near (without an object); come (as time).
—3 To march against, attack, assail, encounter; अभि स्पृधो यासिषद् वज्रबाहुः
 Rv. 1. 175. 5; कुबेरादभियास्यमानात् R. 5. 30; Dk. 30.
—4 To give or resign oneself to, devote, attach or betake oneself to.
—5 To partake or share in, get, obtain. ━<i>Caus.</i> To send away.
