अभियोक्ता
अभियोक्तृ + ({@-क्ता@}) ━<i>m.</i>
—1 An enemy, assailant, invader; त्वय्युत्कृष्टबलेऽभियोक्तरि^1 नृपे Mu. 4. 15; H. 3. 86.
—2 (In law) A complainant, plaintiff, accuser, prosecutor; तत्राभियोक्ता
 प्राक् पृष्टो ह्यभियुक्तस्त्वनन्तरम् Śukra. 4. 655; Ms. 8. 52, 58; Y. 2. 95.
—3 A pretender, claimant; a stronger party.
[1] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20251204. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/101.
