अभिवादः|अभिवाद
अभिवादः, -वादनम्
—1 Reverential salutation, respectful obeisance, salutation of a superior
 or elder by an inferior or junior, or of a teacher by his disciple. It
 consists in (1) rising from oneʼs seat (प्रत्युत्थान^1); (2) clasping
 the feet (पादोपसंग्रह), and (3) repeating the form of salutation
 (अभिवाद) which includes the name or title of the person addressed,
 followed by the mention of the personʼs own name. For the different ways
 of performing obeisance and the merit arising therefrom see Ms. 2. 120-126.
—2 Abuse, insulting or scurrilous speech (for अतिवाद).
[1] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20251204. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/101.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0183-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

