 च Ms. 3. 259, 7. 27; Y. 1. 245. ━<i>Caus.</i>
—1 To increase, augment, add to; कोशम्, धनम्, प्रीतिम् &c.
—2 To stretch, extend, lengthen.
—3 To bring up, rear.
