अभिसंधिः|अभिसन्धि|अभिसंधि|अभिसन्धिः
अभिसंधिः
—1 Speech; deliberate declaration, promise.
—2 Intention, object, purpose, aim; दम्पत्योः प्राणसंश्लेषे योऽभिसंधिः
 कृतः किल Mb. 12. 266. 34; तस्या आभिसंधिना विधेयीकृतोऽपि Māl. 1;
 Dk. 38; स्वर्ग˚ Ku. 6. 47.
—3 Implied sense, the meaning intended, as in अयमभिसन्धिः (frequently
 occurring in explanatory glosses).
—4 Opinion, belief.
—5 Special agreement, terms of an agreement, condition, stipulation; अथावश्यमेव
 माधवसेनः पूज्येन मोचयितव्यः श्रूयतामभिसन्धिः M. 1.
—6 Deception, Making peace or alliance.
—8 Junction, combination.
.━{@Comp.@}: अभिसंधिकृत
