अभिसंपद्|अभिसम्पद्
अभिसंपद् €4 Ā.
—1 To become (anything); to be changed to, be similar to, assume the state
 of; ब्रह्मलोकमभिसंपद्यते Ch. Up. 8. 15. 1. इष्टकामग्निरभिसंपद्यते Śat. Br.
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0188-2" target="_blank">Page0188-2</a>]
 श्रोत्रे हीमे सर्वे वेदा अभिसंपन्नाः <i>ibid.</i>
—2 To come or go, arrive at.
—3 To get, to obtain. ━<i>Caus.</i> To make similar to, change into.
