अभिसृ
अभिसृ P.
—1 To go up to, go towards, approach; to go to some place or other,
 go or proceed; पुरोभिसस्रे सुरसुन्दरीजनैः Ki. 8. 4.
—2 To attack, assail.
—3 To go or advance to meet (as at an appointed place); सुन्दरीरभिससार
 K. 58; Dk. 51, 52, 91; अभिससार न वल्लभमङ्गना Śi. 6. 26. ━<i>Caus.</i>
 To visit, approach, go to meet; वल्लभानभिसिसारयिषूणाम् Śi. 10. 20, 21;
 S. D. 115; Ki. 9. 38; Mk. 8.
