अभिघातः|अभिघात
अभिघातः
—1 Striking, (fig. also); beating, smiting, attack, injury, hurt; तटाभिघातादिव
 लग्नपङ्के Ku. 7. 49; शीतातपाभिघातान् Ms. 12. 77 attacks of heat
 and cold; so दुःख˚, शोक˚ &c.
—2 (In Vaiśeṣika Phil.) Striking against (such as gives rise to sounds
 &c.), regarded as a kind of संयोग.
—3 Striking back, driving or warding off.
—4 Extirpation, complete destruction or removal; दुःखत्रयाभिघाताज्जिज्ञासा
 तदभिघातके हेतौ Sāṅ. K. 1.
—5 Abrupt or vehement articulation of words (as of Vedic texts); sudden shock.
