—2 To go along or after, follow, serve.
—3
——(<i>a</i>) To go into, enter; Bk. 5. 67; अवाङ्नरकमभ्येति Ms. 8. 75.
——(<i>b</i>) To go over to, reach, arrive at; Me. 36 v. l.
——(<i>e</i>) To fall to oneʼs share, come to; नाऽविविदिषुमभ्येति सम्पद्
 रुरुदिषुं नरम् Bk. 7. 99.
—4 To get, meet with, fall into, suffer, undergo (said of good or bad
 things); कार्यं संसिद्धिमभ्येति Pt. 1.
