अभ्यञ्जनम्
अभ्यञ्जनम्
—1 Smearing the body with oily substances, inunction; भोजनाभ्यञ्जनाद्दानाद्यदन्यत्कुरुते
 तिलैः Ms. 10. 91.
—2 Smearing or anointing in general.
—3 Applying collyrium to the eyelashes; Ms. 2. 211. (here the 1 & 2 meaning
 can be applicable).
—4 An oily substance; oil, unguent^1.
—5 An ornament, decoration (Ved.).
—6 Cream of milk; (Nigh.).
