 अभ्यस्यन्ति तटाघातम् Ku. 2. 50; K. 183.
—3 To learn, study, acquire or learn by practice, recite, read; वेदमेव
 सदाभ्यस्येत् Ms. 2. 166, 4. 147, 149; Y. 3. 204; K. 79.
—4 To throw down upon, heap one upon another, accumulate, lay on (Ved.).
—5 To throw or fling at, shoot or aim at (as arrows).
