अमूल, -लक <i>a.</i>
—1 Rootless (lit.); पशवोऽमूला ओषधयो ऽमूलिन्यः Śat. Br.; (fig.);
 without basis or support, baseless, groundless.
—2 without authority; not being in the original; इहान्वयमुखेनैव सर्वं
 व्याख्यायते मया । नामूलं लिख्यते किंचित् Malli. Introduction of Ṭīkā on R.
—3 without material cause, as the <i>Pradhāna</i> of the Sāṅkhyas; मूलं
 मूलाभावादमूलम्.
—4 Not fixed in the earth, moving.
