अमोघ|अमोघः
अमोघ <i>a.</i>
—1 Unfailing, reaching the mark; धनुष्यमोघं समधत्त बाणम् Ku. 3. 66;
 R. 3. 53, 12. 97; कामिलक्ष्येष्वमोघैः Me. 75.
—2 Unerring, infallible (words, boon &c.); अमोघाः प्रतिगृह्णन्तावर्घ्यानुपदमाशिषः
 R. 1. 44; युतममोघतया Ki. 6. 40.
—3 Not vain or useless, efficacious, fruitful, productive; यदमोघमपामन्तरुप्तं
 बीजमज त्वया Ku. 2. 5; so ˚बलम्, ˚शक्ति, ˚वीर्य, ˚क्रोध &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0206-1" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अमोघः|अमोघ
अमोघ + .{@-घः@}
—1 Not failing or erring, unerringness.
—2 N. of Viṣṇu (or of Śiva according to some).
—3 N. of a river.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0206-1" target="_blank">PDF</a>
