अम्बुवाची
अम्बु + -वाची [अम्बु तद्वर्षणं वाचयति सूचयति] an epithet applied
 to the earth during four days from the 10th to the 13th in the dark half
 of the month of Āṣāḍha when it is supposed to be unclean (रजस्वला
 इव) and agriculture is prohibited; Brav. P. 2. 77. ˚प्रदः the 10th
 day; ˚त्यागः 13th day.
