अयाज्य
अयाज्य <i>a.</i>
—1 (A person) for whom one must not perform sacrifices, not competent
 to offer sacrifices (as a Śūdra &c.).
—2 (Hence), Out-cast; degraded, not admissible to or incapable of religious ceremonies.
—3 Not fit for sacrificial offerings.
.━{@Comp.@}: अयाज्ययाजनम्, अयाज्यसंयाज्यम्
