[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0215-1" target="_blank">Page0215-1</a>]
—1 Anger, passion.
—2 Ved. Going, moving quickly.
—3 Moving flame.
—4 Occupying, attacking.
—5 Servant, manager, assistant.
—6 A master.
—7 An intelligent being.
