अराधस्
अराधस् <i>a.</i> [राधः; धनम्- Nir. न˚ ब˚] Poor, not
 able to perform sacrifices, stingy; hard.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0216-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अराम
अराम <i>a.</i> Disagreeable, unpopular; एवं प्रव्राजितश्चैव रामोऽरामो
 भविष्यति. Rām. 2. 9. 33
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0216-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
