अर्थातिदेशः
अर्थः + -अतिदेशः Extension (of gender, number &c.) to the objects (as
 against words), <i>i. e.</i> to treat a single object as though it were many,
 a female as though it were male. (तन्त्रवार्त्तिक 1. 2. 58. 3, 6. 3. 34. 7).
