अर्थालंकारः|अर्थालङ्कार
अर्थः + -अलंकारः^1 a figure of speech determined by and dependent on the
 sense, and not on
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0225-1" target="_blank">Page0225-1</a>]
 sound (opp. शब्दालंकार). अलंकारशेखर of केशवमिश्र mentions
