—1 As a matter of course, of course, in fact; मूषिकेण दण्डो भक्षित
 इत्यनेन तत्सहचरितमपूपभक्षणमर्थादायातं भवति S. D. 10.
—2 According to the circumstances or state of the case; as a matter of fact.
—3 That is to say, namely.
