अर्धभोटिका
अर्ध + -भोटिका a kind of cake. {@भ्रमः, -मकः@} a kind of artificial
 composition; for instances see Ki. 15. 27; Śi. 19. 72. The Sar. K. describes
 it as a figure of speech thus:− आहुरर्धभ्रमं नाम श्लोकार्धभ्रमणं यदि.
