अर्ध्य
अर्ध्य <i>a.</i>
—1 Belonging to the half (of anything).
—2 Fit to be increased.
—3 To be accomplished; अधा ते विष्णो विदुषा चिदर्ध्यः Rv. 1. 156. 1.
—4 To be obtained; शविष्ठं वाजं विदुषा चिदर्ध्यम् Rv. 5. 44. 10.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
