अवकॄ
अवकॄ €6 P.
—1 To bestow, pour upon, to shower upon, cover with, fill; Śi. 11. 62;
 (तं) अवाकिरन् बाललताः प्रसूनैः R. 2. 10, 4. 27; लाजाञ्जलिभिरवकीर्यमाणः
 K. 86; Ki. 6. 2; अवकीर्योत्तरीयाणि Mb. spreading on the ground; तीर्थानि
 अवकीर्णानि तपस्विभिः Mb. filled with; Y. 3. 281; Me. 56.
—2 To pour out, throw out; सप्तद्वारावकीर्णां च न वाचमनृतां वदेत् Ms. 6. 48.
—3 To shake off, throw off, leave.
—4 (<i>Ātm.</i>) (Used reflexively)
——(<i>a</i>) To extend, spread itself; अवकिरते हस्ती स्वयमेव Sk.
——(<i>b</i>) To fall asunder.
——(<i>c</i>) To pass away, fall off.
——(<i>d</i>) To become faithless or untrue.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0239-1" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवकीर्ण|अवकीर्णः
अवकीर्ण <i>p. p.</i>
—1 Scattered, filled, covered over; किमैपति रजोभिरौर्वरैरवकीर्णस्य
 मणेर्महार्घता Śi. 16. 27.
—2 Coarsely pounded.
—3 Destroyed; अवकीर्णो हि समरे वीरो दुष्प्रज्ञया तदा Mb. 15. 16. 11.
—4 Violated (as the vow of a ब्रह्मचारी), degraded.
—5 Declining, dilapidating; दृष्ट्वा तथाऽवकीर्णं तु राष्ट्रम् Mb. 9. 41. 16.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0239-1" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

