अवगीत|अवगीतं|अवगीतः
अवगीत <i>p. p.</i>
—1 Sung in a discordant tone, sung badly.
—2 Reproached, abused, censured; अनवगीतः
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0241-2" target="_blank">Page0241-2</a>]
 परिचयः U. 2. 2; अवगीतां गमिते दशामिमाम् Ki. 2. 7; सोढावगीतप्रथमायुधस्य 17. 28;
 Śi. 11. 10.
—3 Wicked, vile.
—4 Satirized in a song.
—5 Seen frequently, well-known (मुहुर्दृष्ट).
