अवच्छिन्न|अवच्छिन्नं
अवच्छिन्न <i>p. p.</i>
—1 Cut off.
—2 Separated, divided, detached, excerpted; अवच्छिन्नस्य पूर्णेन एकत्वं
 प्रतिपाद्यते A. Rām. 1. 1. 49.
—3 (In Logic) Separated or excluded from all other things by the properties
 predicated of a thing as peculiar to itself.
—4 Bounded, modified, determined; दिक्कालाद्यनवच्छिन्न Bh. 2. 1.
—5 Particularized, distinguished, characterized, as by an attributive word.
