अवतरणम्
अवतरणम्
—1 Descending for bathing in water &c. गङ्गा˚, अप्सरस्तीर्थ˚; descending;
 or alighting (in general), coming down; स्तन्य˚.
—2 An incarnation; see अवतार,
—3 Crossing.
—4 Sudden disapperance.
—5 Steps or stairs leading to a river.
—6 A holy bathing place (तीर्थ).
—7 Translating from one language into another.
—8 Introduction.
—9 An extract, a quotation.
