अवसादक
अवसादक <i>a.</i>
—1 Causing to sink, faint, or fail.
—2 Causing dejection or fatigue; एष शोकः परित्यक्तः सर्वकार्यावसादकः Rām.
—3 Exhausting, wearisome, tiresome, fatiguing.
—4 Ending, finishing.
