अवान्तरवाक्यम्
अवान्तर + -वाक्यम्
——(<i>a</i>) A sentence formed by dropping some word or words in the whole
 sentence; न च महावाक्ये सति अवान्तरवाक्यं प्रमाणं भवति ŚB. on MS. 6. 4. 25.
——(<i>b</i>) A group of words which appear to form a complete sentence, but
 form only a part of a complete sentence (<i>i. e.</i> a महावाक्य).
