अव्यक्त + .{@-क्तः@}
—1 N. of Viṣṇu.
—2 N. of Śiva.
—3 Cupid.
—4 Primary matter which has not yet entered into real existence.
—5 A fool.
—6 N. of an Upaniṣad.
