<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्याप्य|अव्याप्यं
अव्याप्य <i>a.</i> Not extending to the whole circumstances, not pervading
 the whole extent; वह्निर्धूमस्याव्याप्यः
.━{@Comp.@}: अव्याप्यवृत्तिः
