असंगत|असङ्गत
असंगत <i>a.</i>
—1 Ununited, unaccompanied with.
—2 improbable, inconsistent.
—3 Unequal.
—4 Unesteemed.
—5 Unbecoming, improper.
—6 Rude, ill-mannered, unpolished.
—7 unobstructed, not hindered; शक्तिं क्षिप्तामसंगताम् Rām. 6. 70. 134.
