असंगतिः|असङ्गति|असंगति
असंगतिः <i>f.</i>
—1 Not associating with.
—2 Incongruity, improbability.
—3 (In Rhet.) A figure of speech in which a cause and its effect are
 represented as locally different or separated (in which there is an apparent
 violation of the relation between cause and effect); भिन्नदेशतयात्यन्तं
 कार्यकारणभूतयोः । युगपद्धर्मयोर्यत्र ख्यातिः सा स्यादसंगतिः ॥
 K. P. 10; विरुद्धं भिन्नदेशत्वं कार्यहेत्वोरसंगतिः । विषं जलधरैः
 पीतं मूर्छिताः पथिकाङ्गनाः ॥ Kuval.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0288-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
