<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

असत्कृतम्
असत्कृत + .{@-तम्@} bad or wicked deed. असत्कृतमवज्ञातम् Bg. 17. 22.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0289-1" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

असत्ता
असत्ता
—1 Non-existence.
—2 Untruth.
—3 Wickedness, badness.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0289-1" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

असत्त्व
असत्त्व <i>a.</i>
—1 Without energy or strength.
—2 Having no animal.
—3 Having no goodness.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0289-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

असत्त्वम्
असत्त्व + .{@-त्त्वम्@}
—1 Non-existence.
—2 Unreality, untruth.
—3 Wickedness, badness.
—4 Duet.
—5 Darkness.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0289-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

असत्य|असत्यः
असत्य <i>a.</i>
—1 Untrue, false; पापासः सन्तो अनृता असत्याः Rv. 4. 5. 5; असत्यमप्रतिष्ठम् Bg. 16. 8.
—2 Imaginary, unreal, असत्यकण्ठार्पितबाहुबन्धना Ku. 5. 27.
—3 of uncertain result; असत्यानि च युद्धानि संशयो मे न रोचते Rām. 5. 30. 35.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0289-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

असत्यः|असत्य
