असमञ्जस|असमंजस|असमञ्जसं
असमञ्जस <i>a.</i>
—1 Indistinct, unintelligible; स्खलदसमञ्जसमुग्धजल्पितं ते U. 4. 4;
 Māl. 10. 2 faltering, inarticulate and pretty prattle.
—2 Unbecoming, improper; यद्यपि न कापि हानिर्द्राक्षामन्यस्य रासभे
 चरति । असमञ्जसमिति मत्वा तथापि तरलायते चेतः ॥ Udb.
—3 Absurd, nonsensical, foolish; कृतं किं वा सुपर्णस्य ते नैकेनासमञ्जसम्
 Bhāg. 10. 17. 7.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0290-1" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

असमञ्जसम्
असमञ्जस + .{@-सम्@} Non-conformity, disparity, difference. <i>ind.</i>
—1 Unbecomingly, improperly.
—2 In a fluctuating or confused manner.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0290-1" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

असमद्
असमद् <i>f.</i> Ved. Non-conflict, harmony, concord.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0290-1" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

असमद
असमद <i>a.</i> [सह मदेन गर्वेण समदः कलहः स नास्ति यत्र]
 Without a quarrel or opposition.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0290-1" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

असमन
असमन <i>a.</i>
—1 Of different colours or minds.
—2 Going in different directions; असमना अजिरासो रघुष्यदः Rv. 1. 140. 4.
—3 Uneven, unequal; असमने अध्वनि वृजिने पथि Rv. 6. 46. 13.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0290-1" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

असमयः|असमय
असमयः
—1 Unseasonableness.
—2 Unfit or unfavourable time; असमये मतिरुन्मिषति ध्रुवम् N. 4. 57.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0290-1" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

असमर्थ|असमर्थः
असमर्थ <i>a.</i>
—1 Not able or competent; अभ्यासेऽप्यसमर्थोऽसि Bg. 12. 10.
—2 Weak, feeble.
—3 (In Rhet.) Powerless to convey the intended meaning, a defect of a
 word; यत्तदर्थं पठ्यते न च तत्रास्य शक्तिः तदसमर्थत्वम् K. P. 7;
 <i>e. g.</i> in कुञ्जं हन्ति कृशोदरी; हन्, though read in root-books
 in the sense of ‘going’, is here powerless to convey that meaning.
.━{@Comp.@}: असमर्थसमासः
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0290-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

असमर्थसमासः|असमर्थसमास
असमर्थ + -समासः a compound in which the conjunction of words is not as
 it should be; <i>e. g.</i> in अश्राद्धभोजिन्, असूर्यंपश्य, अ goes not
 with श्राद्ध or सूर्य but with भोजिन् or पश्य; Mbh. on P. I. 1. 43.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0290-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

असमवायिन्
असमवायिन् <i>a.</i> Not intimate or inherent, accidental, separable.
.━{@Comp.@}: असमवायिकारणम्
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0290-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

असमवायिकारणम्
असमवायिन् + -कारणम् (In logic) an accidental cause, not inherent and intimate
 relation; गुणकर्ममात्रवृत्तिज्ञेयमथाप्यसमवायिहेतुत्वम् Bhāṣā P.;
 यथा तन्तुसंयोगः पटस्य.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0290-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

असमवेत
असमवेत <i>a.</i> Not classed together, incoherent; ˚रूपम् incoherently.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0290-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

असमस्त
असमस्त <i>a.</i>
—1 Incomplete, imperfect, partial, not whole.
—2 (In gram.) Not joined in a compound, not compounded.
—3 Uncollected.
—4 Separate, detached, unconnected (opp. व्यस्त).
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0290-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

असमस्तम्
असमस्त + .{@-स्तम्@} An uncompounded word (the sentence showing the dissolution
 of a compound).
