<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

असमाप्त|असमाप्तं
असमाप्त <i>a.</i>
—1 Not completed or finished, left incomplete; असमाप्तविधिर्यतो मुनिः
 R. 8. 76; Ku. 4. 19.
—2 Not fully acquired.
