असंपूर्ण|असम्पूर्ण|असम्पूर्ण्ण
असंपूर्ण <i>a.</i>
—1 Not complete, unfinished.
—2 Not whole or entire.
—3 Not full, partial, as the moon; चन्द्रमसंपूर्नमण्डलमिदानीम् Mu. 1. 6.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0291-1" target="_blank">PDF</a>
