असाधनीय
असाधनीय, असाध्य <i>a.</i>
—1 Not to be accomplished or completed, not proper, easy, or capable of
 being accomplished; नास्ति असाध्यं नाम मनोभुवः K. 157.
—2 Not capable of being proved; (see com. on Y. 2. 6.)
—3 Incurable, irremediable (as a disease or patient); असाध्यः कुरुते
 कोपं प्राप्ते काले गदो यथा Śi. 2. 84; असाध्य इति वैद्येनातुर इव
 V. 3; Mv. 4. 23; भिषजामसाध्यम् R. 8. 93.
—4 Not to be overpowered or mastered.
