आकाशदीपः|आकाशदीप
आकाशः + -दीपः, -प्रदीपः
—1 a lamp lighted in honour of Lakṣmī or Viṣṇu and raised on a pole
 in the air at the Divāli festival in the month of Kārtika.
—2 a beacon-light, a lantern on a pole.
