आगन्तुक|आगंतुक|आगन्तुकं
आगन्तुक <i>a.</i> (-का, -की <i>f.</i>)
—1 Coming of oneʼs own accord, arriving uninvited; आगन्तुका वयम् Dhūrt.
—2 Stray (as an animal); Y. 2. 163.
—3 Incidental, accidental, adventitious; इत्यागन्तुका विकाराः <i>Aśval.</i>
—4 Interpolated, spurious (as a reading), having crept in without authority;
 अगन्धवद्गन्धमादनमित्यागन्तुकः पाठः
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0313-1" target="_blank">Page0313-1</a>]
 Malli. on Ku. 6. 46.
