आचरित|आचरितं
आचरित <i>p. p.</i>
—1 Done, observed, practised, as a rite or usage &c.
—2 Usual, customary.
—3 Enjoined, fixed by rule.
—4 Inhabited, colonied; देशमुत्सादयत्येनमगस्त्याचरितं शुभम् Rām. 1. 25. 14.
