—2 To wash, wet, sprinkle; अन्नमाप्लाव्य वारिणा Ms. 3. 244, 11. 98.
—3 To overflow, overwhelm, inundate, flood over.
—4 To set in commotion.
—5 (Ātm.) To bathe.
