आप्लवः + -व्रतिन् or {@आप्लुतव्रतिन्@} <i>m.</i> a house-holder who has
 passed through the first order (ब्रह्मचर्य) and is admitted into the
 second (गार्हस्थ्य), an initiated householder; cf. स्नातक.
