—2 Colour, appearance, beauty; प्रशान्तमिव शुद्धाभम् Ms. 12. 27.
—3 Likeness, resemblance; oft. at the end of comp. in these two senses;
 रुक्माभम् appearing or shining like gold; यमदूताभम् Pt. 1. 58;
 मरुत्सखाभम् R. 2. 10.
—4 A reflected image, shadow, reflection.
