<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आमम्
आम + .{@-म्@}
—1 State of being raw; शनैः शनैर्जहुः पङ्कं स्थलान्यामं च वीरुधः
 Bhāg. 10. 20. 39.
—2 Constipation, passing hard excretion.
—3 Grain freed from chaff.
