आयम्
आयम् €1 U.
—1 To extend, lengthen out, stretch out; वस्त्रं-पाणिं-आयच्छते Sk.;
 स्वाङ्गमायच्छमानः Ś. 4, v. l.; आयच्छति कूपाद्रज्जुम् Sk. draws
 up; बाणमुद्यतमायसीत् Bk. 6. 119 stretched out.
—2 To restrain, draw in (as breath &c.); त्रिरायम्य शनैरसून् Ms. 3. 217, 11. 100;
 प्राणानायम्य Y. 1. 24.
—3 To stretch oneself, to grow long (Ātm.); P. I. 3. 28.
—4 To grasp, possess; श्रियमायच्छमानाभिः Bk. 8. 46.
—5 To bring or lead towards. ━<i>Caus.</i>
—1 To lengthen, stretch, spread or draw out.
—2 To remove, transplant.
