आरभ्य
आरभ्य <i>ind.</i> Having begun, beginning with, ever since, since,
 with a prepositional force (with abl.); मालत्याः प्रथमावलोकदिवसादारभ्य
 Māl. 6. 3; Ś. 3; K. 102, 134, 196; sometimes with acc. also; प्रतिपद्दिनमारभ्य Bhāg.
