आरात्
आरात् <i>ind.</i> [आ-रा-बा˚ आति Tv.; abl. of आर q. v.]
—1 Near, in the vicinity of; (with abl. or by itself); तमर्च्यमारादभिवर्तमानम्
 R. 2. 10, 5. 3.
—2 Far from; with acc. also in both these senses; Śi. 3. 31, 8. 29, कथंचिदारादपथेन
 निन्यिरे 12. 28; to a distant place, distant.
—3 Far, from a distance; मेघमालेव यश्चायमारादिव विभाव्यते U. 2. 24.
—4 Directly, immediately.
