आराध्
आराध् €5. €10 P.
—1 To propitiate, conciliate, please, try to win the favour of; परेषां
 चेतांसि प्रतिदिवसमाराध्य बहुधा Bh. 3. 34, 2. 4-5; R. 1. 77, 81, 10. 86, 18. 23;
 Me. 47.
—2 To honour, worship, respect.
—3 To deserve, merit.
