आरुध्
आरुध् €7 U.
—1 To keep or ward off, keep away, restrain; बन्धुता शुचमारुणत् Bk. 17. 49.
—2 To shut up, confine.
—3 To besiege.
—4 To hold fast, grasp. ━<i>Caus.</i> To obstruct, impede, block, besiege.
