आवप्
आवप् €1 U.
—1 To scatter, throw about; वयोभ्यश्चावपेद्भुवि Mb.; so अक्षान् throws.
—2 To sow (as seed).
—3 To fit in, insert.
—4 To pour out or forth.
—5 To offer (as in a sacrifice), perform (as a Śrāddha). ━<i>Caus.</i>
—1 To shave, cut off.
—2 To trim, to comb; केशानावापयन्ती Mb. 1. 3. 157.
