आवस्
आवस् €1 P. (With acc.)
—1 To inhabit, dwell in; रविमावसते सतां क्रियायै V. 3. 7; पुरीमिमामावसत्
 Rām.; sometimes with loc.; Ms. 7. 69; रम्यं पशव्यमाजीव्यं जाङ्गलं
 देशमावसेत् Y. 1. 321.
—2 To be occupied or engaged, enter upon; गृहस्थाश्रमम् Ms. 3. 2.
—3 To take part carnally; cohabit. गुरोस्तल्पमावसन् Ch. Up. 5. 10. 9.
—4 To pass, spend (as night). ━<i>Caus.</i>
—1 To allow one to dwell, receive hospitably.
—2 To inhabit, settle in a place.
—3 To halt or encamp (for the night).
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0361-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवसतिः|आवसति
आवसतिः <i>f.</i> Night (the time during which one rests); midnight;
 माद्रीसुताभ्यां सहितः किरीटी सुष्वाप तामावसतिं प्रतीतः Mb. 3. 165. 14.
