आवह्
आवह् €1 P.
—1 To bring; अग्ने पत्नीरिहावह Rv. 1. 22. 9.
—2 To bring home (as a bride).
—3 To conduce, lead or tend to, produce, bring on; क्रीडमावहति मे स
 संप्रति R. 11. 73 shames me; मनसो रुजमावहन् Ś. 3. 4 tending
 to mental anguish; न मे सौख्यमावहति does not tend to my happiness
 Pt. 1; संगमम् K. 174; Ms. 3. 82.
—4 To pay; गृहीतवेतनः कर्म त्यजन्द्विगुणमावहेत् Y. 2. 193.
—5 To lead forth, conduct away.
—6 To flow (as blood &c.).
—7 To bear, support, wear; मण्डनमावहन्तीम् C. P. 18.
—8 To apply, use, employ; मा रोदीर्घैर्यमावह Mārk. P. ━<i>Caus.</i>
—1 To send for, cause to be brought.
—2 To invoke a deity (by means of Mantras); गायत्रीमावाहयामि, गणपतिमावाहयामि &c.
