आवेशः|आवेश
आवेशः
—1 Entering into, entrance; आवेशं कृ Pt. 1 to enter or infuse oneself into.
—2 Taking possession of, influence, exercise; स्मय˚ influence of
 pride R. 5. 19; so मदन˚, क्रोध˚, भय˚ &c.
—3 Intentness, devotedness to an object, complete absorption in one wish or idea.
—4 Pride, arrogance.
—5 Flurry, agitation, anger, passion; K. 291.
—6 Demoniacal possession.
—7 Apoplectic or epileptic giddiness.
