आव्यध्
आव्यध् €4 P.
—1 To hit, pierce; see अनाविद्ध.
—2 To wound.
—3 To break or pierce through.
—4 To put on; निवस्स्वाऽऽविध्य च स्रजम् Bk. 20. 11.
—5 To shoot at, throw or cast towards.
—6 To throw away, cast off.
—7 To wave, brandish; आविद्धावेव दृश्येते Mb. 1. 226. 3; आविध्य
 शूलं तरसा Bhāg. 10. 59. 8.
—8 To pin on.
—9 To rouse, agitate, stir up.
—10 To drive away, expel; निर्बन्धमाविध्यति Mv. 5. 39.
