आसेधः|आसेध
आसेधः Arrest, custody, legal restraint, it is of four kinds:− स्थानासेधः
 कालकृतः प्रवासात् कर्मणस्तथा Nārada; <i>i. e.</i>
——(<i>a</i>) confinement to a place,
——(<i>b</i>) limitation of time,
——(<i>c</i>) prohibition against departure, and
——(<i>d</i>) restriction from doing anything. आसेधकाल आसिद्ध आसेधं यो
 निवर्तते Śukra. 4. 616.
