आहिण्डिकः|आहिण्डिक|आहिंडिकः
आहिण्डिकः A man of mixed origin, the son of a Niṣāda father and
 Vaidehī mother; आहिण्डिको निषादेन
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0377-1" target="_blank">Page0377-1</a>]
 वैदेह्यामेव जायते Ms. 10. 37 (according to Kull., he was employed
