इतरेतर|इतरेतरं
इतर + -इतर <i>pron. a.</i> respective, reciprocal, one with another (chiefly
 in oblique cases or in comp.); वियुक्तावितरेतरम् Ms. 9. 102; ˚काम्यया 3. 35;
 R. 7. 54. ˚आश्रयः mutual dependence, inter-connection. ˚योगः
—1 mutual connection or union, मोदितालिरितरेतरयोगात् Śi. 10. 24.
—2 a variety of the Dvandva compound (opp. समाहारद्वन्द्व) where
 each member of the compound is viewed separately; as प्लक्षन्यग्रोधौ छिनात्ति.
