इन्
इन् €6. €8 P. Ved.
—1 To go.
—2 To advance or rush upon, press upon; drive.
—3 To invigorate.
—4 To force, compel.
—5 To drive away, remove.
—6 To
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0383-2" target="_blank">Page0383-2</a>]
 take possession of, pervade, fill.
—7 To dispose.
—8 To be lord or master (of anything).
