ई
ई I. €4 Ā. (ईयते) To go. ━II. €2 P.
—1 To go.
—2 To shine.
—3 To pervade.
—4 To desire, wish.
—5 To throw.
—6 To eat.
—7 To beg (Ā.).
—8 To become pregnant.
