ईक्ष्
ईक्ष् €1 Ā. (ईक्षते, ईक्षाञ्चक्रे, ऐक्षिष्ट, ईक्षितुम्, ईक्षित्वा, ईक्षित)
—1 To see, behold, view, perceive, observe, look or gaze at.
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0391-a2" target="_blank">Page0391-a2</a>]
—2 To regard, consider, look upon; सर्वभूतस्थमात्मानम् … ईक्षते
 योगयुक्तात्मा Bg. 6. 29.
—3 To take into account, care for; नाभिजनमीक्षते K. 104; न कामवृत्तिर्वचनीयमीक्षते Ku. 5. 82.
—4 To think, reflect; स ऐक्षत लोकान्तु सृजै Ait. Up. 1. 1. तत्तेज
 ऐक्षत बहु स्यां प्रजायेय Ch. Up. 6. 2. 3.
—5 To require; नाभ्यासकममीक्षते Pt. 1. 151.
—6 To look to, or to investigate, the good or bad luck of any one (with
 dat. of the person); कृष्णाय ईक्षते गर्गः Sk. (शुभाशुभं पर्यालोचयति)
 Bk. 8. 76. ━<i>With</i> {@अधि@} to suspect; सत्येऽप्यपायमधीक्षते H. 4. 102 v. l.
━{@अन्वव@}
—1 to see, behold.
—2 to consider.
—3 to care for, take into account.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0391-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

