 draw or take out, extract, extricate; अङ्गदकोटिलग्नं प्रालम्बमुत्कृष्य R. 6. 14.
—2 To draw, attract; Śi. 17. 42.
—3 To pull or put off.
—4 To increase, enhance (opp. अपकृष्).
—5 To bend (as a bow).
—6 To tear asunder. ━<i>Caus.</i> To elevate, raise, increase. ━<i>pass.</i>
—1 To be lifted, raised.
—2 To rise, be supreme or eminent.
