उत्तमसाहसः|उत्तमसाहस
उत्तम + -साहसः, -साहसम् —1 the highest (of the fixed) pecuniary punishments;
 a fine of 1000 (or according to some 80,000) paṇas; Ms. 9. 240; Y. 1. 366;
 पणानां द्वे शते सार्धे प्रथमः साहसः स्मृतः । मध्यमः पञ्च
 विज्ञेयः सहस्रं त्वेष चोत्तमः ॥ Capital punishment, banishment,
 confiscation, and mutilation are also regarded as forms of this punishment.
