उत्सवः|उत्सव
उत्सवः [उद्-सू-अप्]
—1 A festival, joyous or festive occasion, jubilee; रत˚ Ś. 6. 20;
 ताण्डव˚ festive or joyous dance. U. 3. 18 (v. l.); Ms. 3. 59.
—2 Joy, merriment, delight, pleasure; स कृत्वा विरतोत्सवान् R. 4. 78, 16. 10;
 Mv. 3. 41; Ratn. 1. 23; Śi. 2. 61; पराभवोप्युत्सव एव
 मानिनाम् Ki. 1. 41.
—3 Height, elevation.
—4 Wrath,
—5 Wish, rising of a wish. तावुभौ नरशार्दूलौ त्वद्दृशन्कृतोत्सवौ
 Rām. 5. 35. 23.
—6 A section of a book.
—7 Enterprise.
—8 An undertaking, beginning.
