उत्सेधम्
उत्सेध + .{@-धम्@}
—1 Killing, slaughter.
—2 The height from the basement to the top; उत्सेधं जन्मादिस्तूपिकान्तम् ।
 Māna. 35. 26. The different technical names of the heights of
 the idols are शान्तिक, पौष्टिक, जयद, सार्वकामिक, धनद and अद्मुत.
 Their lengths are respectively 1¼th, 1½, 1⅓rd of their breadths.
