 प्रस्थितः Pt. 1.
—2 For, for the sake of, on account of, in the name of; त्वां˚ Ś. 3
 on thy account; किं˚ for what purpose, on what account; निमित्तम्˚
 Pt. 1. 283 for some cause; त्वामुद्दिश्य सभाजनाक्षराणि M. 5 in your name.
—3 Demanding, stipulating for.
