—1 Freed from a burden or yoke, unrestrained, unchecked, free. <i>cf.</i>
 सैन्धवाः समरोद्धुराः Śiva B. 9. 65; also सङ्गरोद्धुराः <i>ibid.</i> 25. 19.
—2 Firm, intrepid, bold; अभियोग˚ Mv. 6.
—3 Victorious, conquering.
