—4 To suffice.
—5 To rise in arms, revolt, rebel. ━<i>Caus.</i>
—1 To cause to exist, create, produce; मायां मयोद्भाव्य परीक्षितोसि R. 2. 62.
—2 To proclaim; माहात्म्यम् K. 109.
—3 To use, employ.
—4 To raise, elevate.
—5 To consider, think; Vikr. 9. 19.
