 flash; विद्युदुन्मेषदृष्टिम् Me. 83.
—4 Awakening, rising, becoming visible, manifestation; ज्ञान˚ Śānti. 3. 13.
—5 The act of increasing, supporting, making strong; addition, expansion;
 इतिहासपुराणानामुन्मेषं निर्मितं च यत् Mb. 1. 1. 63.
