उन्मील्
उन्मील् €1 P.
—1 To open (as the eyes); उदमीलीच्च लोचने Bk. 15. 102, 16. 8.
—2 To be awakened or roused, be excited; उन्मिमील विशदं विषमेषुः
 Śi. 10. 72; Bk. 1. 33.
—3 To expand, blow (as lotuses); सरोभिरुन्मीलितपद्मलोचनैः
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0438-2" target="_blank">Page0438-2</a>]
