उन्मर्दनम्
उन्मर्दनम् A rubbing down of the sacrificer with sweet-smelling substances
 before sprinkling him with fat. cf. सर्वसुरभ्युन्मर्दनं भवति Śat. Br. 12. 8. 3. 16.
