उपकृ
उपकृ €8 U.
——(<i>a</i>) उपकरोति-कुरुते.
—1 To place or bring near, furnish or provide with, do or render; किं
 ते भूयः प्रियमुपकरोतु पाकशासनः V. 5; Ms. 2. 149, 245, 5. 32.
—2 To assist, serve, befriend, oblige, favour, benefit, help; प्राणैरप्युपकुर्वते
 Pt. 1. 83; Bk. 8. 18; (oft. with gen. of person); सा लक्ष्मीरुपकुरुते
 यया परेषाम् Ki. 7. 28, 8. 13; आत्मनश्चोपकर्तुम् Me. 103; Śi. 20. 74;
 K. 174; न हि दीपौ परस्परस्योपकुरुतः Ś. B.; sometimes with
 loc. also; Me. 8. 394.
—3 To foster, take care of.
—4 To render homage, serve, wait or attend upon (with acc.), हरिमुपकुरुते Sk.
—5 To begin, set about anything (with dat.).
—6 To subdue, overcome.
——(<i>b</i>) उपस्करोति, -स्कुरुते.
—1 To add, supply (वाक्याध्याहारे); उपस्कृतं ब्रूते P. VI. 1. 139. Sk.
—2 To provide or furnish with; सितातपत्रव्यजनैरुपस्कृतः Bhāg.
—3 To attend or wait on, serve.
—4 To adorn, decorate, elaborate, refine, polish, prepare, perfect; राजतं
 चानुपस्कृतम् Ms. 5. 112; उपस्कृता कन्या Sk.; शास्त्रोपस्कृतशब्दसुन्दरगिरः Bh. 2. 15.
—5
——(<i>a</i>) To care for, take care of (with acc. of person); P. I. 3. 32, VI. 1. 139.
——(<i>b</i>) To make efforts (with gen. of thing); एधोदकस्योपस्कुरुते,
 मा कस्यचिदुपस्कृथाः Bk. 8. 19, 119.
—6 To furnish badly, deform; मांसं यच्चानुपस्कृतम् Ms. 3. 257.
—7 To corrupt, defile, censure; एषोऽनुपस्कृतः प्रोक्तो योधधमः सनातनः 7. 98.
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0440-2" target="_blank">Page0440-2</a>]
—8 To bring or call together; उपस्कृता ब्राह्मणाः (= समुदिताः Sk.).
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0440-1" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

