—4 To become, take a (particular) form or shape. ━<i>Caus.</i>
—1 To prepare, get ready, equip; रथम् Ve. 2.
—2 To appoint, assign, allot; उपकल्पितं पशुम् Pt. 1; U. 2; Y. 1. 109.
—3 To vow, promise; देवतोपकल्पित Pt. 4.
—4 To set up, exhibit; इति मतिरुपकल्पिता वितृष्णा Bhāg. 1. 9. 32.
—5 To render (homage), communicate.
—6 To bring near, fetch.
—7 To assume, take.
