उपक्रमः|उपक्रम
उपक्रमः
—1 Beginning, commencement; रामोपक्रममाचख्यौ रक्षःपरिभवं नवम्
 R. 12. 42 begun by Rāma; किमुपक्रमो रावणः Mv. 2.
—2 Approach, advance; साहस˚ forcible advance Māl. 7; so योषितः
 सुकुमारोपक्रमाः <i>ibid.</i>
—3 An undertaking, work, enterprize.
—4 A plan, contrivance,
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0441-2" target="_blank">Page0441-2</a>]
