—2 Occurred, happened.
—3 Near, at hand.
—4 Got, obtained.
—5 Undergone, experienced.
—6 Furnished with; (सहित, युक्त); जहार स शिरस्त्राणं कुण्डलोपगतं
 शिरः Rām. 6. 97. 32.
—7 Gone to, become.
—8 Promised, agreed.
—9 Passed away, dead.
—10 Feeling, suffering
