उपचारच्छलम्
उपचारः + -च्छलम् A kind of fallacious inference to be refuted by reference
 to the real sense of a word used metaphorically, <i>e. g.</i> if any one
 from the sentence मञ्चाः कोशन्ति were to conclude that the मञ्च
 (platform) really cries and not persons on the platform. Nyāyadarśana.
