उपच्छन्द्
उपच्छन्द् €10 P.
—1 To wheedle, flatter, coax, entice, invite; जलेनोपच्छन्दितः Ś. 5.
 coaxed to drink water; परदारानुपच्छन्दयति Sk.
—2 To conciliate.
—3 To beseech, request; R. 5. 58.
—4 To persuade one to do a thing.
—5 To give one something.
