उपदृश्
उपदृश् €1 P. —1 To see, behold, look at, perceive. ━<i>pass.</i>
—1 To be or become visible. ━<i>Caus.</i>
—1 To cause to see, show or exhibit.
—2 To place before, show up, communicate, make (one) acquainted (with);
 राज्ञः पुरो मामुपदर्श्य H. 3; नयविद्भिर्नवे राज्ञि सदसच्चोपदर्शितम् R. 4. 10.
—3 To present a false appearance, deceive a person by a false appearance, illude.
—4 To explain, illustrate; चतुष्पाद्व्यवहारोऽयं विवादेषूपदर्शितः Y. 2. 8.
