उपनिक्षेपः
—1 The act of depositing or placing down.
—2 An open deposit, any article given in anotherʼs charge by letting him
 know its form, quantity &c. Y. 2. 25; (on which Mit. says:− उपनिक्षेपो
 नाम रूपसंख्याप्रदर्शनेन रक्षणार्थं परस्य हस्ते निहितं द्रव्यम्).
—3 A deposit sealed or covered up (?).
