उपनिष्क्रमणम्
उपनिष्क्रमणम्
—1 Going out, issuing.
—2 One of the Saṃskāras or religious rites, <i>i. e.</i> taking out a child
 for the first time into the open air (which is usually performed in the
 fourth month of its age); cf. चतुर्थे मासि कर्तव्यं शिशोर्निष्क्रमणं
 गृहात् Ms. 2. 34.
—3 A main or royal road.
