उपमर्दः|उपमर्द|उपमर्द्द
उपमर्दः
—1 Friction, rubbing or pressing down, crushing under oneʼs weight; अन्यासु
 तावदुपमर्दसहासु भृङ्गं लोलं विनोदय मनः सुमनोलतासु S. D. (where
 उ˚ also means rough handling or enjoyment).
—2 Destruction, injury, killing.
—3 Reproach, abuse, insult, harsh or insulting treatment; Mk. 1.
—4 Unhusking.
—5 Refutation of a charge.
—6 Stirring, shaking.
