उपसंख्यानम्
उपसंख्यानम्
—1 Addition.
—2 Supplementary addition, further or additional enumeration (a term technically
 applied to the <i>Vārtikas</i> of Kātyāyana which are intended to supply
 omissions in Pāṇiniʼs Sūtras and generally to supplement them); <i>e. g.</i>
 जुगुप्साविरामप्रमादार्थानामुपसंख्यानम्; cf. इष्टि.
—3 (In gram.) A substitute in form or sense.
