उपसंग्रह्|उपसङ्ग्रह्
उपसंग्रह् €9 P.
—1 To take upon oneself, experience, feel, suffer.
—2 To receive, accept.
—3 To seize, catch hold of; पाणिभ्यां तूपसंगृह्य Ms. 3. 224.
—4 To take into custody or possession.
