उपसंग्रहः|उपसङ्ग्रह
उपसंग्रहः, -हणम्
—1 Keeping pleased, supporting, maintaining; तीक्ष्णरसदायिनामुपसंग्रहार्थम् Mu. 2.
—2 Respectful salutation (as by touching the feet of the person saluted);
 स्फुरति रभसात्पाणिः पादोपसंग्रहणाय च Mv. 2. 30.
—3 Accepting, adopting; Br. Sūt. 1. 4. 41.
—4 Polite address, obeisance.
—5 Collecting, joining.
—6 Taking, accepting (as a wife); दारोपसंग्रहः Y. 1. 56.
—7 (An external) appendage, any necessary article either for use or decoration
 (उपकरण).
—8 A pillow, cushion; Mb. 4.
