—3 Furniture, appurtenance, apparatus, instrument (उपकरण); उपस्करो
 रथस्यासीत् Mb.; Śi. 18. 72.
—4 Any article or implement of household use (such as a broomstick); संयतोपस्करा
 दक्षा Y. 1. 83, 2. 193; Ms. 3. 68, 12. 66, 5. 150.
—5 An ornament.
—6 Censure, blame.
