 hurt; Ku. 5. 76.
—2 Affected by, smit, injured, struck with, overpowered; भूत˚ K. 167;
 दारिद्र्य˚, लोभ˚, दर्प˚, काम˚, शोक˚ &c.; Mu. 7.
