उपाकृ
उपाकृ €8 U.
—1 To fetch, bring near; तेभ्य इमं बलिमुपाकरोति Āśval.
—2 To summon, invite.
—3 To deliver, offer, grant, bestow, give (to another); गोसहस्रमुपाकुरु
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0470-1" target="_blank">Page0470-1</a>]
 Rām.
