उपेत
उपेत <i>p. p.</i>
—1 Come near, approached, arrived at; लोकाश्च वो मयोपेता देवा अप्यनुमन्वते
 Bhāg. 10. 23. 32.
—2 Present.
—3 Endowed with, possessed of, having; with instr. or in comp.; पुत्रमेवंगुणोपेतं
 चक्रवर्तिनमाप्नुहि Ś. 1. 12.
—4 Blockaded.
—5 Fallen into.
—6 Approached for sexual gratification.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0474-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपेतिः|उपेति
उपेतिः <i>f.</i> Arrival, approach.
