<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपेतृ
उपेतृ <i>a.</i>
—1 Approaching near to.
—2 Contriving, one who uses expedients; Ms. 7. 215.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0474-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपेय|उपेयः
उपेय <i>pot. p.</i>
—1 To be gone to or approached.
—2 To be effected by means; ˚उपायदर्शने M. 1.
—3 Assailable.
—4 To be sought; Ms. 7. 215.
—5 To be obtained.
—6 To be approached sexually;
