उररी
उररी <i>ind.</i> [ऊर्यादिच्विडाचश्च P. I. 4. 61] A particle implying
 (1) assent, admission or acceptance. (In this sense it is usually used
 with the roots कृ, भू, or अस् and it has the force of a गति
 or preposition; उररीकृत्य not उररीकृत्वा. Other forms of the
 word are उरी, उरुरी, ऊरी and ऊरुरी.); (2) Extension.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0476-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

