उल्लिख्
उल्लिख् €6 P.
—1 To scratch, cut up, scrape, tear or rip up, scarify; जलदसंहतिमुल्लिखन्त्यः
 Śi. 5. 20: K. 30; to furrow (as ground); Mv. 1. 20.
