<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊहः|ऊह
ऊह + .{@-हः@} [ऊह्-घञ्]
—1 A change, modification. ऊहदर्शनं च विवक्षितार्थानामेव भवति
 ŚB. on MS. 1. 2. 52. ऊह forms the subject-matter of जैमिनिʼs
 मीमांसासूत्र, अध्याय IX. It is said to be of three varieties; cf.
 त्रिविधश्च ऊहः मन्त्रसामसंस्कारविषयः ŚB. on MS. 9. 1. 1.
—2 A guess, conjecture; Mb. 5. 33. 28.
—3 Examination and determination.
—4 Understanding.
—5 Reasoning, arguing.
—6 Supplying an ellipsis.
—7 Attributing, ascribing.
—8 Collection.
.━{@Comp.@}: ऊहापोहः, ऊहगानम्, ऊहच्छला
