ऋत्
ऋत् Ā. ऋतीयते (a Sautra root)
—1 To reproach, contemn.
—2 To pity.
—3 To go.
—4 To rival; have power.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0489-1" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋत|ऋतं|ऋतः
ऋत <i>a.</i> [ऋ-क्त]
—1 Proper, right.
—2 Honest, true; सर्वमेतदृतं मन्ये यन्मां वदसि केशव Bg. 10. 14; Ms. 8. 82.
—3 Worshipped, respected.
—4 Bright, luminous (दीप्त)
—5 Gone, risen, moved, affected by; सुखेन ऋतः = सुखार्तः ऋते च तृतीयासमासे
 Vārt. on P. VI. 1. 89; so दुःखः˚ काम˚.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0489-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋतम्
ऋत + .{@-तम्@} <i>ind.</i> Rightly, properly.
