ॠ
ॠ <i>ind.</i> An interjection of (1) terror; (2) warding off; (3) reproach
 or censure; (4) compassion; (5) remembrance; (6) Commencement of speech;
 (7) protection; (8) pride; (9) looking up. ━<i>m.</i> ({@ॠः@})
—1 N. of Bhairava.
—2 A Dānava or demon. ━<i>f.</i>
—1 The
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0493-a2" target="_blank">Page0493-a2</a>]
 mother of the gods; also of the demons.
—2 Recollection.
—3 Motion, going. ━<i>n.</i> The breast. (cf. also ॠर्निषेधो भवः पूषा
 वरुणोऽमरराडजः । करी तरुर्नरः पाप्मा विद्वानथ रमापतिः ॥ Enm.)
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0493-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ॠ
ॠ €9 P. (ऋणाति, ईर्ण) To go, move.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0493-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऌ
ऌ <i>ind.</i>
—1 The earth.
—2 A mountain.
—3 The mother of the gods.
—4 The female nature.
—5 A mystical letter. (<i>N. B.</i>:− No Sanskrit word begins with ऌ
 or ॡ, except some of the technical names of Pāṇini for tenses and
 moods; <i>e. g.</i> ऌङ् and ऌट्). cf. also ऌर्म्लेच्छो
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0493-b2" target="_blank">Page0493-b2</a>]
 ऽरुणवर्णः स्यात्क्लीबः पापी पराजितः । वीतरागोऽथ पाखण्डी कमलं मरणं च ऌ ॥ Enm.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0493-b1" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ॡ
ॡ <i>f.</i> A mother, a divine female. ━<i>m.</i> Śiva. ━<i>f.</i> = ऌ.
 cf. ॡमहात्मा सुरो बालो भूपः स्तोमः कथानकः (वक्ता) | मूर्खो
 शिश्नो गुदः कक्षा केशः पापरतो नरः ॥ Enm.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0493-b2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ए
ए €2 P. (आ + इ)
—1 To come, approach &c.; आमायन्तु ब्रह्मचारिणः T. Up. 1. 4. 2.
—2 To reach, attain, come into (a state or position) स सर्वसमतामेत्य Ms. 12. 125.
—3 To submit; fall to oneʼs share; तस्मात्त्वां पृथग्वलय आयन्ति Ch. Up. 5. 14. 1.
 (आययन्ति ?). (See इ).
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0493-c1" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एः
एः <i>m.</i>
—1 N. of Viṣṇu.
—2 The number खर्व; cf. also एः कुमारोऽसुरोऽरातिर्ज्ञातीयोऽहित उद्धतः ।
 आत्मा शेषो विवस्वांश्च कृतार्थो मध्वरिः शरः ॥ Enm. ━<i>ind.</i> An
 interjection of (1) remembering; (2) envy; (3) compassion; (4) calling;
 (5) contempt or censure.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0493-c1" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एक|एकं|एकः
एक <i>pron. a.</i> [इ-कन्]
—1 One, single, alone, only; वायुर्यथैको भुवनं प्रविष्टो … एकस्तथा …
 Kaṭh. 2. 5. 10; Mb. 4. 49. 5, 6; बलिभिर्मुखमाक्रान्तं पलितैरङ्कितं
 शिरः । गात्राणि शिथिलायन्ते तृणैका तरुणायते ॥ Bh. 3. 14.
—2 Not accompanied by anyone; एकः संप्रति नाशितप्रियतमस्तामद्य
 रामः कथम् U. 2. 28.
—3 The same, one and the same, identical;
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0493-c2" target="_blank">Page0493-c2</a>]
 एकान्वयो मम Ś. 7; मनस्येकं वचस्येकं कर्मण्येकं महात्मनाम् H. 1. 197.
—4 Firm, unchanged; एको ग्रहस्तु Pt. 1. 260.
—5 Single of its kind, unique, singular.
—6 Chief, supreme, prominent, sole; ब्राह्मण्यास्तद्धरेत्पुत्र एकांशं
 वै पितुर्धनात् Mb. 13. 47. 11. ˚पार्थिव, ˚धनुर्धरः, ˚ऐश्वर्य M. 1. 1
 sole sovereignty; एको रागिषु राजते Bh. 3. 121.
—7 Peerless, matchless.
—8 One of two or many; Me. 30. एकः सख्यास्तव सह मया वामपादाभिलाषी Me. 80.
—9 Oft. used like the English indefinite article ‘a’ or ‘an’; ज्योतिरेकम् Ś. 5. 30.
—10 True.
—11 Little. Oft. used in the middle of comp. in the sense of ‘only’, with
 an adjectival or adverbial force; दोषैकदृक् looking only to faults;
 त्वदेकेषु Ku. 3. 15 your arrow only; so भोगैकबद्धस्पृहः. एकः ━अन्यः,
 or अपरः the one━the other; अजामेकां लोहित …
 नमामः । अजो ह्येको … अजोन्यः Śvet. Up. 4. 5; it is used in the
 plural in the sense of some, its correlative being अन्ये or अपरे
 (others); एके समूहुर्बलरेणुसंहतिं शिरोभिराज्ञामपरे महीभृतः ॥
 Śi. 12. 45; see अन्य, अपर also.
