 undivided attention. ˚चित्तम्, ˚चित्तता intentness of purpose, concentration
 of mind; तत्रैकाग्रं सनःकृत्वा Bg. 6. 12, 18. 72. ˚दृष्टि <i>a.</i>
 fixing oneʼs eye on one spot.
