एकादश
एकादश <i>a.</i> (-शी <i>f.</i>)
—1 Eleventh. आत्मैकादशः Bṛ. Up. 3. 9. 4.
—2 Consisting of eleven.
—3 Lasting for eleven
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0499-1" target="_blank">Page0499-1</a>]
 months.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकादशी
एकादश + .{@-शी@}
—1 The eleventh day of every fortnight of a lunar month, sacred to Viṣṇu;
 (when fasting is enjoined and is considered to be productive of great
 religious merit).
—2 Presentations of offerings to deceased ancestors or Pitṛs on the eleventh
 day after decease.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकादशम्
