एध्
एध् €1 Ā.
 (एधते, एधाञ्चक्रे, ऐधिष्ट, एधितुम्, एधित) —1 To grow, increase;
 विनापि संगमं स्त्रीणां कवीनां सुखमेधते Pt. 2. 164.
—2 To prosper, become happy, live in comfort; द्वावेतौ सुखमेधेते Pt. 1. 318.
—3 To grow strong, become
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0500-2" target="_blank">Page0500-2</a>]
 great.
—4 To extend.
—5 To swell, rise.
.━<i>Caus.</i> To cause to grow or increase; to greet, celebrate, honour;
 नैदिधः स्वपराक्रम् Bk. 15. 19; (तां) आशीर्भिरेधयामासुः Ku. 6. 90.
━<i>Desid.</i> एदिधिषते.
