कटः|कट
कटः
—1 A straw mat; Ms. 2. 204.
—2 The hip; Mb. 13. 53. 42.
—3 Hip and loins; the hollow above the hips.
—4 The temples of an elephant; कण्डूयमानेन कटं कदाचित् R. 2. 37, 3. 37, 4. 47.
—5 A particular throw of the dice in hazard; नर्दितदशिंतमार्गः कटेन
 विनिपातितो यामि Mk. 2. 8.
—6 A kind of grass; दग्धव्यौ वा कटाग्निना Ms. 8. 377.
—7 Excess (as in उत्कट).
—8 A corpse; कटधूमस्य सौरभ्यमवघ्राय व्रजौकसः Bhāg. 10. 6. 41.
—9 A hearse, bier.
—10 An arrow.
—11 A custom.
—12 A cemetery, burial ground.
—13 A time or season.
—14 The plant Saccharum Sara (शर).
—15 An annual plant.
—16 Grass (in general).
—17 A thin piece of wood, plank.
—18 See कटाक्ष; घ्नन्तीवैक्षत्कटाक्षेपैः Bhāg. 10. 32. 6.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0519-1" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कटी
कटः + .{@-टी@} Long pepper.
