<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कटाग्निः|कटाग्नि
कटः + -अग्निः a fire kept up with dry grass or straw; the straw placed
 round a criminal to be burnt. दग्धव्यौ वा कटाग्निना Ms. 8. 377; Y. 2. 282.
