कण्टकफलः|कण्टकफल|कंटकफल
कण्टकः + -फलः
—1 the bread-fruit tree, Panasa tree.
—2 the गोक्षुर plant.
—3 the castor-oil tree.
—4 the Dhattūra tree.
—5 a term applicable to any plant the fruit of which is invested with
 a hairy or thorny coat.
