कद्
कद् I. €4 Ā. (कद्यते) To be confounded or confused, to suffer
 mentally. ━II. €1 Ā. (कदते) also €1 P.
—1 To cry, to weep or shed tears.
—2 To grieve.
—3 To call.
—4 To kill or hurt; see कन्द्.
