कलना
कलन + .{@-ना@}
—1 Taking, seizing, grasping; कालकलना Ā. L. 29.
—2 Doing, effecting.
—3 Subjection.
—4 Understanding, comprehension.
—5 Putting on, wearing; also letting loose; चूडाकलनाम् Śi. 3. 5.
