कलञ्जन्यायः
कलञ्जः + -न्यायः the rule according to which a negation connected with
 an act constitutes prohibition of that act. This is discussed and established
 by जैमिनि (6. 2. 19) and शबर in connection with texts like
 न कलञ्जं भक्षयेत् in MS. 6. 2. 19-20; ŚB. on MS. 1. 1. 4.
