—1 The viscous sediment deposited by oily substances when ground.
—2 A kind of tenacious paste; गौरसर्षपकल्केन (स्नपनम्) Y. 1. 277.
 An unguent paste; कल्कांश्चूर्णकषायांश्च स्नानानि विविधानि च
 Rām. 2. 91. 74; a paste used as plaster or cement also called Yoga (mixture).
—3 (Hence) Dirt, filth (in general).
