कल्किः|कल्कि
कल्किः The tenth and last incarnation of Viṣṇu in his capacity
 of the destroyer of the wicked and liberator of the world from its enemies;
 (Jayadeva, while referring to the several <i>avatāras</i> of Viṣṇu, thus
 refers to the last or <i>Kalki</i> avatāra:− म्लेच्छनिवहनिधने कलयसि
 करवालं धूमकेतुमिव किमपि करालम् । केशवधृतकल्किशरीरं जय जगदीश
 हरे ॥ Gīt. 1. 10.)
