—1 A lover.
—2 A husband; कान्तोदन्तः सुहृदुपगतः संगमात् किंचिदूनः Me. 102;
 Śi. 10. 3, 29.
—3 Any beloved person.
—4 The moon.
—5 The spring.
—6 A kind of iron.
—7 A precious stone (in comp. with सूर्य, चन्द्र and अयस्).
—8 An epithet of (1) Kārttikeya, (2) Kṛṣṇa.
