कारः|कार
कार + .{@-रः@}
—1 Act, action; as in पुरुषकार.
—2 A term denoting a sound or a word which is not inflected; as अकार
 Ms. 2. 76, 125; ककार, फूत्कार &c.
—3 Effort, exertion; ‘कारौ वधे निश्चये च बले यत्ने रतावपि’ इति
 विश्वः. Śi. 19. 27.
—4 Religious austerity.
—5 A husband, lord; master.
—6 Determination.
—7 Power, strength.
—8 A tax or toll.
—9 A heap of snow.
—10 The Himālaya mountain.
—11 Water produced by hail. —12 Killing, slaughter.
