काल|कालं|कालः
काल <i>a.</i> (-ली <i>f.</i>)
—1 Black, of a dark or dark-blue colour; Rām. 5. 17. 9; Mb. 8. 49. 48.
—2 Injuring,
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0565-2" target="_blank">Page0565-2</a>]
 hurting.
