<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किमाख्य
किम् + -आख्य <i>a.</i> having what name; किमाख्यस्य राजर्षेः सा पत्नी. Ś. 7.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0572-1" target="_blank">PDF</a>
