कुरवः|कुरव
कुरवः(बः), कुरव(ब)कः A species of amaranth; [Barlaria Prionitis
 Linn] It is a handsome shrub. Kālidāsa describes the plant as कान्तामुखद्युति
 (cf. Ṛs. 6. 18). Modern scientists describe it as a lipped flower referring
 to the form of its petals. कुरवका रवकारणतां ययुः R. 9. 29; Me. 80; Ṛs. 6. 18.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0585-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
