कृतिः|कृति
कृतिः <i>f.</i> [कृ-क्तिन्]
—1 Doing, manufacturing, making, performing.
—2 Action, deed.
—3 Creation, literary work, composition; (तौ) स्वकृतिं गापयामास
 कविप्रथमपद्धतिम् R. 15. 33, 64, 69; N. 22. 155.
—4 Magic, enchantment.
—5 Injuring, killing; स कृत्या चकितो गत्वा मुनिं वव्रे पुरोहितम् Bm. 1. 27.
—6 The number ‘20’.
—7 An enchantress, a witch.
—8 A knife.
—9 Way-laying; hurting, injuring
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0597-2" target="_blank">Page0597-2</a>]
 (Ved.).
—10 A square number.
—11 (in drama) Confirmation of any obtainment.
