कृतिन्
कृतिन् <i>a.</i> [कृतमनेन, कृत-इनि]
—1 One who has done his work or gained his end, satisfied, contented,
 happy, successful; यस्य वीर्येण कृतिनो वयं च भुवनानि च U. 1. 32;
 न खल्वनिर्जित्य रघुं कृती भवान् R. 3. 51, 12. 64.
—2 (Hence) Lucky, fortunate, blessed; Ś. 1. 23, 7. 19.
—3 Clever, competent, able, expert, skilful, wise, learned; तं क्षुरप्रशकलीकृतं
 कृती R. 11. 29, 19. 14; Ku. 2. 10; Ki. 2. 9; Śi. 2. 25, 30; H. 3. 89; Ve. 4. 12.
—4 Good, virtuous, pure, pious; तावदेव कृतिनामपि स्फुरत्येष निर्मलविवेकदीपकः Bh. 1. 56.
—5 Following, obeying, doing what is enjoined.
