कौलीनम्
कौलीन + .{@-नम्@}
—1 An evil report, a scandal; मालविकागतं किमपि कौलीनं श्रूयते
 M. 3; तदेव कौलीनमिव प्रतिभाति V. 2; Me. 114; कौलीनमात्माश्रयमाचचक्षे R. 14. 36, 84.
—2 An improper act, bad or scandalous conduct; ख्याते तस्मिन् वितमसि
 कुले जन्म कौलीनमेतत् Ve. 2. 10.
—3 A combat of animals.
—4 Cock-fighting.
—5 War, battle (in general).
—6 High birth.
—7 A privity, the pudenda.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0612-1" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कौलीन्यम्
कौलीन्यम्
