क्रियाद्वेषिन्
क्रिया + -द्वेषिन् <i>m.</i> a witness whose
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0616-1" target="_blank">Page0616-1</a>]
 testimony is prejudicial to the cause (one of the five kinds of witnesses).
