क्रयविक्रयिन्
क्रयः + -विक्रयिन् <i>a.</i>
—1 buying or selling, striking a bargain; Ms. 5. 41, 8. 400; Y. 2. 262.
—2 One who buys an article at a lower rate and sells it at a higher rate;
