क्रीतम्
क्रीत + .{@-तम्@} A bargain.
.━{@Comp.@}: क्रीतानुशयः
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0616-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीतानुशयः|क्रीतानुशय
क्रीत + -अनुशयः ‘repenting a purchase’, rescission, returning a thing
