क्षर्
क्षर् €1 P. [क्षरति-क्षरित] (Used transitively or intransitively)
—1 To flow, glide.
—2 To send or stream forth, pour out, emit; तेषु क्षरत्सु बहुधा मदवारिधाराः
 R. 13. 74; Bk. 9. 8.
—3 To drop, trickle, ooze.
—4 To waste away, wane, perish.
—5 To become useless, have no effect; यज्ञोऽनृतेन क्षरति तपः क्षरति
 विस्मयात् Ms. 4. 237.
—6 To melt.
—7 To slip from, be deprived of (with abl.). ━<i>Caus.</i> (क्षारयति-ते)
 To accuse, traduce (usually with आ). ━<i>With</i> {@वि@} to melt away, dissolve.
