क्षेपक|क्षेपकः
क्षेपक <i>a.</i> [क्षिप्-ण्वुल्] A thrower, sender; जलेऽग्निक्षेपकं
 शृणु Ks. 61. 9.
—2 Interpolated, inserted (as a passage); cf. N. 22. 48.
—3 Abusive, disrespectful.
