खिलः|खिल|खिलं
खिलः, -लम् + .{@-लः@} N. of Brahmā and of Viṣṇu. [खिल is often used in
 combination with भू and कृ; (1) खिलीभू
——(<i>a</i>) to become impassable, to be blocked up, be left unfrequented;
 खिलीभूते विमानानां तदापातभयात्पथि Ku. 2. 45.
——(<i>b</i>) to be impossible, be rendered impracticable or stopped; प्रजागरात्खिलीभूतस्तस्याः
 स्वप्नसमागमः Ś. 6. 22. (2) खिलीकृ means
——(<i>a</i>) to obstruct, impede, make impassable, block up; तौ सुकेतसुतया
 खिलीकृते R. 11. 14, 87.
——(<i>b</i>) to lay waste, devastate, put down or vanquish completely; विपक्षमखिलीकृत्य
 प्रतिष्ठा खलु दुर्लभा Śi. 2. 34.]
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0639-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
