ख्या
ख्या €2 P. (<i>m.</i> also in non-conjugational tenses) (ख्याति, ख्यात)
 To tell, declare, communicate with dat. of person. ━<i>Pass.</i> (ख्यायते)
—1 To be named or called; आवयोः पितरं विद्धि ख्यातं दशरथं भुवि Bk. 6. 97.
—2 To be known or famous. ━<i>Caus.</i> (ख्यापयति-ते)
—1 To make
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0641-1" target="_blank">Page0641-1</a>]
 known, proclaim; ख्यापयेदभयानि च Ms. 7. 201.
—2 To tell, declare, relate; परगुणकथनैः स्वान्गुणान्ख्यापयन्तः
 Bh. 2. 69; Ms. 11. 99.
—3 To extol, make renowned, praise.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0640-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ख्यात|ख्यातः
ख्यात <i>p. p.</i> [ख्या-क्त]
—1 Known; ख्यातं नभःशब्दमयेन नाम्ना R. 18. 6.
—2 Named, called.
—3 Told.
—4 Celebrated, famous, well-known.
—5 Notorious; ख्यातः शक्रो भगाङ्गो विधुरपि मलिनो माधवो गोपजातः Udb.
—6 Made known, betrayed, discovered; (ख्यापित <i>p. p.</i> <i>Caus.</i>) प्रमादालस्यजाड्यानि
 ख्यापितानि Pt. 1. 39.
