गमः|गम
गम + .{@-मः@}
—1 Going, moving.
—2 March; आदरेण गमं चक्रुर्विषमेष्वप्यसङ्घसाः Bk. 7. 56; अश्वस्यैकाहगमः.
—3 The march of an assailant.
—4 A road.
—5 Inconsiderateness, thoughtlessness.
—6 Superficiality, careless perusal.
—7 (Sexual) intercourse with a woman, cohabitation; गुर्वङ्गनागमः
 Ms. 11. 55; Y. 2. 293.
—8 A game played with dice and men.
—9 Removal (as of fraction in math.)
