गमनम्
गमनम् [गम्-ल्युट्]
—1 Going, motion, gait; श्रोणीभारादलसगमना Me. 84; so गजेन्द्रगमने Ś. Til. 7.
—2 Going, motion; considered as one of the five <i>karmans</i> by the Vaiśeṣikas.
—3 Approaching, going to.
—4 March of an assailant.
—5 Undergoing, suffering.
—6 Obtaining, attaining.
—7 Cohabitation.
—8 Knowledge, understanding; नाञ्जः स्वरूपगमने प्रभवन्ति भूम्नः
 Bhāg. 8. 7. 34.
