गमनीय <i>pot. p.</i>
—1 Accessible, approachable; विकारस्य गमनीयास्मि संवृत्ता Ś. 1.
—2 Intelligible, easy to be comprehended.
—3 Fit to be practised or observed.
—4 Relating to sexual intercourse; गुरुस्त्री˚ Ms. 11. 103 (पापम्);
 for other senses see गम्य.
