—2 Pasture-land.
—3 The milk, curds &c. of a cow; Mb. 13. 66. 13.
—4 A bow-string; श्रवणोपान्तिकनीयमानगव्यम्
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0655-1" target="_blank">Page0655-1</a>]
 Śi. 20. 19.
—5 Colouring substance, yellow pigment.
—6 The sacrificial act called गवामयनम्; गव्यस्य च तदादिषु MS. 8. 1. 18;
 गव्यमिति गवामयनं ब्रूमः ŚB. on MS. 8. 1. 18.
