गॄ
गॄ I. €9 P. (गृणाति, गूर्ण)
—1 To utter a sound, call out, invoke; नामापि नाम गृणताममृतत्वाय
 कल्पताम् Mv. 7. 15.
—2 To announce, speak, utter, proclaim; ब्रह्मर्षिभिः परं ब्रह्म गृणद्भिरुपतस्थिरे R. 10. 63.
—3 To relate, promulgate.
—4 To praise, extol; केचिद्भीताः प्राञ्जलयो गृणन्ति Bg. 11. 21; Bk. 8. 77.
 ━<i>With</i> {@अनु@} to encourage; गृणद्भ्योऽनुगृणन्त्यन्ये Bk. 8. 77.
━II. €6 P. (गिरति or गिलति)
—1 To swallow,
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0670-2" target="_blank">Page0670-2</a>]
 devour, eat up.
—2 To send forth, pour out, spit out, or eject, from the mouth. ━<i>With</i> {@अव@}
 (Ātm.) to eat, devour; तथावगिरमाणैश्च पिशाचैर्मांसशोणितम् Bk. 8. 30.
━III. €10 Ā. (गारयते)
—1 To make known, relate.
—2 To teach.
