गोष्पदम्
गोष्पदम्
—1 A cowʼs foot.
—2 The mark or impression of a cowʼs foot in the soil.
—3 The quantity of water sufficient to fill such an impression; <i>i. e.</i>
 a very small puddle; गोष्पदे संप्लुतोदके Mb. 1. 31. 9. ˚प्रम्
 (णमुल्) in such a manner that a cowʼs footprint be filled; ददाल
 भूर्नभो रक्तं गोष्पदप्रं ववर्ष च Bk. 14. 20.
—4 As much as a cows foot-step will hold.
—5 A spot frequented by cows.
