ग्रहणिः|ग्रहणि
ग्रहणिः, -णी <i>f.</i>
—1 An imaginary organ supposed to lie between the stomach and the intestines.
—2 The small intestines or that part of the alimentary canal where the
 bile assists digestion and from which vital warmth is diffused.
—3 Diarrhoea, dysentery.
