चक्षुष्मत्|चक्षुष्मन्त्
चक्षुष्मत् <i>a.</i>
—1 Seeing, furnished with eyes, endowed with the faculty of sight; तदा
 चक्षुष्मतां प्रीतिरासीत्समरसा द्वयोः R. 4. 18; ˚ता 4. 13.
—2 Having a clear sight or good eyes.
—3 Possessed of foresight; Kau. A. 1. 9.
