चन
चन <i>ind.</i> Not, not also, even not; आपश्चन प्र मिनाति व्रतं
 वाम् Rv. 2. 24. 12; (not used by itself, but found used in combination
 with the pronoun किम् or its derivatives, such as कद्, कथं, क्व,
 कदा, कुतः to which it imparts an indefinite sense; see under किम्).
 <i>Note</i>:− Some regard चन to be not a separate word, but a combination
 of च and न.
