चाणूरः|चाणूर
चाणूरः A celebrated wrestler in the service of Kaṃsa. When Kṛṣṇa
 was taken by Akrūra to Mathurā, Kaṃsa sent this redoubtable wrestler
 to fight with him; but in the duel which ensued, Kṛṣṇa whirled him
 round and round several times and smashed his head.
.━{@Comp.@}: चाणूरमर्दनः, चाणूरसूदनः
