—1 Fallen down, slipped, fallen.
—2 Removed, expelled.
—3 Strayed, erred, deviated from.
—4 Deprived.
—5 Broken, disordered.
—6 Dropped, oozed out.
—7 Lost, gone, perished; R. 3. 45.
—8 Moved, shaken.
—9 (also -त्री) Free quarters in connection with temples.
