 संप्रहारेऽच्युतत्तयोः Bk. 6. 28.
—2 To drop or fall down, slip; इदं कवचमच्योतति Bk. 6. 29.
—3 To cause to drop or steam forth.
—4 To wet thoroughly, moisten.
