जहल्लक्षणा
जहत् + -लक्षणा, -स्वार्था a kind of लक्षणा (also called लक्षणलक्षणा)
 in which a word loses its primary sense, but is used in one which is in
 some way connected with the primary sense; <i>e. g.</i> in the familiar instance
 गङ्गायां घोषः ‘a hamlet on the Ganges’, गङ्गा loses its primary
 sense and means गङ्गातट; cf. अजहत्स्वार्था also.
—2 irony.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0732-1" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

