 अप्याकरसमुत्पन्ना मणिजातिरसंस्कृता । जातरूपेण कल्याणि न हि संयोगमर्हति ॥
 M. 5. 18; N. 1. 129.
—2 the form in which a person is born, <i>i. e.</i> nakedness.
—3 the thorn apple. ˚धर <i>a.</i> naked.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0733-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

