जिह्म|जिह्मं|जिह्मः
जिह्म <i>a.</i> [जहाति सरलमार्गम्; हा-मन् सन्वत् आलोपश्च Uṇ. 1. 138]
—1 Sloping, athwart, oblique.
—2 Crooked, awry, squint; Ṛs. 1. 12.
—3 Tortuous, curved, going irregularly.
—4 Curved, bent.
—5 Morally crooked, deceitful, dishonest, wicked, unfair; धृतहेतिरप्यधृतजिह्ममतिः
 Ki. 6. 24; सुहृदर्थमीहितमजिह्मधियाम् Śi. 9. 62.
—5 Dim, dark, pale-coloured; विधिसमयनियोगाद्दीप्तिसंहारजिह्मम् Ki. 1. 46.
—6 Slow, lazy.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0738-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

