—1 A bow-string; विश्रामं लभतामिदं च शियिलज्याबन्धमस्मद्धनुः
 Ś. 2. 6; R. 3. 59, 11. 15, 12. 104.
—2 The chord of an arc.
—3 The earth.
—4 A mother.
—5 Overpowering force or strength.
—6 Excessive demand, importunity.
—7 A kind of wooden stick (शम्या).
—8 The rear of the army; ज्या भूमिमौर्व्योः शम्यायां वाहिन्याः पृष्ठभागके ।
 Nm. Hence ˚घातवारणम् A hand-guard used by the archers and ˚घोषः
 The twanging of the bow.
