<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तक्ष्
तक्ष् <i>a.</i> (At the end of comp.) Paring, cutting &c.; also तक्ष;
 Bṛ. S. 87. 20, 24; also तक्षक q. v.; R. 15. 89.
