तन्त्रिन्|तंत्रिन्
तन्त्रिन् <i>a.</i>
—1 Having threads, made of threads.
—2 Having chords or wires (as a lute).
—3 Having a Tantra, or following one. ━<i>m.</i>
—1 A musician.
—2 A soldier. ━<i>n.</i> An act having a group of subsidiaries common with
 some other act, a main act (प्रधानकर्म); तन्त्रीणि प्रधानानि ।
 ŚB. on MS. 12. 1. 1.
.━{@Comp.@}: तन्त्रिसमवायः
