तम|तमं|तमः
तम A Taddhita affix of the superlative degree applied to nouns,
 adjectives and also to verbs and indeclinables in which latter case it
 is changed to तमाम्; अश्व˚ Pt. 5 ‘the best horse’; सुहृत्तम
 Mu. 1; so पचतितमाम्. It is also added to pronouns in the sense of
 ‘one of many’ <i>e. g.</i> कतम, यतम, ततम &c.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0762-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
