 Bg. 2. 55; Bk. 2. 13, 15. 8; R. 3. 62.
—2 To become calm or quiet.
—3 To satisfy, please (with acc.). ━<i>Caus.</i> (तोषयति-ते) To
 please, gratify, satisfy.
