तुष्ट|तुष्टः
तुष्ट <i>p. p.</i> [तुष् कर्तरि क्त]
—1 Pleased, satisfied, delighted, gratified, contented.
—2 Contented with what one possesses and indifferent to everything else.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0780-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुष्टः|तुष्ट
तुष्ट + .{@-ष्टः@} N. of Viṣṇu.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0780-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुष्टिः|तुष्टि
तुष्टिः <i>f.</i> [तुष्-भावे-क्तिन्]
—1 Satisfaction, gratification, pleasure, contentment.
—2 (In Sāṅ. phil.) Acquiescence, indifference to everything except what is possessed.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0780-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तोषः|तोष
तोषः [तुष्-भावे घञ्] Satisfaction, contentment, pleasure, delight.
━<i>a.</i> Pleasing, gratifying; तत्कर्म हरितोषं यत्सा विद्या तन्मतिर्यया
 Bhāg. 4. 29. 50.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0780-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तोषण
तोषण <i>a.</i> [तुष्-कर्तरि ल्यु] Satisfying, gratifying, pleasing.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0780-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तोषणम्
तोषण + .{@-णम्@} [भावे ल्युट्]
—1 Satisfaction, gratification, contentment.
—2 Anything that gives satisfaction, a gratification.
