दक्ष्
दक्ष् €1 Ā. (दक्षते)
—1 To grow, increase.
—2 To do, go or act quickly.
—3 To hurt, kill.
—4 To act conformably to another (P.).
—5 To be competent or able; सुशंसो यश्च दक्षते Rv. 7. 16. 6.
—6 To go, move.
.━<i>Caus.</i>
—1 To gladden; किंनु चित्रमधिवेदि भूपतिर्दक्षयन्द्विजगणानपूयत Śi. 14. 35.
—2 To make able or strong.
