दघ्
दघ् I. €5 P. (दघ्नोति)
—1 To kill, hurt.
—2 To go, leap.
—3 To protect. ━II. €4 P. (दध्यति) Ved.
—1 To go, flow.
—2 To reach, attain.
—3 To go away.
