—3 A line, streak (as of lightning); विद्युद्दाम्ना हेमराजीव विन्ध्यम्
 M. 3. 20; Me. 27.
—4 A large bandage.
—5 Ved. A gift.
—6 A portion, share.
—7 A girdle.
