दृ
दृ I. €6 Ā. (द्रियते, दृत; <i>desid.</i> दिदरिषते) (rarely
 used by itself, usually found in combination with आ)
—1 To respect, honour, worship, reverence; द्वितीयाद्रियते सदा H. Pr. 7;
 Mv. 7. 3; Bk. 6. 55.
—2 To care for, mind; usually with न.
—3 To apply or devote oneself closely to, have regard for; भूरि श्रुतं
 शाश्वतमाद्रियन्ते Māl. 1. 5.
—4 To desire. ━II. €5 P. (दृणोति) To hurt, kill. ━III. €10 P. (दारयति,
 दरयति) to fear; L. D. B.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0829-1" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

