दर्शपूर्णमासन्यायः
दर्श + -पूर्णमासन्यायः The rule according to which the same act can
 be said to yield all desired objects but only one at a time (and not simultaneously).
 This is established by जैमिनि and शबर in MS. 4. 3. 25-28 (see
 योगसिद्धिन्याय).
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0830-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दर्शयामिनी
