<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दर्शकः|दर्शक
दर्शक + .{@-कः@}
—1 One who shows or exhibits.
—2 A door-keeper, warder.
—3 A skilful man, one proficient in any art or science.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0830-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दर्शत|दर्शतः
दर्शत <i>a.</i> [दृश् कर्मणि अतच्] Ved.
—1 Visible. यद्वै चतुर्थं तत्तुरीयं दर्शतं पदमिति Bṛ. Up. 5. 14. 3.
—2 Beautiful.
