दॄ
दॄ I. €4. €9 P. (दीर्यति, दॄणाति, दीर्ण)
—1 To burst or break asunder, split open.
—2 To cause to burst, tear, divide, rend, sunder, pull to pieces. ━<i>Pass.</i> (दीर्यते)
—1 To burst, break open, be sundered; कथमेवं प्रलपतां वः सहस्रधा
 न दीर्णमनया जिह्वया Ve. 3.
—2 To separate.
—3 To be afraid, to fear. ━<i>Caus.</i> (द(दा)रयति-ते)
—1 To split, tear asunder, divide by digging.
—2 To disperse, scatter. ━II. €1 P. (दरति) To fear, be afraid of.
 (With prepositions like अव, आ, प्र, &c. the root does not change its meaning.)
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0832-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

