देवप्रियः|देवप्रिय
देव + -प्रियः ‘dear to the gods’, an epithet of Śiva; (देवानांप्रियः
 an irreg. comp. meaning
—1 a goat.
—2 a fool, idiot like a brute breast, as in तेऽप्यतात्पर्यज्ञा देवानांप्रियाः K. P.
—3 an ascetic, who renounces the world).
