देवनम्
देवनः + .{@-नम्@}
—1 Beauty, splendour, lustre.
—2 Gaming, gambling, a game at dice; प्रकाशमेतत्तास्कर्यं यद्देवनसमाह्वयौ Ms. 9. 222.
—3 Play, sport, pastime.
—4 A pleasure-ground, a garden.
—5 A lotus.
—6 Emulation, desire to excel.
—7 Affair, business.
—8 Praise.
—9 Going, motion.
—10 Grief, lamentation, sorrow.
