धर|धरः
धर <i>a.</i> (-रा, -री <i>f.</i>)
 [धृ-अच्] (Usually at the end of comp.) Holding,
 carrying, bearing, wearing, containing, possessing, endowed with, preserving,
 observing, &c.; as in अक्षधर, अंशुधर, गदाधर, गङ्गाधर, महीधर,
 असृग्धर, दिव्याम्बरधर &c.
