—2 The world.
—3 The sun.
—4 The female breast.
—5 Rice, corn.
—6 The
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0854-2" target="_blank">Page0854-2</a>]
 Himālaya (as king of mountains). —7 A dike, bank.
