नञ्
नञ् <i>ind.</i> The technical term for the negative particle; न
 hence नञः (= A negative particle); द्वौ नञौ प्रकृतार्थं गमयतः.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0874-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
