नद्
नद् €1 P. (नदति, नदित)
—1 To sound, resound, thunder (as a cloud &c.); वामश्चायं नदति मधुरं
 चातकस्ते सगन्धः Me. 9;
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0875-2" target="_blank">Page0875-2</a>]
 नदत्याकाशगङ्गायाः स्रोतस्युद्दामदिग्गजे R. 1. 78; Śi. 5. 63; Bk. 2. 4.
—2 To speak, shout, cry, roar (often with words like शब्द, खन, नाद
 &c. as object); ननाद बलवन्नादम्, शब्दं घोरतरं नदन्ति Mb.
—3 To vibrate. ━<i>Caus.</i> (नादयति-ते)
—1 To fill with noise, make noisy or resonant.
—2 To cause to make a sound. ━<i>With</i> {@उद्@} to roar, cry (loudly), bellow
 (as a bull); असोढसिंहध्वनिरुन्ननाद Ku. 1. 56.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0875-1" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नदः|नद
