नाक्षत्रम्
नाक्षत्र + .{@-त्रम्@} A month computed by the moonʼs passage through the 27 lunar
 mansions, a month of 30 days of six Ghaṭīs each; नाडीषष्ठपा तु नाक्षत्रमहोरात्रं
 प्रकीर्तितम् Sūrya S.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0884-1" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

