<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नाक्षत्रिकः|नाक्षत्रिक
नाक्षत्रिक + .{@-कः@} A month of 27 days (each day being the period of the moonʼs
 passage through a lunar asterism).
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0884-1" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नाक्षत्रिकी
नाक्षत्रिक + .{@-की@} The state (दशा) which a man suffers agreeably to the
 asterism presiding over his nativity.
