निगदः|निगद
निगदः, निगादः
—1 Recitation, audible recitation of prayers.
—2 A prayer repeated aloud.
—3 Speech, discourse.
—4 Learning anything without knowing the meaning; यदधीतमविज्ञातं
 निगदेनैव शब्द्यते Nir.
—5 Mention, mentioning; इति निगदेनैव व्याख्यातम्.
