निबुध्
निबुध् €1 P.
—1 To know, understand, learn; निबोध साधो तव चेत् कुतूहलम्
 Ku. 5. 52, 3. 14; Ms. 1. 68; Y. 1. 2.
—2 To regard or consider as, deem.
—3 To listen or attend to. ━<i>Caus.</i> To explain, inform, acquaint.
