निर्
निर् <i>ind.</i> A substitute for निस् before vowels and soft consonants
 conveying the senses of ‘out of’, ‘away from’, ‘without’, ‘free from’,
 and be frequently expressed by ‘less’, ‘un’, used with the noun; see the
 compounds given below; see निस् and cf. अ also.
