निरक्षः|निरक्ष
निर् + -अक्षः the place of no latitute; <i>i. e.</i> the terrestrial equator
 (in astronomy). ˚देशः
—1 a first meridian, as Laṅkā.
—2 a place where the sun is always vertical and the days and nights are equal.
—3 the equatorial region.
