निरपेक्ष|निरपेक्षः
निर् + -अपेक्ष <i>a.</i>
—1 not depending on, irrespective or independent
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-1" target="_blank">Page0907-1</a>]
 of, having no need of (with loc.); न्यायनिर्णीतसारत्वान्निरपेक्षमिवागमे Ki. 11. 39.
—2 disregarding, taking no notice of.
—3 free from desire, secure; निरपेक्षो न कर्तव्यो भृत्यैः स्वामी कदाचन H. 2. 82.
—4 careless, negligent, indifferent
—5 indifferent to worldly attachments or pursuits; समुपोढेषु कामेषु
 निरपेक्षः परिव्रजेत् Ms. 6. 41.
—6 disinterested, not expecting any reward from another; दिशि दिशि निरपेक्षस्तावकीनं
 विवृण्वन् Bv. 1. 5.
—7 without purpose.
