निराश्रय
निर् + -आश्रय <i>a.</i>
—1 without a prop or support, supportless, unsupported; न तिष्ठति निराश्रयं
 लिङ्गम् Sāṅ. K. 41.
—2 friendless, destitute, alone, without shelter or refuge; निराश्रयाधुना वत्सलता.
—3 not deep (as a wound).
