निर् + -विशेष <i>a.</i> showing or making no difference, indiscriminating,
 without distinction; निर्विशेषा वयं त्वयि Mb.; निर्विशेषो विशेषः
 Bh. 3. 50 ‘a difference without distinction’.
—2 having no difference, same, like, not differing from (oft. in comp.);
 निर्विशेषाकृति ‘having the same form’; प्रवातनीलोत्पलनिर्विशेषम्
 Ku. 1. 46; स निर्विशेषप्रतिपत्तिरासीत् R. 14. 22.
—3 indiscriminate, promiscuous.
