—1 Derivation, etymological interpretation of words; जरत्कारुनिरुक्तिं
 त्वं यथावद्वक्तुमर्हसि Mb. 1. 40. 2.
—2 (In Rhet.) An artificial explanation of the derivation of a word; thus
 defined:− निरुक्तिर्योगतो नाम्नामन्यार्थत्वप्रकल्पनम् । ईदृशैश्चरितैर्जाने
 सत्यं दोषाकरो भवान् ॥ Candr. 5. 168 (where दोषाकरः is equal
 to दोषाणामाकरः).
—3 (In drama.) communication of an event that has taken place.
—4 N. of Yāskaʼs commentary on the Nighaṇṭus.
