निर्दिश्
निर्दिश् €6 P.
—1 To point out, indicate, show; एकैकं निर्दिशन् Ś. 7; अङ्गुल्या निर्दिशति &c.
—2 To assign, give; निर्दिष्टां कुलपतिना स पर्णशालामध्यास्य R. 1. 95.
—3 To allude to, mention, make a reference to.
—4 To foretell, predict.
—5 To advise, recommend.
—6 To tell, communicate.
—7 To enjoin, direct.
—8 To enumerate, specify, name.
—9 To define, determine.
—10 To describe.
—11 To denounce, accuse.
