निर्विष्ट|निर्व्विष्ट|निर्व्विष्टः
निर्विष्ट <i>p. p.</i>
—1 Enjoyed, attained, experienced.
—2 Fully enjoyed or used.
—3 Obtained as wages; निर्विष्टं वैश्यशूद्रयोः Gaut. S.
—4 Married.
—5 Engaged in.
—6 Arrived at, attained to.
—7 One who has maintained the sacred fire.
—8 Entered, sticking in.
—9 Sitting, encamping; निर्विष्टमुदधेः कूले तं प्रपेदे विभीषणः R. 12. 68.
