 Śi. 4. 63, 5. 21; Bg. 9. 18; Mk. 3. 23.
—3 Passing the night.
—4 A dress, garment.
—5 Nightquarters.
—6 Refuge, receptacle, asylum; जगन्निवासो वसुदेवसद्मनि Śi. 1. 1.
