निष्क्रमः|निष्क्रम
निष्क्रमः
—1 Going out, coming forth; अविभावितनिष्क्रमप्रयाणः Ki. 13. 27.
—2 Departure from, exit.
—3 One of the Saṃskāras or religious rites; <i>i. e.</i> taking out a child
 for the first time into the open air (which is usually performed in the
 fourth month of its age); चतुर्थे मासि निष्क्रमः Y. 1. 12; cf. उपनिष्क्रमण also.
—4 Degradation, loss of caste, inferiority of tribe.
—5 Intellectual faculty.
