—5 To pass or spend (as a time).
—6 To expiate, atone for.
—7 To get out of, escape, be saved from. ━<i>Caus.</i>
—1 To deliver, rescue; save; निस्तारयति दुर्गाच्च महतश्चैव किल्बिषात् Ms. 3. 98.
