<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीपः|नीप
नीप + .{@-पः@}
—1 The foot of a mountain.
—2 A kind of कदम्ब (said to blossom in the rainy season; Adina Cordifolia
 Hook). The tree is known as हेडु or हेडकदम्ब in Marāthī.
 It is the same as हरिद्रकदम्बक or हरिद्रक. The wood of the
 tree is yellow and is still found employed in old buildings. नीपः प्रदीपायते
 Mk. 5. 14; सीमन्ते च त्वदुपगमजं यत्र नीपं वधूनाम् Me. 67; नवनीपाङ्कुरनन्दनीयशोभा Bhār. C.
—3 A species of Aśoka; a kind of plant (Mar. दुपारी); कदम्बवेतसनलनीपवञ्जुलकैर्वृतम्
 (पयः) Bhāg. 8. 2. 17.
—4 N. of a family of kings; नीपान्वयः पार्थिव एष यज्वा R. 6. 46.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0935-1" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

