—3 Particularly, the costume of an actor; विरलनेपथ्ययोः पात्रयोः
 प्रवेशोऽस्तु M. 1.
—4 The tiring-room, the space where the actors attire themselves (which
 is always behind the curtain), the postscenium; नेपथ्ये ‘behind the scene’.
