नैषध|नैषधः
नैषध
—1 A king of the Niṣadhas.
—2 Especially, an epithet of king Nala, q. v.; स नैषधस्यार्थपतेः सुतायाम् R.
—3 A native or inhabitant of Niṣadha.
—4 N. of a Mahākāvya by Śrīharṣa (treating of the adventures of Nala,
 king of the Niṣadhas).
