पट्
पट् I. €1 P. (पटति) To go or move. ━<i>Caus.</i> or €10 U. (पाटयति-ते)
—1 To split, cleave, tear up, tear asunder, tear open, divide; कंचिन्मध्यात्
 पाटयामास दन्ती Śi. 18. 51; दत्त्वर्णं पाटयेल्लेखम् Y. 2. 94; Mk. 9.
—2 To break, break open; अन्यासु भित्तिषु मया निशि पाटितासु Mk. 3. 14.
—3 To pierce, prick, penetrate; दर्भपाटिततलेन पाणिना R. 11. 31.
—4 To remove, eradicate.
—5 To pluck out.
—6 To shine.
—7 To speak. ━II. €10 U. (पटयति-ते)
—1 To string or weave; कुविन्दस्त्वं तावत् पटयसि गुणग्राममभितः K. P. 7.
—2 To clothe, envelop.
—3 To surround, encircle.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0952-1" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

