पताकास्थानकम्
पताका + -स्थानकम् (in dramaturgy) intimation of an episodical incident,
 when instead of the thing thought of or expected, another of the same
 character is brought in by some unexpected circumstance (यत्रार्थे चिन्तितेऽन्यस्मिंस्तल्लिङ्गोऽन्यः
 प्रयुज्यते । आगन्तुकेन भावेन पताकास्थानकं तु तत् ॥ S. D. 299; for
 its different kinds, see 300-304).
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0956-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

