पद्
पद् I. €10 Ā. (पदयते) To go or move. ━II. €4 Ā. (पद्यते,
 पन्न; <i>caus.</i> पादयति-ते; <i>desid.</i> पित्सते)
—1 To go, move.
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0959-1" target="_blank">Page0959-1</a>]
—2 To go to, approach (with acc.)
—3 To attain, obtain, gain; ज्योतिषामाधिपत्यं च प्रभावं चाप्यपद्यत Mb.
—4 To observe, practise; स्वधर्मं पद्यमानास्ते Mb.
—5 Ved. To fall down with fatigue.
—6 Ved. To perish.
—7 To fall out. ━III. €1 P. (पदति) To stand fast or fixed.
