परापरम्
पर + -अपर + .({@-रम्@}) (in logic) a property intermediate between the greatest
 and smallest numbers, a species (as existing between the genus and individual);
 <i>e. g.</i> पृथ्वी which is पर with respect to a घट is अपर
 with respect to द्रव्य; द्रव्यत्वादिकजातिस्तु परापरतयोच्यते Bhāṣā P. 8.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0963-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पराभिध्यानम्
पर + -अभिध्यानम् self-conceit; high opinion for self or body (देहाभिमान);
 स्वयं पराभिध्यानेन विभ्रंशितस्मृतिः Bhāg. 5. 14. 10.
