परतस्
परतस् <i>ind.</i>
—1 From another; सन्तः स्वतः प्रकाशन्ते गुणा न परतो नृणाम् Bv. 1. 120.
—2 From an enemy; यशस्तु रक्ष्यं परतो यशोधनैः R. 3. 48.
—3 Further, more (than), beyond, after, over (often with abl.); यो बुद्धेः
 परतस्तु सः Bg. 3. 42.
—4 Otherwise.
—5 Differently.
—6 Further, afterwards.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0965-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परत्वम्
परत्वम्
—1 The following of another letter, posteriority.
—2 Distinction, difference.
—3 Remoteness.
—4 Consequence, result.
—5 Enmity, hostility.
—6 Priority of place or time, proximity, one of the 24 guṇas of the Vaiśeṣikas.
