<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परत्र|परत्रं
परत्र <i>ind.</i>
—1 In another world, in a future birth; परत्रेह च शर्मणे R. 1. 69;
 Ku. 4. 37; Ms. 3. 275, 5. 166, 8. 127.
—2 In the sequel, further or later on.
—3 Hereafter, in future.
