परमम्
परम + .{@-मम्@} The utmost or highest; the chief or prominent part; (at the
 end of comp.) consisting principally of, solely occupied with; कामोपभोगपरमा
 एतावदिति निश्चिताः Bg. 16. 11; Ms. 6. 96.
