परस्
परस् <i>ind.</i> (Rarely used by itself in classical Sanskrit)
—1 Beyond, further, more than; परोरजः सवितुर्जातवेदः Bhāg. 5. 7. 14.
—2 On the other side of.
—3 Far away, at a distance
—4 With the exception of.
—5 Ved. In future, afterwards.
.━{@Comp.@}: परःकृष्ण, परःपुंसा, परःपुरुष, परःशत, परःश्वस्, परःसहस्र
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0967-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

