परामृश्
परामृश् €6 P.
—1 To touch, rub or stroke gently; परामृशन् हर्षजडेन पाणिना तदीयमङ्गं
 कुलिशव्रणाङ्कितम् R. 3. 68; Śi. 17. 11; Mk. 5. 28.
—2 To lay hands on, attack, assail, seize; Mk. 1. 39.
—3 To defile, pollute, outrage (a woman or a temple).
—4 To reflect, think, consider किं भवितेति सशङ्कं पङ्कजनयना
 परामृशति Bv. 2. 53.
—5 To think mentally of, praise (स्तु); ग्रन्थारम्भे विध्नविघाताय
 समुचितेष्टदेवतां ग्रन्थकृत् परामृशति K. P. 1.
—6 To have reference to, point to.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0969-1" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परामर्शः|परामर्श
परामर्शः
—1 Seizing, pulling; as in केशपरामर्शः. —2 Bending or drawing (as a bow).
—2 Violence, attack, assault; याज्ञसेन्याः परामर्शः Mb.
—4 Disturbance, hindrance; तपःपरामर्शविवृद्धमन्योः Ku. 3. 71.
—5 Calling to mind, recollection.
—6 Consideration, reflection, thought.
—7 Judgment.
—8 (In logic) Deduction, ascertaining that the पक्ष or subject possesses
 the हेतु; व्याप्तिविशिष्टपक्षधर्मताज्ञानं परामर्शः T. S.; or व्याप्तस्य
 पक्षधर्मत्वधीः परामर्श उच्यते Bhāṣā P. 66.
—9 Touching, striking gently.
—10 Affection (by disease).
