परिच्छिन्न <i>p. p.</i>
—1 Cut off, divided.
—2 Accurately defined, determined, ascertained; परिच्छिन्नप्रभावर्धिर्न
 मया न च विष्णुना Ku. 2. 58.
—3 Limited, circumscribed, confined.
—4 Remedied.
