परिहृतः|परिहृत
परिहृतः <i>p. p.</i>
—1 Shunned, avoided.
—2 Left, abandoned.
—3 Refuted, repelled (as a charge, objection &c.).
—4 Taken, seized.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0990-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

