<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परी
परी (परि-इ) €2 P.
—1 To go round, circumambulate; (चरणन्यासं) भक्तिनम्रः परीयाः
 Me. 57; Ms. 2. 48.
—2 To surround, encompass; हुतवहपरीतं गृहमिव Ś. 5. 10; विषवल्लीभिः
 परीताभिर्महौषधिः R. 12. 61; so कोपपरीतमानसम् Ki. 2. 25.
—3 To go to, think of (objects &c.).
—4 To be changed or transformed.
—5 To reach to.
—6 To run against.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0990-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीत|परीतं
परीत <i>p. p.</i>
—1 Surrounded, encompassed by.
—2 Expired, elapsed.
—3 Departed, gone forth.
—4 Seized, taken possession of, filled with; प्रणाशान्नन्दानां प्रशममुपयातं
 त्वमधुना परीतः कालेन ज्वलयसि मम क्रोधदहनम् Mu. 3. 29. See परी.
—5 = विपरीत inverted; स्वदोषकोपनाद्रोगं लभते मरणान्तिकम् ।
 अपि वोद्बन्धनादीनि परीतानि व्यवस्यति ॥ Mb. 14. 17. 13.
—6 Moving round.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0990-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीक्ष्
परीक्ष् €1 Ā.
—1 To examine, look at or scrutinize carefully; अतः परीक्ष्य
 कर्तव्यं विशेषात् संगतं रहः Ś. 5. 24; सन्तः परीक्ष्यान्यतरद्भजन्ते
 M. 1. 2; Ms. 9. 14.
—2 To test, try, put to the test; मायां मयोद्भाव्य परीक्षितोऽसि R. 2. 65;
 यत्नात्
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0991-1" target="_blank">Page0991-1</a>]
 परीक्षितः पुंस्त्वे Y. 1. 55 ‘carefully tested as to potency’.
—3 To observe, perceive.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0990-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

