<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीणाहः|परीणाह
परीणाहः
—1 = परिणाह. नल्वमात्रपरीणाहो घनच्छायो वनस्पतिः Mb. 12. 154. 7.
—2 A piece of common land encircling a village.
—3 An epithet of Śiva.
