पल्लिः|पल्लि
पल्लिः, -ल्ली <i>f.</i>
—1 A small village; पल्लीघोषान् समृद्धांश्च बहुगोकुलसंकुलान् (अपश्यत्)
 Mb. 12. 325. 20; also a settlement of wild tribes.
—2 A hut.
—3 A house, station.
—4 A city or town (at the end of names of towns); as त्रिशिरपल्ली
 (Trichinopoly).
—5 A house-lizard.
—6 A creeping-plant.
