पस्पशः
—1 N. of the first Āhnika of the first chapter of Patañjaliʼs Mahābhāṣya;
 शब्दविद्येव नो भाति राजनीतिरपस्पशा Śi. 2. 112 (where अपस्पश
 also means ‘without spies’).
—2 (Fig.) An introductory chapter in general (उपोद्घात).
