पातनम्
पातन + .{@-नम्@}
—1 Causing to fall down, bringing or throwing down, knocking down.
—2 Throwing, casting.
—3 Humbling, lowering.
—4 Removing.
—5 N. of a particular process to which minerals (esp. quicksilver) are
 subjected. <i>N. B.</i> पातनम् may have different meanings according
 to the noun with which it is used; <i>e. g.</i> दण्डस्य पातनम् ‘causing the rod to fall’
, <i>i. e.</i> chastising; गर्भस्य पातनम् ‘causing the foetus to fall’
, causing an abortion.
