पारग|पारगः
पारः + -ग <i>a.</i>
—1 crossing over, ferrying across.
—2 one who has gone to the end of, one who has completely mastered anything, completely
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1010-2" target="_blank">Page1010-2</a>]
