पारमार्थिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)
 [परमाथीय हितं ठक्]
—1 Relating to परमार्थ or the highest truth or spiritual knowledge.
—2 Real, essential, truly or really existent; सत्ता त्रिविधा पारमार्थिकी,
 व्यावहारिकी, प्रातीतिकी च Vedānta.
—3 Caring for truth, loving truth or right; न लोकः पारमार्थिकः Pt. 1. 342.
—4 Excellent, supremely good, best.
