पुरा
पुरा <i>ind.</i>
—1 In former times, formerly, of yore, in the olden time; पुरा शक्रमुपस्थाय
 R. 1. 75; पुरा सरसि मानसे … यस्य यातं वयः Bv. 1. 3; Ms. 1. 119, 5. 22.
—2 Before, hitherto, upto the present time
—3 At first, in the first place; रामं दर्शय मे शीघ्रं पुरा मेऽर्थोऽतिवर्तते
 Rām. 7. 105. 2.
—4 In a short time, soon, ere-long, shortly (in this sense usually with
 a present tense to which it gives a future sense); पुरा सप्तद्वीपां
 जयति वसुधामप्रतिरथः Ś. 7. 33; पुरा दूषयति स्थलीम् R. 12. 30;
 आलोके ते निपतति पुरा सा बलिव्याकुला वा Me. 87; N. 1. 18; Śi. 10. 56;
 Ki. 10. 50, 11. 36.
—5 Ved. For the defence of.
—6 Securely from.
—7 Except, besides.
.━{@Comp.@}: पुरोपनीत, पुराकथा, पुराकल्पः, पुराकृत्, पुरायोनि, पुरावसुः, पुराविद्, पुरावृत्त
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1033-1" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

