पुष्पकम्
पुष्पकम्
—1 Flower.
—2 Calx of brass.
—3 A cup of iron.
—4 The car of Kubera (snatched off from him by Rāvaṇa and from him by
 Rāma); वैमानिकाः पुण्यकृतस्त्यजन्तु मरुतां पथि, पुष्पकालोकसंक्षोभम्
 R. 10. 46, 13. 40.
—5 A bracelet.
—6 A kind of collyrium.
—7 A particular disease of the eyes.
—8 A bracelet of jewels.
—9 A small earthen fireplace.
