 पुष्पिताग्राम् Gīt. 4 (where पुष्पिताग्रा is also the name of a metre).
—2 Florid, flowery (as speech).
—3 A bounding or rich in; as in सुवर्णपुष्पितां पृथ्वीम् Pt. 1. 45.
—4 Fully developed, completely manifested.
—5 Spotted, variegated.
