पू
पू €1, €4 Ā., €9 U. (पवते, पूयते, पुनाति, पुनीते, पूत; <i>caus.</i>
 पावयति; <i>desid.</i> पुपूषति, पिपविषते)
—1 To make pure, cleanse, purify (lit. and fig.); अवश्यपाव्यं पवसे
 Bk. 6. 64, 3. 18; पुण्याश्रमदर्शनेन तावदात्मानं पुनीमहे Ś. 1;
 Ms. 1. 105, 2. 62; Y. 1. 58; R. 1. 53; पवनः पवतामस्मि Bg. 10. 31.
—2 To refine.
—3 To clean from chaff, winnow; पूत्वा तृणमिषीकां वा ते लभन्ते न
 किञ्चन Mb. 12. 237. 4.
—4 To expiate, atone for; दुर्मित्रासो हि क्षितयः पवन्ते Rv. 7. 28. 4.
—5 To discern, discriminate.
—6 To think out, devise, invent.
—7 To become clear or pure (Ātm.).
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1038-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

