—2 Relating to something preceding; पूर्ववन्तोऽविधानार्थाः˚ MS. 1. 4. 17.
 (cf. ये हि पूर्ववन्तो विदितपूर्वमर्थमभिवदन्ति ते अविधानार्थाः
 ŚB. on MS. on ibid.). ━<i>n.</i> One of the three kinds of अनुमान,
 inference of the effect from the cause; <i>i. e.</i> inferring from the rising
