प्रकरी
प्रकरी
—1 An interlude or episode inserted in a drama to explain what is to follow.
—2 Theatrical dress.
—3 An open piece of ground.
—4 A place where four roads meet.
—5 A kind of song.
—6 The proper site of any magical operations.
