प्रकृष्
प्रकृष् €1 P.
—1 To draw away, pull, attract.
—2 To lead (as an army).
—3 To bend (as a bow).
—4 To increase.
—5 To draw or stretch out, prolong.
—6 To place before or in front.
—7 To harass, disturb, afflict, trouble.
—8 To drag along cruelly; प्रकृष्टाश्च तदा कामं देवमार्गं च दर्शिताः
 Rām. 5. 63. 11. ━<i>Pass.</i> To be enhanced or increased; आवयोरपि यत्
 सङ्गात् पवित्रत्वं प्रकृष्यते U. 7. 8.
