—4 Absoluteness.
—5 Length, protraction.
—6 Speciality.
—7 Universality. (प्रकर्षेण and प्रकर्षात् are used adverbially
 in the sense of ‘exceedingly’, ‘preeminently’, ‘in a high degree’.)
