प्रक्रमभङ्गः|प्रक्रमभङ्ग|प्रक्रमभंग
प्रक्रमः + -भङ्गः want of symmetry or regularity, the breaking of arrangement,
 regarded as a fault of composition. (It is the same as भग्नप्रक्रमता
 mentioned in K. P. 7), the break of symmetry being either in expression
 or construction; नाथे निशाया नियतेर्नियोगादस्तं गते हन्त निशापि याता
 is an instance of the former, where गता निशापि would relieve the
 irregularity of expression; and विश्रब्धं क्रियतां वराहततिभिर्मुस्ताक्षतिः
 पल्वले is an instance of the latter, where the symmetry of the verse
 requires the active instead of the passive construction, and the fault
 may be removed by reading the line as विश्रब्धा रचयन्तु शूकरवरा
 मुस्ताक्षतिं पल्वले; see K. P. 7 under भग्नप्रक्रमता for further details.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1056-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

