प्रगृह्यम्
प्रगृह्यम्
—1 A vowel which is not liable to the rules of <i>Sandhi</i> or euphony and
 which is allowed to be written and pronounced separately; ईदूदेद्द्विवचनं
 प्रगृह्यम् P. I. 1. 11 (<i>i. e.</i> the final ई, ऊ and ए of the dual
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1059-1" target="_blank">Page1059-1</a>]
 terminations of a word or any grammatical form).
—2 Remembrance.
—3 A sentence.
