प्रतिलोम|प्रतिलोमः
प्रति + -लोम <i>a.</i>
—1 ‘against the hair or grain’
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-1" target="_blank">Page1070-1</a>]
, contrary to the natural order, inverted, reverse (opp.
 अनुलोम); नववर्षसहस्राक्षः प्रतिलोमोऽभवद् गुरुः Bhāg. 12. 14. 15.
—2 contrary to caste (said of the issue of a woman who is of a higher
 caste than her husband).
—3 hostile.
—4 low, vile, base.
—5 left (वाम).
—6 obstinate, perverse; अपरिचितस्यापि तेऽप्रतिलोमः संवृत्तः Ś. 7.
—7 disagreeable, unpleasant.
