प्रतिलोमम्
प्रति + -लोम + .({@-मम्@}) <i>ind.</i> ‘against the hair or grain’, inversely, invertedly.
 ˚ज <i>a.</i> born in the inverse order of the castes; <i>i. e.</i> born
