प्रतिबद्ध|प्रतिबद्धः
प्रतिबद्ध <i>p. p.</i>
—1 Bound, tied, fastened to; वनाय पीतप्रतिबद्धवत्सां यशोधनो धेनुमृषेर्मुमोच R. 2. 1.
—2 Connected with, harmonizing with; रसान्तरेषु प्रतिबद्धरागम् Ku. 7. 91.
—3 Hindered, obstructed, impeded.
—4 Set, inlaid; यस्याः पुरा परिचयप्रतिबद्धबीजम् Māl. 10. 21.
—5 Furnished with, possessing.
—6 Entangled, involved.
—7 Kept at a distance.
—8 Disappointed.
—9 Fixed, directed.
—10 Attached or hanging to.
—11 Excluded, cut off.
—12 (In phil.) Invariably and inseparably connected and implied (as fire in smoke).
—13 Wreathed (as a garland); सखि एकपार्श्वविषमप्रतिबद्धा खल्वेषा
 रचना Māl. 2.
