प्रतिमुच्
प्रतिमुच् €6 P.
—1 To free, liberate, release, set free; गृहीतप्रतिमुक्तस्य R. 4. 43;
 अमुं तुरङ्गं प्रतिमोक्तुमर्हसि 3. 46.
—2 To put on, wear, accoutre or arm oneself with; प्रतिमुञ्च शुभ्रं यज्ञोपवीतम्.
—3 To quit, leave, abandon.
—4 To throw, cast, or discharge at.
—5 To pay off (a debt.).
—6 To return, restore.
—7 To fasten, bind; तमेकदा मणिं कण्ठे प्रतिमुच्य महाप्रभम् Bhāg. 10. 56. 13.
—8 To assume a form. ━<i>Caus.</i>
—1 To liberate, release.
—2 To rescue, save, deliver.
