प्रतियत्नः|प्रतियत्न
प्रतियत्न + .{@-त्नः@}
—1 An effort, endeavour, exertion.
—2 Preparation, elaboration; ‘प्रतियत्नस्तु संस्कारः’ Vaijayantī;
 सुगन्धितामप्रतियत्नपूर्वां बिभ्रन्ति यत्र प्रमदाय पुंसाम् Śi. 3. 54.
—3 Making complete or perfect.
—4 Imparting a new quality or virtue; सतो गुणान्तराधानं प्रतियत्नः
 Kāśi. on P. II. 3. 53.
—5 Wish, desire.
—6 Opposition, resistance.
—7 Retaliation, retribution, revenge.
—8 Making captive, taking prisoner.
—9 Favour.
—10 Acting well or properly.
—11 Comprehension.
