प्रतियोगिन्
प्रतियोगिन् <i>a.</i>
—1 Opposing, counteracting, impeding.
—2 Related or corresponding to, being or forming a counter-part of (anything);
 often used in works on Nyāya; as a घट is the प्रतियोगी of घटाभाव;
 (यस्याभावो विवक्ष्यते स प्रतियोगी).
—3 Co-operating with.
—4 Equally matched. ━<i>m.</i>
—1 An adversary, opponent, enemy; आर्थो विरोधः शक्तेन जातो नः प्रतियोगिना
 Mv. 2. 7; दहत्यशेषं प्रतियोगिगर्वम् Vikr. 1. 117.
—2 A counter-part, match.
—3 A partner, an associate.
—4 An object dependent upon another.
—5 A counter-part, counter-entity; प्रतियोगिज्ञानाधीनज्ञानविषयत्वमभावलक्षणम्.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1078-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
