<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिष्ठानम्
प्रतिष्ठानम्
—1 Basis, foundation.
—2 Site, situation, position.
—3 A resting place.
—4 The foundation of a city.
—5 A leg, foot.
—6 Continuation; वंशप्रतिष्ठानकराः सर्वभूतेषु विश्रुताः (पुत्राः)
 Rām. 1. 11. 18.
—7 N. of a town at the confluence of the Ganges and Yamunā and capital
 of the early kings of the lunar race; cf. V. 2.
—8 N. of a town on the Godāvarī and capital of Śālivāhana.
