प्रभेदः|प्रभेद
प्रभेदः
—1 Splitting, cleaving, opening.
—2 Division, separation.
—3 The flowing of rut or ichor from the temples of an elephant; बभूव
 तेनातितरां सुदुःसहः कटप्रभेदेन करीव पार्थिवः R. 3. 37.
—4 Difference, distinction.
—5 A kind or sort.
—6 The place of origin (as of a river); शोणस्य नर्मदायाश्च प्रभेदे
 कुरुनन्दन Mb. 3. 85. 9.
