—2 Intoxication, drunkenness.
—3
——(<i>a</i>) Fainting, swoon.
——(<i>b</i>) Insanity, madness.
—4 A mistake, blunder, mistaken judgment; Pt. 1. 39.
—5 An accident, mishap, calamity, danger; अहो प्रमादः Māl. 3; U. 3.
