प्रयुक्त|प्रयुक्तं
प्रयुक्त <i>p. p.</i>
—1 Yoked, harnessed.
—2 Used, employed (as a word &c.); सप्रयुक्तस्य दम्भस्य ब्रह्माप्यन्तं
 न गच्छति Pt. 1. 202.
—3 Applied.
—4 Appointed, nominated.
—5 Acted, represented.
—6 Arising or resulting from, produced by, consequent on; मेधाविनो नीतिगुणप्रयुक्तां
 पुरः स्फुरन्तीमिव दर्शयन्ति Pt. 1. 61.
—7 Endowed with.
—8 Lost in meditation, abstracted.
—9 Lent or put to interest (as money).
—10 Prompted, instigated, urged; गुणप्रयुक्ताः परमर्मभेदिनः Udb.;
 अथावमानेन प्रयुक्ता Ku. 1. 21.
—11 Directed, hurled at.
—12 Shaken, set in motion.
—13 Inflicted upon.
—14 Connected with.
—15 Thick, compact, closely united.
—16 Drawn (as a sword).
—17 Contrived.
—18 Suitable.
