प्रलप्
प्रलप् €1 P.
—1 To speak, talk; वचो वै देहीति (वैदेहीति) प्रतिपदमुदश्रु
 प्रलपितम् S. D. 6.
—2 To talk at random or incoherently, prate, chatter, talk wildly or nonsensically;
 प्रलपत्येष वैधेयः Ś. 2.
—3 To lament, mourn, cry, bewail.
—4 To call, invoke.
