प्रलपनम्
प्रलपनम्
—1 Talking, speaking, talk, words, conversation.
—2 Prating, prattle, raving, incoherent or nonsensical talk; इदं कस्यापि प्रलपितम्.
—3 Lamentation, wailing; U. 3. 29.
