—1 Setting on foot, founding.
—2 Advancing, promoting, furthering.
—3 Producing, causing,
 … कृतिसाध्यताज्ञानं वा प्रवर्तकमिति जरन्नैयायिकाः.
—4 Prompting, urging, inducing, instigating (in a bad sense).
