 <i>i. e.</i> to become a <i>Samnyāsin</i>; आत्मन्यग्नीन् समारोप्य ब्राह्मणः
 प्रव्रजेद् गृहात् Ms. 6. 38, 8. 363. ━<i>Caus.</i>
—1 To banish, send into exile.
—2 To compel to become a monk.
