—3 A flat surface or top, level, plain.
—4 A stone, rock; पर्वतप्रतिमं भाति पर्वतप्रस्तराश्रितम् Mb. 3. 142. 16.
—5 A precious stone, gem.
—6 A paragraph, section of a work.
—7 A handful of <i>darbha</i> grass.
