प्रस्तरप्रहरणन्यायः
प्रस्तरः + -प्रहरणन्यायः a rule of interpretation according to which the
 matter mentioned in the instrumental should be construed as being subsidiary
 to that which is mentioned in the accusative. This न्याय is mentioned
 by जौमिनि and शबर at MS. 3. 2. 11-14.
