प्रहा
प्रहा €3 P.
—1 To give up, forsake, abandon, relinquish; प्रजहाति यदा कामान्
 Bg. 2. 55, 39; मोदमेतौ प्रहास्येते Rām.
—2 To let go, cast, discharge; प्रजहुः शूलपट्टिशान् Bk. 14. 23.
—3 To depart from. ━<i>Pass.</i>
—1 To be forsaken or neglected.
—2 To be lost, to perish.
—3 To vanish, cease, disappear.
—4 To be vanquished, to succumb.
