प्रहृ
प्रहृ €1 P.
—1 To strike, strike at, beat; लत्तया प्रहरति ‘kicks’; दयापरोऽभूः
 प्रहरन्नपि त्वम् R. 5. 58; Ku. 3. 70; Bk. 9. 7.
—2 To hurt, injure, wound (with loc.); आर्तत्राणाय वः शस्त्रं न प्रहर्तुमनागसि
 Ś. 1. 11; R. 2. 62, 7. 59, 11. 84, 15. 3.
—3 To attack, assault.
—4 To throw, cast, hurl (with loc. or dat.).
—5 To seize upon.
—6 To offer, present (Ved.).
