प्राकरणिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)
 Pertaining to the subject of discussion, relevant
 to the matter in hand (often used in the sense of उपमेय in works
 on Rhetoric); अप्राकरणिकस्याभिधानेन प्राकरणिकस्याक्षेपोऽप्रस्तुतप्रशंसा K. P. 10.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1124-1" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राकर्षिक
प्राकर्षिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)
 Entitled to preference or superiority.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1124-1" target="_blank">PDF</a>
