प्राकृतमित्रम्
प्राकृत + -मित्रम् a natural ally; <i>i. e.</i> a ruler whose dominions lie
 immediately beyond those of the natural enemy (<i>i. e.</i> whose country
 is separated from the country with which he is allied by that of another).
