प्रास्थिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)
—1 Weighing a <i>Prastha</i>, q. v.
—2 Bought for a <i>Prastha</i>.
—3 Containing a <i>Prastha</i>.
—4 Sown with a <i>Prastha</i>.
