—1 To sprinkle upon or with.
—2 To consecrate by sprinkling holy water; प्राणात्यये तथा श्राद्धे प्रोक्षितं
 द्विजकाम्यया Y. 1. 179; Ms. 5. 27.
—3 To slay, kill. ━<i>Caus.</i> To sprinkle, sprinkle with.
