 धान्यवाससाम् Ms. 5. 118; Y. 1. 184.
—2 Consecration by sprinkling.
—3 Immolation (of animals) at a sacrifice.
—4 A text to be repeated at an animal-sacrifice;
—5 A vessel for holy water.
