—5 Pride, arrogance, self-confidence.
—6 Controversy, discussion.
—7 Zeal, exertion, enterprize.
—8 Earnestness, profundity (of character); हास्यप्रौढिमजानन्त्याः करुणः
 सोऽन्वकम्पत Bhāg. 10. 60. 25.
