बन्धकः|बन्धक|बंधक|बन्धकं|बंधकः
बन्धकः
—1 One who binds or catches, a binder.
—2 A catcher.
—3 A band, tie, rope, tether.
—4 A dike, bank, dam.
—5 A pledge, deposit.
—6 A posture of the body.
—7 Barter, exchange.
—8 A violator, ravisher.
—9 A promise.
—10 A city.
—11 A part or portion (at the end of num. compounds); ऋणं सदशबन्धकम् Y. 2. 76.
