बर्हिन्यायः
बर्हिः + -न्यायः a rule of interpretation according to which an expression
 must be understood in its primary sense rathar than in its secondary sense.
 This is discussed and established by Jaimini and Śabara at MS. 3. 2. 1 and 2.
