बल्
बल् I. €1 P. (बलति)
—1 To breathe or live.
—2 To hoard grain. ━II. €1 U. (बलति-ते)
—1 To give.
—2 To hurt, injure, kill.
—3 To speak.
—4 To see, mark. ━III. €10 U. (बलयति-ते) To live. ━IV. €10 Ā.
 (बालयते) To describe. ━<i>Caus.</i> (बालयति-ते) To nourish, support.
