भक्तिमार्गः|भक्तिमार्ग
भक्तिः + -मार्गः the way of devotion; <i>i. e.</i> devotion to god, regarded
 as the way to the attainment of final emancipation and eternal bliss (opp.
 to कर्ममार्ग and ज्ञानमार्ग).
