भञ्जन|भंजन|भञ्जनं|भञ्जनः
भञ्जन <i>a.</i> (-नी <i>f.</i>)
 [भञ्ज्-ल्यु ल्युट् वा]
—1 Breaking, splitting.
—2 Arresting, checking.
—3 Frustrating.
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1183-1" target="_blank">Page1183-1</a>]
—4 Causing violent pain.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1182-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भञ्जनम्
भञ्जन + .{@-नम्@}
—1 Breaking down, shattering, destroying.
—2 Removing, dispelling, driving away; तदुदितभयभञ्जनाय यूनाम् Gīt. 10.
—3 Routing, vanquishing.
—4 Frustrating.
—5 Checking, interrupting, disturbing.
—6 Afflicting, paining.
—7 Smoothing (of hair).
