भरतवाक्यम्
भरतः + -वाक्यम् the last verse or verses in a drama, a sort of benediction
 (said to be in honour of Bharata, the founder of the dramatic science);
 तथापीदमस्तु भरतवाक्यम् (occurring in every play); cf. Nāg. 5 (<i>end</i>).
