भवत्|भवन्त्
भवत् <i>a.</i> (-न्ती <i>f.</i>)
—1 Being, becoming, happening.
—2 Present; समतीतं च भवच्च भावि च R. 8. 78. ━<i>pron. a.</i>
.(-ती <i>f.</i>) A respectful or honorific pronoun, translated by
 ‘your honour’, ‘your lordship, worship or highness’; (oft. used in the
 sense of the second personal pronoun, but with the third person of the
 verb); अथवा कथं भवान् मन्यते M. 1; भवन्त एव जानन्ति रघूणां
 च कुलस्थितिम् U. 5. 23; R. 2. 40, 3. 48, 5. 16. It is often joined to
 अत्र or तत्र (see the words), and sometimes to स also; यन्मां
 विधेयविषये सभवान्नियुङ्क्ते Māl. 1. 9.
.━{@Comp.@}: भवद्भूतभव्ये, भवद्वसु
