भारद्वाजः [भरद्वाजस्यापत्यम् अण्]
—1 N. of Droṇa, the military preceptor of the Kauravas and Pāṇḍavas;
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1193-1" target="_blank">Page1193-1</a>]
