भाव्य|भाव्यं
भाव्य <i>a.</i> [भू-ण्यत्]
—1 About to be or happen; मनुस्त्रयोदशो भाव्यः Bhāg. 8. 13. 30;
 oft. used impersonally like भवितव्यम् q. v.; किं तैर्भाव्यं मम
 सुदिवसैः Bh. 3. 41.
—2 Future.
—3 To be performed or accomplished.
—4 To be conceived or imagined.
—5 To be proved or
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1196-1" target="_blank">Page1196-1</a>]
 demonstrated.
—6 To be determined or investigated.
—7 To be convicted; त्र्यवरैः साक्षिभिर्भाव्यो नृपब्राह्मणसंनिधौ Ms. 8. 60.
