 Ku. 6. 49; स स्तौति भास्करं भक्त्या नौति पापहरं हरम् ।
—2 a hero.
—3 fire.
—4 an epithet of Śiva.
—5 N. of a celebrated Hindu astronomer who is said to have flourished
 in the eleventh or twelfth century A. D.
