—2 A kind of thorn-apple.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1216-1" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भ्रान्तम्
भ्रान्त + .{@-तम्@}
—1 Roaming, moving about; वरं पर्वतदुर्गेषु भ्रान्तं वनचरैः सह Bh. 2. 14.
—2 A mistake, an error.
—3 A particular mode of fighting.
