मङ्गल <i>a.</i> [मङ्ग्-अलच्; Uṇ. 5. 70]
—1 Auspicious, lucky, propitious, fortunate; मङ्गलदिवसः, मङ्गलवृषभः &c.
—2 Prosperous, doing or faring well.
—3 Brave.
