—1 Thought, believed, supposed; स मे युक्ततमो मतः Bg. 6. 47.
—2 Considered, regarded, deemed, looked upon.
—3 Esteemed, honoured, respected; बभौ च सा तेन सतां मतेन श्रद्धेव
 साक्षाद्विधिनोपपन्ना R. 2. 16, 8. 8.
—4 Commended, valued.
—5 Conjectured, guessed.
—6 Meditated upon, thought of, perceived, recognised.
—7 Thought out.
—8 Intended, aimed at.
—9 Approved, sanctioned.
—10 Wished or hoped for.
—11 Perceived, observed, known, understood. (See मन्).
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1224-1" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मतम्
मत + .{@-तम्@} —1 A thought, idea, opinion, belief, view; निश्चितं मतमुत्तमम्
 Bg. 18. 6; केषांचिन्मतेन &c.
—2 Doctrine, tenet, creed, religious belief; ये मे मतमिदं नित्यमनुतिष्ठन्ति
 मानवाः Bg. 3. 31.
—3 Advice, instruction, counsel.
—4 Aim, design, intention, purpose; आत्मप्रभावेण मुने ज्ञातुमर्हसि
 मे मतम् Rām. 7. 9. 19.
—5 Approbation, sanction, commendation.
—6 Knowledge.
.━{@Comp.@}: मताक्ष, मतानुज्ञा, मतान्तरम्, मतावलम्बनम्, मतभेदः
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1224-1" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मताक्ष
मत + -अक्ष <i>a.</i> well-versed in playing at dice; कङ्को नाम द्विजो
 भूत्वा मताक्षः प्रियदेवनः Mb. 4. 1. 24.
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1224-2" target="_blank">Page1224-2</a>]
