मतल्लिका
मतल्लिका A word used at the end of nouns to denote ‘excellence or anything best of its kind’
; गोमतल्लिका ‘an excellent cow’; परिलसत्तृणशून्यमतल्लिका
 Rām. Ch. 4. 32; cf. उद्धः.
