मध्यस्थ|मध्यस्थः
मध्य + -स्थ <i>a.</i>
—1 being or standing in the middle, central.
—2 intermediate, intervening.
—3 middling.
—4 mediating, acting as umpire between two parties.
—5 impartial, neutral; सुहृन्मित्रार्युदासीनमध्यस्थद्वेष्यबन्धुषु …
 समबुद्धिर्विशिष्यते Bg. 6. 9.
—6 indifferent, unconcerned; अन्या मध्यस्थचिन्ता तु विमर्दाभ्यधिकोदया
 Rām. 2. 2. 16; मध्यस्थो देशबन्धुषु Pt. 4. 60; वयमत्र मध्यस्थाः
 Ś. 5.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1231-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मध्यस्थः|मध्यस्थ
मध्य + -स्थ + ({@-स्थः@})
—1 an umpire, arbitrator, a mediator.
