मध्यस्थता
मध्य + -स्थता
—1 intermediate position.
—2 middle state or character.
—3 mediocrity.
—4 arbitration, mediatorship.
—5 impartiality; मध्यस्थतां गृहीत्वा भण M. 3 ‘say impartially’;
 मध्यस्थतानैकतरोपहासः N.
—6 indifference.
