मध्यमपदम्
मध्यम + -पदम् the middle member (of a compound). ˚लोपिन् <i>m.</i> a
 subdivision of the Tatpuruṣa compound in which the middle word is omitted
 in composition; the usual instance given is शाकपार्थिवः which is
 dissolved as शाकप्रियः पार्थिवः; here the middle word प्रिय is
 omitted; so छायातरुः, गुडधानाः &c.
