मन्वन्तरम्
मनुः + -अन्तरम् the period or age of a Manu; (this period, according
 to Ms. 1. 79, comprises 4,320,000 human years or ¹⁄₁₄th day of Brahmā,
 the fourteen <i>Manvantaras</i> making up one whole day; each of these
 fourteen periods is supposed to be presided over by its own Manu; six
 such periods have already passed away; we are at present living in the
 seventh, and seven more are yet to come); मन्वन्तरं तु दिव्यानां युगानामेकसप्ततिः Ak.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1235-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

