मन्थः|मन्थ|मंथ|मंथः
मन्थः [मन्थ्-करणे घञ्]
—1 Churning, shaking about, stirring, agitating; मन्थादिव क्षुभ्यति
 गाङ्गमम्भः U. 7. 16;
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1237-2" target="_blank">Page1237-2</a>]
 R. 10. 3.
—2 Killing, destroying.
—3 A mixed beverage; पुंसा नक्षत्रेण मन्थं संनीय जुहोति Bṛ. Up. 6. 3. 1.
—4 A churning-stick (मन्था also).
—5 The sun.
—6 A ray of the sun.
—7 Excretion of rheum from the eyes, mucus (from the eyes), cataract.
—8 An instrument for kindling fire by attrition.
—9 A spoon for stirring.
—10 A kind of antelope.
—11 A medical preparation of drink; चूर्णे चतुष्पले शीते क्षुणद्रव्यं
 पलं क्षिपेत् । मृत्पात्रे मन्थयेत् सम्यक् तस्माच्च द्विपलं पिबेत् Bhāva P.
