 Gīt. 11; Śi. 6. 40, 7. 18, 5. 62; R. 19. 21.
—2 Stupid, foolish, silly; मन्थरकौलिकः.
—3 Low, deep, hollow, having a low tone.
—4 Large, broad, wide, big.
—5 Bent, crooked, curved.
—6 Indicating, showing (सूचक).
