महिषी
महिषी
—1 A she-buffalo, buffalo-cow; Ms. 9. 55; माषानष्टौ तु महिषी सस्यघातस्य
 कारिणी Y. 2. 159.
—2 The principal queen, queen-consort; महिषीसखः R. 1. 48, 2. 25, 3. 9.
—3 A queen in general.
—4 The female of a bird; सासज्जत शिचस्तन्त्यां महिषी कालयन्त्रिता
 Bhāg. 7. 2. 52.
—5 A ladyʼs maid, female servant (सैरन्ध्री).
—6 An immoral woman.
—7 Money acquired by the prostitution of oneʼs wife; cf. माहिषिक.
