 [मधु-अण्]
—1 Honey-like, sweet.
—2 Made of honey.
—3 Vernal, relating to the spring; सावज्ञेव मुखप्रसाधनविधौ श्रीमाधवी
 योषिताम् M. 3. 5.
—4 Relating to the descendants of Madhu.
