माधवी
माधवी
—1 Candied sugar.
—2 A kind of drink made from honey.
—3 The spring-creeper (वासन्ती), with white fragrant flowers; पत्राणामिव
 शोषणेन मरुता स्पृष्टा लता माधवी Ś. 3. 9; Me. 80.
—4 The sacred basil.
—5 The earth (also with देवी); तथा मे माधवी देवी विवरं दातुमर्हति
 Rām. 7. 97. 14-16.
—6 A procuress, bawd.
—7 Affluence in cattle.
—8 (In music) A particular Rāginī.
