मारीचः|मारीच
मारीच + .{@-चः@}
—1 N. of a demon, son of Sunda and Tāḍakā. He assumed the form of a
 golden deer, and thus enticed Rāma to a considerable distance from Sītā,
 so that Rāvaṇa found a good opportunity to
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1264-2" target="_blank">Page1264-2</a>]
 carry her off.
—2 A large or royal elephant.
—3 A kind of plant (Mar. कंकोळ).
—4 N. of the sage Kaśyapa; cf. स्वायंभुवान्मरीचेर्यः प्रबभूव प्रजापतिः Ś. 7. 9.
—5 A sacrificing priest.
