मिथोसम्बन्धन्यायः
मिथस् + -असम्बन्धन्यायः a rule of interpretation according to which subsidiary
 portions (of a sentence) cannot be connected with one another. This rule
 is discussed by Jaimini and Śabara in ‘गुणानां च परार्थत्वादसम्बन्धः समत्वात् स्यात्’ MS. 3. 1. 22 and भाष्य thereon.
