मृ
मृ €6 Ā. (but P. in the Perfect, the two Futures and the Conditional)
 (म्रियते, ममार, अमृत, मरिष्यति, मर्तुम्, मृत) To die, perish,
 decease, depart from life. ━<i>Caus.</i> (मारयति-ते) To kill, slay.
━<i>Desid.</i> (मुमूर्षति)
—1 To wish to die.
—2 To be about to die, be on the point of death.
