मृद्
मृद् €9 P. (मृद्नाति, मृदित)
—1 To squeeze, press, rub; मम च मृदितं क्षौमं बाल्ये त्वदङ्गविवर्तनैः Ve. 5. 40.
—2 To trample or tread upon; crush, dash to pieces, kill, destroy, pound,
 bruise, pulverize; तानमर्दीदखादीच्च Bk. 15. 35; बलान्यमृद्नान्नलिनाभवक्त्रः R. 18. 5.
—3 To rub, stroke, rub against, touch; अस्मिन्नसौ मृदितपक्ष्मलरल्लकाङ्गः Śi. 4. 61.
—4 To overcome, surpass.
—5 To wipe away, rub off, remove.
—6 (In astr.) To pass through (as a constellation). ━<i>Caus.</i> (मर्दयति)
 = मृद् q. v. above.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1286-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मृदित|मृदितः
मृदित <i>p. p.</i>
—1 Pressed, squeezed; सुरतमृदिता बालवनिता Bh. 2. 44.
—2 Crushed, pounded, ground down,
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1287-1" target="_blank">Page1287-1</a>]
 trampled upon, killed.
—3 Rubbed off, removed. (See मृद्).
