मोक्तव्य
मोक्तव्य <i>a.</i>
—1 To be set free, liberated.
—2 To be renounced or resigned.
—3 To be hurled or thrown upon or against.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1292-1" target="_blank">PDF</a>
