मौसल|मौसलः
मौसल <i>a.</i> (-ली <i>f.</i>)
 [मुसल-अण्]
—1 Formed like a club, club-shaped.
—2 Fought with clubs (as a battle).
—3 Relating to the battle with clubs (as a <i>parvan</i>; in this <i>parvan</i>
 (Mb. 16th) is narrated the death of Kṛṣṇa and Balarāma, and the self-destruction
 of Kṛṣṇaʼs family through the curse of Brāhmaṇas).
