<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यत्|यन्त्
यत् <i>a.</i> Going, moving; स्थितं च यच्च (ब्रह्मणो रूपे)
 Bṛ. Up. 2. 3. 1.
