यत्र
यत्र <i>ind.</i> [यद्-त्रल्] Where, in which place, whither; सैव
 सा (द्यौः) चलति यत्र हि चित्तम् N. 5. 57; Ku. 1. 7, 10.
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1300-2" target="_blank">Page1300-2</a>]
—2 When; as in यत्र काले.
—3 Whereas, because, since, as. (यत्र यत्र means ‘wherever’; यत्र
 यत्र धूमस्तत्र तत्र वह्निः T. S.; यत्र तत्र in whatever place,
 everywhere; यत्रकुत्र or यत्रक्वचन-क्वपि
—1 wheresoever, in whatever place.
—2 whensoever, at whatever time.
—3 whenever, as often as. —4 hither and thither.)
