यम्
यम् €1 P. (यच्छति, ययाम, अयंसीत्, यंस्यति, यन्तुम्, यत; <i>desid.</i> यियंसति)
—1 To check, curb, restrain, control, subdue, stop, suppress; यच्छेद्
 वाङ्मनसी प्रज्ञः Kaṭh.; यतचित्तात्मन् Bg. 4. 21; see यत.
—2 To offer, give, bestow.
—3 Ved. To support, sustain.
—4 To raise, lift up.
—5 To extend, stretch.
—6 To go.
—7 To exhibit, show. ━<i>Caus.</i> (यमयति-ते) To restrain, check &c.
