यानम्
यानम् [या भावे-ल्युट्]
—1 Going, moving, walking, riding; as गजयानम्, उष्ट्र˚, रथ˚ &c.
—2 A voyage, journey; समुद्रयानकुशलाः Ms. 8. 157; Y. 1. 84.
—3 Marching against, attacking (one of the six Guṇas or expedients in
 politics); अहितान् प्रत्यभीतस्य रणे यानम् Ak.; Ms. 7. 160.
—4 A procession, train.
—5 A conveyance, vehicle, carriage, chariot; यानं सस्मार कौबेरम्
 R. 15. 45, 13. 69; Ku. 6. 76; Ms. 4. 120.
—6 A litter, palanquin.
—7 A ship, vessel.
—8 (With Buddhists) The method of arriving at knowledge; the means of
 release from repeated births; cf. महायान, हीनयान.
—9 An aeroplane (विमान); Bhāg. 4. 3. 6.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1310-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

