यापनम्
यापन + .{@-नम्, -ना@}
—1 Causing to go away, driving out, expulsion, removal.
—2 Cure or alleviation (of a disease).
—3 Spending or passing time, as in कालयापनम्.
—4 Delay, procrastination.
—5 Support, maintenance; देवतातिथिशेषेण कुरुते देहयापनम् Mb. 3. 260. 6, 12. 213. 17.
—6 Practice, exercise; तत्र न व्यवधातव्यं परोक्षा धर्मयापना
 Mb. 12. 134. 2 (com. धर्मयापना धर्मोपदेशः)
—7 Loitering.
