 सुरद्विषाम् R. 12. 50.
—3 To vanquish, conquer. ━<i>Desid.</i> (युयुत्सते) To wish to fight.
━<i>With</i> {@नि@} to wrestle, box. ━{@प्रति@} to encounter in fight, oppose.
