<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगसिद्धिः|योगसिद्धि
योगः + -सिद्धिः <i>f.</i> achievement in succession <i>i. e.</i> by separate
 performance; पर्यायो योगसिद्धिः ŚB. on MS. ˚न्यायः the rule according
 to which when an act (<i>e. g.</i> दर्शपूर्णमास) is said to yield all
 desired objects, what is meant is that it can yield them only one at a
 time and not all simultaneously. This is established by जैमिनि and
 शबर in MS. 4. 3. 27-28. Thus for the achievement of each separate
 काम, a separate performance of the याग is necessary; (see दर्शपूर्णमासन्याय).
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1318-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

