रशनोपमा
रशना + -उपमा a variety of the figure उपमा; it is ‘a string or series’
 of comparisons, which consists in making the <i>Upameya</i> in the first
 comparison the <i>Upamāna</i> in the second, and so forth; see S. D. 664.
