रसायनम्
रसः + -अयनम्
—1 an elixir of life (elixir vitae), any medicine supposed to prolong
 life and prevent old age; निखिलरसायनमहितो गन्धेनोग्रेण लशुन इव R. G.
—2 (fig.) serving as an elixir vitae, <i>i. e.</i> that which gratifies or
 regales; आनन्दनानि हृदयैकरसायनानि Māl. 6. 8; मनसश्च रसायनानि
 U. 1. 37; श्रोत्र˚, कर्ण˚ &c.
—3 alchemy or chemistry.
—4 any medicinal compound.
—5 butter-milk.
—6 poison.
—7 long pepper.
