रूढिः|रूढि
रूढिः <i>f.</i> [रुह्-क्तिन्]
—1 Growth, germination.
—2 Birth, production.
—3 Increase, development, growth, spread.
—4 Rise, ascent.
—5 Fame, celebrity, notoriety; चक्रधर इति रथाङ्गमदः सततं बिभर्षि
 भुवनेषु रूढये Śi. 15. 26.
—6 A tradition, custom, customary or traditional usage; शास्त्राद् रूढिर्बलीयसी
 ‘custom prevails over precept’.
—7 General prevalence, common currency.
—8 Popular meaning, conventional acceptation of a word; मुख्यार्थबाधे
 तद्योगे रूढितोऽथ प्रयोजनात् K. P. 2; समुदायशक्तिः रूढिः.
—9 Decision.
