लक्ष्मण|लक्ष्मणं|लक्ष्मणः
लक्ष्मण <i>a.</i> [लक्ष्मन्-अण् न वृद्धिः]
—1 Having marks.
—2 Possessed of good or auspicious marks, fortunate, lucky.
—3 Prosperous, thriving.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1353-1" target="_blank">PDF</a>
