<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ललाटूल
ललाटूल <i>a.</i> Having a high or handsome forehead.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1360-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ललाम|ललामं|ललामः
ललाम <i>a.</i> (-मी <i>f.</i>)
—1 Beautiful, lovely, charming.
—2 Having a mark on the forehead marked with a blaze.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1360-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ललामम्
ललाम + .{@-मम्@}
—1 An ornament for the forehead, an ornament or decoration in general;
 (<i>m.</i> also in this sense); सद्यः पुनाति सहचन्द्रललामलोकान् Bhāg. 3. 16. 9;
 अहं तु तामाश्रमललामभूतां शकुन्तलामधिकृत्य ब्रवीमि
 Ś. 2; Śi. 4. 28.
—2 Anything the best of its kind.
—3 A mark on the forehead.
—4 A sign, symbol, mark in general.
—5 A banner, flag.
—6 A row, series, line.
—7 A tail.
—8 A mane.
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1361-1" target="_blank">Page1361-1</a>]
—9 Eminence, dignity, beauty.
—10 A horn.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1360-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ललामः|ललाम|ललामं
ललाम + .{@-मः@} A horse; Mb. 7. 23. 13 (com. ‘श्वेतं ललाटमध्यस्थं तारारूपं हयस्य यत् । ललामं चापि तत्प्राहुर्ललामाश्वस्तदन्वितः ॥’).
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1360-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

