—1 A sower (of seed), planter, husbandman; न शालेः स्तम्बकरिता वप्तुर्गुणमपेक्षते
 Mu. 1. 3; Ms. 3. 142.
—2 A father, procreator.
—3 A poet, an inspired sage. —4 A shaver, cutter.
