वयस्य|वयस्यः
वयस्य <i>a.</i> [वयसा तुल्यः यत्]
—1 Being of the same age.
—2 Contemporary.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1389-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वयस्यः|वयस्य
वयस्य + .{@-स्यः@} A friend, companion, any associate (usually of the same age).
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1389-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वयस्या
वयस्य + .{@-स्या@} A female companion or friend, a womanʼs confidante.
