<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वयोधा
वयोधा <i>a.</i> [वयसि धाञः Uṇ. 4. 236] Ved.
—1 Powerful, vigorous.
—2 Giving strength or health.
—3 Giving food.
