—10 Conduct, behaviour, proceeding.
—11 Wages, salary, hire.
—12 Commerce, traffic.
—13 A spindle.
—14 A globe, ball.
—15 Application of; colouring; निहितमलक्तवर्तनाभिताम्रम् Ki. 10. 42.
—16 An often-told word.
—17 Decoction.
