वर्षगिरिः|वर्षगिरि
वर्षः + -गिरिः, -पर्वतः ‘a Varṣa mountain’, <i>i. e.</i> one of the mountain-ranges
 supposed to separate the different divisions of the world from one another;
 (they are seven:− हिमवान् हेमकूटश्च निषधो मेरुरेव च । चैत्रः कर्णी
 च शृङ्गी च सप्तैते वर्षपर्वताः).
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1398-1" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

