वर्षः + -धरः
—1 a cloud.
—2 a eunuch, an attendant on the womenʼs apartments; (वर्षधर्ष in
 the same sense). See वर्षवर.
—3 the ruler of a Varṣa; वर्षधराभिवादिताभिवन्दितचरणः Bhāg. 5. 3. 16;
 also वर्षप-पति.
—4 a mountain bounding a Varṣa.
