वसन्तोत्सवः|वसन्तोत्सव|वसंतोत्सव
वसन्तः + -उत्सवः the vernal festival, spring-festivities, formerly held
 on the full-moon day of Chaitra, but now on the full-moon day of Phālguna,
 and identified with the <i>Holi</i> festival.
