वार्त्रघ्नीन्यायः
वार्त्रघ्नीन्यायः (Mīmāṃsā) A rule of interpretation according to
 which a detail that cannot properly find connection with the primary or
 main matter should be understood as belonging to a subsidiary thereof.
 This is an exception to the मिथोऽसम्बन्धन्याय (q. v.). This is discussed
 by Jaimini and Śabara at MS. 3. 1. 23.
