 sage, and author of the Rāmāyaṇa; कवीन्दुं नौमि वाल्मीकिं यस्य रामायणीं
 कथाम् । चन्द्रिकामिव चिन्वन्ति चकोरा इव साधवः ॥ Udb. [He was a Brāhmaṇa
 by birth, but being abandoned by his parents in his childhood, he was
 found by some wild mountaineers who taught him the art of thieving. He
