वासकसज्जा
वासक + -सज्जा, -सज्जिका a woman who dresses herself in all her ornaments
 and keeps herself (and her house) ready to receive her lover, especially
 when he has made an appointment with her; an expectant heroine, one of
 the several classes of a Nāyikā; S. D. thus defines her:− कुरुते
 मण्डनं यस्याः (या तु) सज्जिते वासवेश्मनि । सा तु वासकसज्जा स्याद्विदितप्रियसंगमा ॥ 120;
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1420-1" target="_blank">Page1420-1</a>]
 भवति विलम्बिनि विगलितलज्जा विलपति रोदिति वासकसज्जा Gīt. 6.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1419-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

