—1 To doubt, question; एवं कृष्णसखः कृष्णो भ्रात्रा राज्ञा विकल्पितः
 Bhāg. 1. 15. 1.
—2 To consider, reflect upon; सखीनियोगोऽपि विकल्प्यते Ś. 3.
—3 To presume, conjecture.
—4 To prepare or arrange differently.
—5 To make, form.
—6 To exchange.
—7 To admit as optional.
—8 To state a dilemma.
—9 To reflect upon.
