विचर्
विचर् €1 P. To wander about, roam over (oft. with acc.); इष्टान् देशान्
 विचर जलद Me. 117; विचचार दावम् R. 2. 8; Ku. 3. 31.
—2 To do, perform, practise.
—3 To act, deal, behave.
—4 To deviate from the right path, go about wantonly; यन्मे माता प्रलुलुभे
 विचरन्त्यपतिव्रता Ms. 9. 20.
—5 To pass through, pervade.
—6 To attack, march against.
—7 To associate or have intercourse with.
—8 To go badly, fail.
—9 To commit a mistake; हविषि व्यचरत्तेन वषट्कारं गृणन् द्विजः
 Bhāg. 9. 1. 15.
—10 To graze or feed upon. ━<i>Caus.</i>
—1 To think, reflect or meditate upon; विचारमाणस्य विशुद्धभावना
 A. Rām. 7. 5. 45.
—2 To discuss, call in question, debate; आज्ञा गुरूणां ह्यविचारणीया R. 14. 46.
—3 To calculate, estimate, take into account, consider; परेषामात्मनश्चैव
 यो विचार्य बलाबलम् Pt. 3; सुविचार्य यत्कृतम् H. 1. 20.
—4 To hesitate, doubt.
—5 To examine, investigate.
—6 To seduce.
