वितण्डा|वितंडा
वितण्डा
—1 A captious objection, idle carping, a frivolous or fallacious argument
 or controversy (one of the sixteen <i>padārthas</i> or categories in Nyāya
 philosophy); स (जल्पः) प्रतिपक्षस्थापनाहीनो वितण्डा Gaut. S.
—2 Wrangling, captious criticism in general.
—3 A spoon, ladle.
—4 Benzoin.
—5 The oleander plant.
