<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वितत|विततं
वितत <i>p. p.</i>
—1 Spread out, extended, stretched; अमुं यज्ञं विततमेयाय Ch. Up. 1. 10. 7.
—2 Elongated, large, long, broad; विततवपुषा महाहिना Ki. 12. 22;
 भवति विततश्वासोन्नाहप्रणुन्नपयोधरम् Māl. 10. 15.
—3 Performed, accomplished, effected; विततयज्ञः Ś. 7. 34.
—4 Covered.
—5 Diffused.
—6 Gone away; शब्दवेध्यं च विततम् Rām. 1. 5. 20.
—7 Drawn (as a bow string).
—8 Bent (as a bow); (see तन् with वि).
