 Māl. 6. 5; Ki. 17. 61.
—5 A sacrifice, an oblation; वितानेष्वप्येवं तव मम च सोमे विधिरभूत्
 Ve. 6. 30, 3. 16; Śi. 14. 10.
—6 The sacrificial hearth or altar.
—7 Season, opportunity.
—8 Plenty, abundance.
—9 Performance, accomplishment.
