विधा
विधा
—1 Mode, manner, form; मनः प्रत्यक् चित्ते सविधमवधायात्तमरुतः
 Śivamahimna 25.
—2 Kind, sort.
—3 Prosperity, affluence.
—4 The food of elephants, horses &c.
—5 Penetration.
—6 Hire, wages.
—7 Act, action.
—8 Pronunciation.
