 Bhāg. 7. 2. 16.
—2 Insulted, abused, treated with contumely.
—3 Opposed.
—4 Retaliated, requited.
—5 Oppressed, troubled, disturbed.
—6 Irritated, provoked; विप्रकृतः पन्नगः फणां कुरुते Ś. 6. 31.
