—1 Idle or unmeaning talk, prattle, gibberish, nonsense.
—2 Mutual contradiction, contradictory statement; P. I. 3. 50.
—3 A dispute, wrangling.
—4 Violation of oneʼs promise, breaking oneʼs word.
