<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विप्रलभ्
विप्रलभ् €1 Ā.
—1 To cheat, deceive, impose upon.
—2 To recover, regain.
—3 To insult, disrespect.
—4 To violate, disregard.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1452-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
