विफल|विफलं
विफल <i>a.</i>
—1 Fruitless, useless, vain, ineffectual, unprofitable; मम विफलमेतदनुरूपमपि
 यौवनम् Gīt. 7; जगता वा विफलेन किं फलम् R. G.; Śi. 9. 6;
 Ku. 7. 66; Me. 70.
—2 Idle,
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1454-1" target="_blank">Page1454-1</a>]
 unmeaning.
—3 Having no testicles.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1453-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

