विभागः|विभाग
विभागः
—1 Division, partition, apportionment (as of inheritance); समस्तत्र
 विभागः स्यात् Ms. 9. 120, 210; Y. 2. 114.
—2 The share of an inheritance.
—3 A part or share in general.
—4 Division, separation, disjunction (regarded in Nyāya phil. as a Guṇa);
 Ku. 2. 4; तत्त्ववित्तु महाबाहो गुणकर्मविभागयोः Bg. 3. 28.
—5 The numerator of a fraction.
—6 A section.
—7 Arrangement.
