विभ्रम्
विभ्रम् €1. €4 P.
—1 To roam, wander about.
—2 To hover, whirl or wheel round.
—3 To scare away, disperse, scatter about.
—4 To be confused or disordered, be bewildered or perplexed; अनेकचित्तविभ्रान्ता
 मोहजालसमावृताः Bg. 16. 16.
—5 To move about (the tail). ━<i>Caus.</i> To confuse, confound; प्रभामत्तश्चन्द्रो
 जगदिदमहो विभ्रमयति K. P. 10.
