<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विलङ्घनम्
विलङ्घनम्
—1 Transgressing, overstepping.
—2 Of fence, transgression, injury; केवलं न सहते विलङ्घनम् Ki. 13. 55.
—3 (pl.) Fasting, abstension from food.
