 Sportive, playful, dallying, wanton, coquettish;
 विस्रस्तमंसादपरो विलासी R. 6. 14. ━<i>m.</i>
—1 A sensualist, voluptuary, an amorous person; उपमानमभूद्विलासिनां
 करणं यत्तव कान्तिमत्तया Ku. 4. 5.
—2 Fire.
—3 The moon.
—4 A snake.
—5 An epithet of Kṛṣṇa or Viṣṇu.
—6 Of Śiva.
—7 Of the god of love.
