—1 People, subjects; शश्वद्येषु विशामनन्यविषयो रक्षाधिकारः स्थितः Mv. 1. 25.
—2 A daughter; Ms. 3. 148.
—3 Ved. Entrance.
—4 A family, tribe, race.
—5 A settlement, dwelling.
—6 (pl.) Property, wealth.
