विषद्
विषद् P.
—1 To sink down, be exhausted.
—2 To be dispirited or cast down, be afflicted or sorrowful, despond,
 despair; विलपति हसति विषीदति रोदिति चञ्चति मुञ्चति तापम् Gīt. 4;
 बालसूनुरवलोक्य भार्गवं स्वां दशां च विषसाद पार्थिवः R. 11. 67, 9. 75;
 (तं) विषीदन्तमिदं वाक्यमुवाच मधुसूदनः Bg. 2. 1; Bk. 7. 89.
—3 To be afraid. ━<i>Caus.</i>
—1 To cause to despond or despair, discourage.
—2 To make afflicted, pain.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1477-1" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

