विषयिन्
विषयिन् <i>a.</i> Sensual, carnal. ━<i>m.</i>
—1 A man of the world, worldling.
—2 A king.
—3 The god of love.
—4 A sensualist, voluptuary; विषयिणः कस्यापदोऽस्तं गताः Pt. 1. 146; Ś. 5.
—5 (Rhet.) The object of a comparison. ━<i>n.</i>
—1 An organ of sense.
—2 Knowledge (ज्ञान).
