<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विष्टब्ध
विष्टब्ध <i>p. p.</i>
—1 Fixed firmly; well supported.
—2 Propped up, supported.
—3 Obstructed, hindered.
—4 Paralysed, made motionless.
