विष्टम्भः|विष्टम्भ|विष्टंभ|विष्टंभः
विष्टम्भः
—1 Fixing firmly.
—2 Obstruction, hindrance, an impediment.
—3 Obstruction of the urine or ordure, constipation.
—4 Paralysis.
—5 Stopping, staying.
—6 Stepping, placing the feet.
—7 Prop, support.
—8 Endurance, resistance; शीतोष्ण-वर्ष-पवन-विष्टम्भविभिन्नसर्वत्वचः
 Mb. 12. 192. 1.
