<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वीरः|वीर|वीरं
वीर + .{@-रः@}
—1 A hero, warrior, champion; कोऽप्येष संप्रति नवः पुरुषावतारो वीरो
 न यस्य भगवान् भृगुनन्दनोऽपि U. 5. 33.
—2 The sentiment of heroism (in rhetoric); अस्तोकवीरगुरुसाहसमद्भुतं
 च Mv. 1. 6; it is distinguished under four heads; दानवीर, धर्मवीर,
 दयावीर and युद्धवीर; (for explanation see these words s. v.).
—3 An actor.
—4 Fire.
—5 The sacrificial fire.
—6 A son; अस्य कुले वीरो जायते Ch. Up. 3. 13. 6; वीरं मे दत्त
 पितरः Śrāddhamantras.
—7 A husband.
—8 The Arjuna tree.
—9 A Jaina.
—10 The Karavīra tree.
—11 N. of Viṣṇu.
