<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृत्तः|वृत्त|वृत्तं
वृत्त + .{@-त्तः@}
—1 A tortoise.
—2 A kind of grass.
—3 A round temple.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1490-1" target="_blank">PDF</a>
