व्यञ्जकः|व्यञ्जक|व्यंजक
व्यञ्जक + .{@-कः@}
—1 Dramatic action or gesture, external indication of an internal feeling
 by suitable gesticulation.
—2 A sign, symbol.
—3 Figurative expression or insinuation.
.━{@Comp.@}: व्यञ्जकार्थः
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1507-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
