व्यतिरेकः|व्यतिरेक
व्यतिरेकः
—1 Distinction, difference; यथा गन्धस्य भूमंश्च न भावो व्यतिरेकतः
 Bhāg. 3. 27. 18.
—2 Separation from.
—3 Exclusion, exception.
—4 Excellence, surpassing,
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1509-1" target="_blank">Page1509-1</a>]
 excelling.
—5 Contrast, dissimilarity.
—6 (In logic) Logical discontinuance (opp. अन्वय q. v.); यत्र
 साध्याभावस्तत्र हेत्वभाव इति व्यतिरेकव्याप्तिः (<i>e. g.</i> यत्र वह्निर्नास्ति
 तत्र धूमो नास्ति is an instance of व्यतिरेकव्याप्ति).
—7 (In Rhet.) A figure of speech which consists in representing the <i>Upameya</i>
 as superior to the <i>Upamāna</i> in some particular respects; उपमानाद्यदन्यस्य
 व्यतिरेकः स एव सः K. P. 10. (व्यतिरेकेण means ‘except, without’;
 व्यतिरेके ‘on the contrary supposition’.).
.━{@Comp.@}: व्यतिरेकव्याप्ति
