व्यवहितकल्पना
व्यवहित + -कल्पना A mode of construction in which words or phrases which
 are separated from one another by some other
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1513-1" target="_blank">Page1513-1</a>]
 intervening words, phrases or sentences are construed together as forming
 a sentence. This mode is as a general rule not admissible and is worse
 than even लक्षणा (see व्यवधान); सत्रविश्वजित्सम्बन्धे व्यवहितकल्पना
 स्यात् ŚB. on MS. 6. 4. 33, 7. 4. 10.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1512-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवधारणकल्पना
व्यवधारणकल्पना <i>f.</i> A mode of interpreting a sentence where
 words or expressions connected with one another are treated as being not
 so connected, disconnecting what is connected; ŚB. on MS. 1. 2. 1; सैषा
 व्यवधारणकल्पना । तमस्मै भक्षं प्रयच्छेत् तमस्मै भक्षं कुर्यादित्यर्थः
 ŚB. on MS. 3. 5. 48.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1513-1" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

