—5 Endeavouring, resolving.
—6 Persevering, energetic.
—7 Cheated, deceived.
—8 Convinced, sure (of anything); सम्यग्व्यवसिता बुद्धिस्तव राजर्षिसत्तम
 Bhāg. 10. 1. 15.
