व्यवहारः + -पादः
—1 any one of the four stages of a legal proceeding; these are four:− (1)
 पूर्वपक्ष, the plaint; (2) उत्तरपक्ष, the defence; (3) क्रियापाद,
 adducing evidence, oral or written; (4) निर्णयपाद, the decision or verdict.
