व्याजोक्तिः|व्याजोक्ति
व्याजः + -उक्तिः <i>f.</i>
—1 a figure of speech in which what is apparently the effect of one cause
 is intentionally ascribed to another; in other words, where a feeling
 is dissembled by being attributed to a different cause; see K. P. 10 under व्याजोक्ति.
—2 covert allusion, insinuation.
