व्यापिन्
व्यापिन् <i>a.</i>
—1 Pervading, filling, occupying (at the end of comp.).
—2 All-pervading, co-extensive, invariably concomitant.
—3 Covering. ━<i>m.</i>
—1 An epithet of Viṣṇu.
—2 A pervading property.
