शंसित|शंसितः
शंसित <i>p. p.</i> [शंस्-क्त]
—1 Praised, extolled.
—2 Told, said, spoken, declared.
—3 Wished, desired.
—4 Ascertained, established, determined.
—5 Falsely accused, calumniated.
—6 Observed (अनुष्टित); इदं शास्त्रमधीयानो ब्राह्मणः शंसितव्रतः Ms. 1. 104.
