शंसिन्
शंसिन् <i>a.</i> (Usually at the end of comp.)
—1 Praising.
—2 Telling, announcing, communicating; प्रजावती
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1525-1" target="_blank">Page1525-1</a>]
