शद्
शद् I. €1 P. (but Ā. in conjugational tenses) (शीयते, शन्न)
—1 To fall, perish, decay, wither.
—2 To go. ━<i>Caus.</i> (शादयति-ते)
—1 To cause to go, impel.
—2 (शातयति-ते)
——(<i>a</i>) To fell, throw down, cut down; किं भूभृत्कटकस्थितिव्यसनिना
 व्यर्थ खुराः शातिताः Subhāṣ.; Śi. 14. 80, 15. 24.
——(<i>b</i>) To kill, destroy. ━II. €1 P. (शदति) To go (usually with आ).
