शन्तनुः|शन्तनु|शंतनु|शंतनुः
शन्तनुः N. of a king of the lunar race. He married Gaṅgā and Satyavatī;
 by the former wife he had a son named Bhīṣma, and by the latter Chitrāṅgada
 and Vicitravīrya. Bhīṣma remained a celibate all his life, and his
 younger brothers died childless; cf. भीष्म.
