शम्
शम् <i>ind.</i> A particle meaning welfare, happiness, prosperity, health,
 and generally used to express a blessing or pious wish, (with dat. or
 gen.); शं देवदत्ताय or देवदत्तस्य (often used in modern letters
 as an auspicious conclusion; इति शम्).
.━{@Comp.@}: शङ्कर, शन्तम, शन्ताति, शम्पाकः, शम्पातः, शम्भु
