शाकः|शाक|शाकं
शाकः, -कम् + .{@-कः@}
—1 Power, strength, energy.
—2 The teak tree.
—3 The Śirīṣa tree; यस्मिन् शाको नाम महीरुहः Bhāg. 5. 20. 24.
—4 N. of a people; see शक.
—5 An era; especially the era of Śālivāhana.
—6 N. of the sixth Dvīpa.
