शीर्षन्
शीर्षन् <i>n.</i> The head. (This word has no forms for the first five
 inflections, and is optionally substituted for शिरस् or शीर्ष
 after acc. dual); नाभ्यां कोष्ठेष्ववस्थाप्य हृदुरःकण्ठशीर्षणि Bhāg. 4. 23. 14;
