शुभ्
शुभ् I. €1 Ā. (शोभते)
—1 To shine, be splendid, look beautiful or handsome; सुष्ठु शोभसे एतेन
 विनयमाहात्म्येन U. 1; R. 8. 6.
—2 To appear to advantage; सुखं हि दुःखान्यनुभूय शोभते Mk. 1. 10.
—3 To suit, become, befit (with gen.); रामभद्र इत्येवोपचारः शोभते
 तातपरिजनस्य U. 1.
—4 To be gay or happy.
—5 To be victorious. ━II. €6 P. (शुभति) To shine; L. D. B. ━<i>Caus.</i>
 (शोभयति-ते) To decorate, adorn, grace. ━<i>With</i> {@परि, वि@} to shine, look splendid.
