शृध् I. €1 Ā. (but Paras. also in the Second Future, Aorist and Conditional)
 (शर्धते) To break wind downwards. ━II. €1 U. (शर्धति-ते)
—1 To moisten, wet.
—2 To cut off. ━III. €10 U. (शर्धयति-ते)
—1 To strive.
—2 To take, grasp.
—3 To insult (as by breaking wind), mock, ridicule.
