श्रथ्
श्रथ् I. €1. €9 P. (श्रथति, श्रथ्नाति) To hurt, injure, kill.
━II. €1 P., €10 U. (श्रथति, श्राथयति-ते)
—1 To hurt, kill.
—2 To untie, loosen, liberate, release. ━III. €10 U. (श्रथयति-ते)
—1 To make efforts, be occupied or busy.
—2 To be weak or infirm.
—3 To be glad.
