स|सं|सः
स <i>ind.</i> A prefix substituted for सह or सम्, सम, तुल्य,
 or सदृश and एक or समान, and compounded with nouns to
 form adjectives and adverbs in the sense of
——(<i>a</i>) with, together with, along with, accompanied by, having, possessed
 of; सपुत्र, सभार्य, सतृष्ण, सधन, सरोषम्, सकोपम्, सहरि &c.;
——(<i>b</i>) similar, like; सधर्मन् ‘of a similar nature’; so सजाति, सवर्ण;
——(<i>c</i>) same; सोदर, सपक्ष, सपिण्ड, सनाभि &c. ━<i>m.</i>
—1 A snake.
—2 Air, wind.
—3 A bird.
—4 Short name for the musical note षड्ज q. v.
—5 N. of Śiva.
—6 Of Viṣṇu.
—7 (In prosody) A foot consisting of two short syllables followed by a long one.
—8 God; L. D. B.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1585-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

