संसक्त|संसक्तः
संसक्त <i>p. p.</i>
—1 Adhered or stuck together.
—2 Adhering or clinging to, attached to, sticking close to.
—3 Joined or linked together, closely connected; प्रान्तेषु संसक्तनमेरुशाखम्
 Ku. 3. 43; R. 7. 24.
—4 Near, contiguous, adjoining.
—5 Confused, mixed, mingled, blended;
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1594-1" target="_blank">Page1594-1</a>]
 मदमुखरमयूरीमुक्तसंसक्तकेकः Māl. 9. 5; कलिन्दकन्या मथुरां
 गताऽपि गङ्गोर्मिसंसक्तजलेव भाति R. 6. 48; Māl. 5. 11.
—6 Intent on.
—7 Endowed with, possessed of.
—8 Fastened, restrained.
—9 Given to the mundane pleasures.
—10 Enamoured.
