—4 Intercourse, familiarity.
—5 Copulation, sexual union; नानागन्धर्वमिथुनैः पानसंसर्गकर्कशैः
 Rām. 4. 67. 45; प्रत्याहारेण संसर्गान् ध्यानेनानीश्वरान् गुणान् Ms. 6. 72.
—6 Co-existence, intimate relation.
—7 Confusion.
—8 A particular conjunction of celestial bodies.
—9 A particular combination of two humours which produces diseases.
—10 Point of intersection.
—11 Duration; Mb. 3.
