—3 A narrow road, defile, difficult passage.
—4 Entrance, gate.
—5 The body.
—6 Killing.
—7 Development. ━<i>a.</i> Going about, moving everywhere; अनिरुक्तस्त्रयोदशः
 स्तोभः संचरो हुंकारः Ch. Up. 1. 13. 3.
