संजयः|सञ्जय|संजय
संजयः
—1 Conquest, victory.
—2 A kind of military array.
—3 N. of the charioteer of king Dhṛtarāṣṭra. He tried to bring about
 a peaceful settlement of the dispute between the Kauravas and Pāṇḍavas,
 but failed. It was he who narrated the events of the great Bhāratī war
 to the blind king Dhṛtarāṣṭra; cf. धर्मक्षेत्रे कुरुक्षेत्रे समवेता
 युयुत्सवः । मामकाः पाण्डवाश्चैव किमकुर्वत संजय ॥ Bg. 1. 1.
