सत् + -प्रतिपक्षः (in logic) one of the five kinds of <i>hetvābhāsas</i>
 or fallacious <i>hetus</i>, a counter-balanced <i>hetu</i>, one along which
 there exists another equal <i>hetu</i> on the opposite side; यत्र साध्याभावसाधकं
 हेत्वन्तरं स सत्प्रतिपक्षः; <i>e. g.</i> ‘sound is eternal because it is audible’
; and also ‘sound is non-eternal, because it is a product’;
