सती
सती
—1 A virtuous or good woman (or wife); सती सती योगविसृष्टदेहा Ku. 1. 21;
 Ki. 11. 50; esp. applied to one who burns herself with her husbandʼs corpse.
—2 A female ascetic.
—3 N. of the goddess Durgā or Pārvatī; पर्यस्तं नन्दया सत्या स्नानपुण्यतरोदया ।
 विलोक्य भूतेशगिरिम् Bhāg. 4. 6. 22; Ku. 1. 21.
—4 A kind of fragrant earth.
—5 A wife or female (of an animal).
