सतीर्थः|सतीर्थ
सतीर्थः, सतीर्थ्यः A fellow religious student, (a pupil
 of the same preceptor); यमात्मनः सतीर्थ्यं पितैव ते जानीते योऽसौ यादृशश्चेति
 Māl. 2. According to Pāṇini (VI. 3. 87)
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1613-1" target="_blank">Page1613-1</a>]
 the latter word alone is correct. शब्दरत्नावली, however, says, “स्यात्
 सतीर्थः सतीर्थ्योऽपि तथैकगुरुरित्यपि.” Bohtlingk and Wackernagel
 say that the word सतीर्थ is approved to be correct by Vopadeva. But
 this is wrong because मुग्धबोधव्याकरण accepts सतीर्थ्य alone to be correct.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1612-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सतीर्थ्यः|सतीर्थ्य
सतीर्थः, सतीर्थ्यः A fellow religious student, (a pupil
 of the same preceptor); यमात्मनः सतीर्थ्यं पितैव ते जानीते योऽसौ यादृशश्चेति
 Māl. 2. According to Pāṇini (VI. 3. 87)
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1613-1" target="_blank">Page1613-1</a>]
 the latter word alone is correct. शब्दरत्नावली, however, says, “स्यात्
 सतीर्थः सतीर्थ्योऽपि तथैकगुरुरित्यपि.” Bohtlingk and Wackernagel
 say that the word सतीर्थ is approved to be correct by Vopadeva. But
 this is wrong because मुग्धबोधव्याकरण accepts सतीर्थ्य alone to be correct.
