सत्यंकारः
—1 Making true or good, ratification of a contract or bargain.
—2 Earnest money, advance payment, something given in advance as an earnest
 for the performance of a contract; उपाधत्त सपत्नेषु कृष्णाया गुरुसंनिधौ ।
 भावमानयने सत्याः सत्यंकारमिवान्तकः ॥ Ki. 11. 50.
—3 A promise.
