सत्रन्यायः
सत्र + -न्यायः the rule that at a सत्र, which is performed by several
 स्वामिन्s together, a प्रतिनिधि is admissible for a स्वामिन् if
 and when one of the स्वामिन्s commencing the सत्र is lost or dead
 before the completion of the सत्र. This is discussed and established
 by Jaimini and Śabara at MS. 6. 3. 22.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1615-1" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

