संदंशः
—1 A pair of tongs; अयस्मयैरग्निपिण्डैः संदंशैस्त्वचि निष्कुषन्ति
 Bhāg. 5. 26. 19.
—2 Too great compression of the teeth in the pronunciation of vowels (or letters).
—3 N. of those parts of the body used for grasping.
—4 N. of a hell.
—5 A chapter or section of a book.
—6 The side of a village.
