संदेहः|सन्देह|संदेह|सन्देहः
संदेहः
—1 Doubt, uncertainty, suspense; अत्र कः संदेहः.
—2 Risk, danger, peril; जीवितसंदेहदोलामारोपितः K.; अर्थार्जने
 प्रवृत्तिः ससंदेहा H. 1; Pt. 1. 176.
—3 (In Rhet.) Doubt regarded as a figure of speech, in which the close
 resemblance between two objects leads to one of them being mistaken for
 the other (this figure is also called ससंदेह by Mammaṭa and others);
 ससंदेहस्तु भेदोक्तौ तदनुक्तौ च संशयः K. P. 10; <i>e. g.</i> see
 Māl. 1. 2 (1. 3); V. 3. 2.
—4 Conglomeration of material elements (of the body).
.━{@Comp.@}: संदेहालंकारः, संदेहदोला, संदेहपद
