सभा
सभा [सह भान्ति अभीष्टनिश्चयार्थमेकत्र यत्र गृहे Tv.]
—1 An assembly, a council, conclave; पण्डितसभां कारितवान् Pt. 1;
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1627-2" target="_blank">Page1627-2</a>]
 न सा सभा यत्र न सन्ति वृद्धाः H. 1.
—2 Company, society, meeting, large number.
—3 Council-chamber or hall; ततः सभां करिष्यामि पाण्डवस्य यशस्विनीम्
 Mb. 2. 3. 4, 12. 47. 7.
—4 A court of justice.
—5 A public audience (modern <i>levee</i>).
—6 A gambling-house.
—7 Any room or place much frequented.
—8 A house for lodging travellers (धर्मशाला).
—9 An eating house.
