समाधानम्
समाधानम्
—1 Putting together, uniting.
—2 Fixing the mind in abstract contemplation on the true nature of spirit;
 बिभ्रत्यात्मसमाधानतपःस्वाध्यायसंयमैः Bhāg. 12. 11. 24.
—3 Profound or abstract meditation, deep contemplation.
—4 Intentness.
—5 Steadiness, composure, peace (as of mind), satisfaction; चित्तस्य
 समाधानम्; समाधानं बुद्धेः G. L. 18.
—6 Clearing up a doubt, replying to the Pūrvapakṣa; answering an objection.
—7 Agreeing, promising.
—8 (In drama) A leading incident which unexpectedly gives rise to the whole plot.
—9 Justification of a statement, proof.
—10 Reconciliation.
—11 Eagerness.
.━{@Comp.@}: समाधानरूपकम्
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1633-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाधानरूपकम्
समाधानम् + -रूपकम् a kind of metaphor (used for the justification of a bold assertion).
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1633-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
