समाहारः|समाहार
समाहारः
—1 A collection, an aggregate, assemblage; Māl. 9; ततः कपिसमाहारमेकनिश्चायमागतम् Bk. 7. 34.
—2 Composition of words.
—3 Conjunction of words or sentences.
—4 A subdivision of <i>Dvandva</i> and <i>Dvigu</i> compounds expressing an
 aggregate (as त्रिभुवनम्).
—5 Abridgment, contraction, conciseness.
—6 Combination of two letters of the alphabet into a syllable (= प्रत्याहार q. v.).
