समुत्था
समुत्था €1 P.
—1 To stand up, rise.
—2 To rise from death or insensibility, return to life or consciousness.
—3 To rise together with.
—4 To arise or spring from. ━<i>Caus.</i>
—1 To raise up, lift up, elevate.
—2 To revive, restore to life.
