समुत्थ|समुत्थः
समुत्थ <i>a.</i>
—1 Rising, getting up.
—2 Sprung or produced from, born from (at the end of comp.); इच्छाद्वेषसमुत्थेन
 Bg. 7. 27; अथ नयनसमुत्थं ज्योतिरत्रेरिव द्योः R. 2. 75.
—3 Occurring, occasioned.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1640-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
