—2 A peculiar system of religious teaching, a religious doctrine inculcating
 the worship of one peculiar deity.
—3 An established custom, usage.
—4 Gift (संप्रदान); दिव्यास्त्रसंप्रदायोऽयं लक्ष्मणेन सहास्तु
 मे Mv. 1. 47. (Also cf. U. 2. 7/8.)
