—4 Suited, fitted, adequate, fit.
—5 Possible.
—6 Derived, produced, got; Māl. 5.
—7 Satisfied.
—8 Expected; अवसीदति यत्सुरैरपि त्वयि संभावितवृत्ति पौरुषम् Ki. 2. 7.
