सरस्वती
सरस्वती
—1 N. of the goddess of speech and learning, and represented as the wife
 of Brahman; परस्परविरोधिन्योरेकसंश्रयदुर्लभम् । संगतं श्रीसरस्वत्योर्भूतयेऽस्तु
 सदा सताम् ॥ V. 5. 24.
—2 Speech, voice, words; इति देहविमुक्तये स्थितां
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1654-2" target="_blank">Page1654-2</a>]
 रतिमाकाशभवा सरस्वती … अन्वकम्पयत् Ku. 4. 39, 43; R. 15. 46.
—3 N. of a river (which is lost in the sands of the great desert).
—4 A river in general.
—5 A cow; ŚB. on MS. 10. 3. 49; Vāj. 8. 43.
—6 An excellent woman.
—7 N. of Durgā.
—8 N. of a female divinity peculiar to the Buddhists.
—9 The Soma plant.
—10 The plant called ज्योतिष्मती.
