सहस्
सहस् <i>a.</i> Powerful, mighty; भीष्मो हि देवः सहसः सहीयान्
 Bhāg. 11. 23. 48. ━<i>m.</i> [सह्-असि]
—1 The month called Mārgaśīrṣa; Śi. 6. 57, 16. 47; सहसि तत्र
 समृद्धिमुपागते Rām. Ch. 4. 83; Bhāg. 12. 11. 41.
—2 The winter season. ━<i>n.</i>
—1 Power, might, strength.
—2 Force, violence.
—3 Victory, conquering.
—4 Lustre, brightness.
—5 Water.
