साकमेधीयन्यायः
साकमेधीयन्यायः The rule according to which an ectype (विकृति)
 sets aside a detail of its archetype (प्रकृतिधर्म) if it conflicts
 with some detail (धर्म) which is expressly enjoined with reference
 to it. This is discussed and established by Jaimini and Śabara in MS. 5. 1. 19-22.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1663-1" target="_blank">PDF</a>
