साधन|साधनं
साधन <i>a.</i> (-नी <i>f.</i>)
 [साध् णिच् ल्यु ल्युट् वा]
—1 Accomplishing, effecting &c.
—2 Procuring.
—3 Conjuring up (a spirit).
—4 Denoting, expressive of.
