साधनता
साधनता, -त्वम्
—1 The state of having means, possession of means to accomplish a desired
 object; प्रतिकूलतामुपगते हि विधौ विफलत्वमेति बहुसाधनता Śi. 9. 6.
—2 The state of perfection.
—3 The being a proof or argument; Kull. on Ms. 8. 56.
