साधित|साधितः
साधित <i>p. p.</i>
—1 Accomplished, effected, achieved.
—2 Completed, finished.
—3 Proved, demonstrated.
—4 Obtained, secured.
—5 Discharged.
—6 Overcome, subdued.
—7 Made good, recovered.
—8 Fined.
—9 Made to pay.
—10 Awarded (as fine or punishment).
