सान्द्र|सांद्र|सान्द्रं|सान्द्रः
सान्द्र <i>a.</i>
—1 Close, compact, having no interstices.
—2 Coarse, gross, thick, dense; दुर्वर्णभित्तिरिह सान्द्रसुधासवर्णा
 Śi. 4. 28, 64, 9. 15; R. 7. 41; Ṛs. 1. 20.
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1669-1" target="_blank">Page1669-1</a>]
—3 Clustered together, collected.
—4 Stout, strong, robust.
—5 Excessive, abundant, much; सान्द्रानन्दक्षुभितहृदयप्रस्रबेणावसिक्तः U. 6. 22.
—6 Intense, strong, vehement; व्याप्तान्तराः सान्द्रकुतूहलानाम् R. 7. 11;
 Śi. 9. 37.
—7 Unctuous, oily, viscid.
—8 Bland, soft, smooth.
—9 Pleasing, agreeable.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1668-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

