—3 The means of attaining the future world.
—4 Inquiry into the future; यस्य प्रमाणं भृगवः सांपराये Bhāg. 8. 19. 2.
—5 Inquiry, investigation.
—6 Uncertainty.
—7 A helper; Mb. 1. 3. 58.
—8 Need, distress, calamity; उक्तपूर्वं कुतो राजन् सांपराये स वक्ष्यति Mb. 1. 48. 11.
