सार्ष्टिता
सार्ष्टिता
—1 Equality in rank, condition, or power; देवतानां सलोकतां सार्ष्टितां
 सायुज्यं गच्छति Ch. Up. 2. 20. 2.
—2 Equality with the Supreme Being in power and all the divine attributes,
 the last of the four states or grades of <i>Mukti</i>; ब्रह्मदो ब्रह्मसार्ष्टितां
 (प्राप्नोति) Ms. 4. 232.
