 Rām. Ch. 5. 22; आकाशमार्गेऽभिकुलायसालं मन्दं विचेलुर्मधुरं रुवन्तः
 <i>ibid.</i> 6. 4.
—3 A rampart, a fence or wall round a building.
—4 A wall in general.
—5 A kind of fish. (For compounds see under शाल).
