सुभग|सुभगः
सु + -भग <i>a.</i>
—1 very fortunate or prosperous, happy, blessed, highly favoured.
—2 lovely, charming, beautiful, pretty; न तु ग्रीष्मस्यैवं सुभगमपराद्धं
 युवतिषु Ś. 3. 9; Ku. 4. 34; R. 11. 80; Māl. 9.
—3 pleasant, grateful, agreeable, sweet; दिवसाः सुभगादित्याश्छायासलिलदुर्भगाः
 Rām. 3. 16. 10; श्रवणसुभग M. 3. 4; Ś. 1. 3.
—4 beloved, liked, amiable, dear; सुमुखि सुभगः पश्यन् स त्वामुपैतु
 कृतार्थताम् Gīt. 5.
—5 illustrious.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

