—3 Virtuous, pious.
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-2" target="_blank">Page1691-2</a>]
—4 Taking delight in, favourable to; Ś. 7. 18.
—5 Easy, practicable; श्रेयांसि लब्धुमसुखानि विनान्तरायैः Ki. 5. 49.
—6 Fit, suitable.
