सूचकः|सूचक
सूचक + .{@-कः@}
—1 A piercer.
—2 A needle, any instrument for perforating or sewing.
—3 An informer, a tale-bearer, traducer, spy; नृपं संसूचयेत् ज्ञात्वा
 सूचकः स उदाहृतः Śukra. 4. 589.
—4 A narrator, teacher, an instructor.
—5 The manager or chief actor of a company.
—6 A Buddha.
—7 A <i>Siddha</i>.
—8 A villain, scoundrel.
—9 A demon, goblin.
—10 A dog.
—11 A crow.
—12 A cat.
—13 A kind of fine rice.
