सूचिः|सूचि
सूचिः, -ची <i>f.</i>
 [सूच्-इन् वा ङीप्]
—1 Piercing, perforating.
—2 A needle; निमेषादपि कौन्तेय यस्यायुरपचीयते । सूच्येबाञ्जनचूर्णस्य
 किमिति प्रतिपालयेत् ॥ Mb. 3. 35. 3.
—3 Sharp point or pointed blade (as of Kuśa grass); अभिनवकुशसूच्या
 परिक्षतं मे चरणम् Ś. 1; so मुखे कुशसूचिविद्धे Ś. 4. 13.
—4 The sharp point or tip of anything; कः करं प्रसारयेत् पन्नगरत्नसूचये Ku. 5. 43.
—5 The point of a bud.
—6 A kind of
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1697-1" target="_blank">Page1697-1</a>]
 military array, a sharp column or file; दण्डव्यहेन तन्मार्गं यायात्
 तु शकटेन वा । वराहमकराभ्यां वा सूच्या वा गरुडेन वा Ms. 7. 187.
—7 A triangle formed by the sides of a trapezium produced till they meet.
—8 A cone, pyramid.
—9 Indication by gesture, communicating by signs, gesticulation.
—10 A particular mode of dancing.
—11 Dramatic action.
—12 An index, a table of contents.
—13 A list, catalogue.
—14 The earthʼs disc in computing eclipses (in astr.).
—15 A rail or balustrade.
—16 A small door-bolt.
—17 A kind of coitus.
