सौप्तिकपर्वन्
सौप्तिक + -पर्वन् <i>n.</i> N. of the tenth <i>parvan</i> or book of the Mahābhārata
[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1708-2" target="_blank">Page1708-2</a>]
 which relates how Aśvatthāman, Kṛtavarman and Kṛpa-the only surviving
 Kuru warriors-attacked by night the Pāṇḍava-camp and slaughtered thousands
 of warriors while asleep.
