—11 War, battle.
—12 A king.
—13 An agreement.
—14 A road, way; Mb. 3.
—15 A wise or learned man.
—16 A heron.
—17 Articles used at the coronation of a king.
—18 A part (अंश); तदवध्यानविस्रस्तपुण्यस्कन्धस्य भूरिदः Bhāg. 11. 23. 10.
