<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थाणव
स्थाणव <i>a.</i>
—1 Relating to स्थाणुः.
—2 Coming from the trunks or stems of trees; Hc.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1719-2" target="_blank">PDF</a>
