स्थानकम्
स्थानकम् [स्थान स्वार्थे क]
—1 A position, situation.
—2 A particular point or situation in dramatic action; <i>e. g.</i> पताकास्थानक
 q. v.; स्थानकेन अवलोक्य V. 4. 44/45; it may also mean ‘a kind of posture’.
—3 A city, town.
—4 A basin.
—5 Froth, a kind of scum on spirits or wine.
—6 A mode of recitation.
—7 A division or section of the Taittirīya, a branch of the <i>Yajurveda</i>.
—8 A temple in which the idol is kept in an erect posture.
—9 The attitude of the body (in shooting &c.).
