स्थानिन्
स्थानिन् <i>a.</i> [स्थानमस्यास्ति रक्ष्यत्वेन इनि]
—1 Having a place.
—2 Having fixedness, permanent. —3 Having a substitute. ━<i>m.</i>
—1 The original form or primitive element, that for which anything else
 is substituted; स्थानिवदादेशोऽनल्विधौ P. I. 1. 56.
—2 The form so substituted for anything.
—3 That which has a place, or is actually expressed.
