स्थूल|स्थूलं|स्थूलः
स्थूल <i>a.</i> (compar. स्थवीयस् superl. स्थविष्ठ)
—1 Large, great, big, bulky, huge; बहुस्पृशापि स्थूलेन स्थीयते बहिरश्मवत्
 Śi. 2. 78 (where it has sense 6 also); स्थूलहस्तावलेपान् Me. 14, 108; R. 6. 28.
—2 Fat, corpulent, stout.
—3 Strong, powerful; स्थूलं स्थूलं श्वसिति K. ‘breathes hard’.
—4 Thick, clumsy.
—5 Gross, coarse, rough (fig. also) as in स्थूलमानम् q. v.
—6 Foolish, doltish, silly, ignorant.
—7 Stolid, dull, thick-headed.
—8 Not exact.
—9 (In phil.) Material (opp. to सूक्ष्म).
