—2 Fat, thick, big, large, bulky.
—3 Many, numerous, much, copious, plentiful, abundant.
—4 Delighted, joyful.
—5 Pure; मृद्वीका रसिता सिता समशिता स्फीतं निपीतं पयः Bv. 4. 13.
—6 Successful, prosperous, thriving.
—7 Affected by hereditary disease.
