स्वदितम्
स्वदित + .{@-तम्@} An exclamation meaning ‘may it be well tasted or relished’,
 uttered at a Śrāddha^1 ceremony after the presentation of rice-balls or
 oblations of food to the Manes; पृष्ट्वा स्वदितमित्येवं तृप्तानाचामयेत्ततः
 Ms. 3. 251, 254.
[1] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20260506. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/209.
