ह|हं|हः
ह <i>ind.</i> An emphatic particle used to lay stress on the preceding
 word and translatable by ‘verily’, ‘indeed’, ‘certainly’, &c.; but it
 is often used expletively without any particular signification, especially
 in Vedic literature; तस्य ह शतं जाया बभूवुः; तस्य ह पर्वतनारदौ
 गृह ऊषतुः &c. Ait. Br.; द्वया ह प्राजापत्या देवाश्चासुराश्च Bṛ. Up. 1. 3. 1.
 It is sometimes used as a vocative particle and rarely of
 disdain or laughter.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1745-1" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

