हण्डा|हंडा
हण्डा <i>ind.</i> A vocative particle used in addressing a female of
 inferior rank, or by equals of the lowest caste in addressing each other;
 हण्डे हञ्जे हलाह्वाने नीचां चेटीं सखीं प्रति Ak. ━<i>f.</i>
—1 A large earthen vessel (?).
—2 A low caste female; cf. हञ्जा.
