 Ku. 3. 40, 67, 1. 50; Me. 7.
—2 N. of Agni or fire.
—3 An ass.
—4 A divisor.
—5 The denominator of a fraction.
—6 The act of seizing, taking.
—7 A seizer, ravisher.
