हु
हु €3 P. (जुहोति, हुत; <i>pass.</i> हूयते; <i>caus.</i>
 हावयति-ते; <i>desid.</i> जुहूषति)
—1 To offer or present (as oblation to fire); make an offering to or in
 honour of a deity (with acc.); sacrifice; यो मन्त्रपूतां तनुमप्यहौषीत्
 R. 13. 45; जटाधरः सन् जुहुधीह पावकम् Ki. 1. 44; हविर्जुहुधि
 पावकम् Bk. 20. 11; Ms. 3. 87; Y. 1. 99.
—2 To perform a sacrifice. —3 To eat.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1761-1" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हुत|हुतं|हुतः
हुत <i>p. p.</i> [हु-क्त]
—1 Offered as an oblation to fire, burnt as a sacrificial offering; हुतं
 च दत्तं च तथैव तिष्ठति Karṇabhāra 1. 22.
—2 One to whom an oblation is offered; Ś. 4; R. 2. 71.
