होमः|होम
होमः [हु-मन्]
—1 Offering oblations to gods by throwing ghee into the consecrated fire,
 (one of the five daily Yajñas, to be performed by a Brāhmaṇa, called
 देवयज्ञ q. v.); इष्टिर्यागः । स एवासेचनाधिको होमः ŚB. on MS. 6. 8. 7.
—2 A burnt offering.
—3 A sacrifice; R. 3. 38; Mb. 12. 165. 26.
